msgstr "我不太想知道那種氣味是怎麼來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.CAN_PROCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.CAN_PROCESS"
