msgstr "我要在口袋裡裝一點光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
