#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "It's all under wraps for now."
msgstr "目前一切都處於保密狀態。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
