msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER"
msgid "What a wascally Wobster."
msgstr "好一隻調皮的龍蝦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD"
msgid "You should cook up nicely."
msgstr "這烹飪出來應該挺不錯的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBSTER_SHELLER_DEAD_COOKED"
msgid "I can't wait to eat you."
msgstr "我等不及要吃了你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.1"
msgid "What in the name of science have you been feeding her?"
msgstr "你以科學的名義給她喂了什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYBIG.2"
msgid "What in the name of science have you been feeding her?"
msgstr "你以科學的名義給她喂了什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.1"
msgid "It's a scientific fact that petting a good dog will improve your day."
msgstr "科學證明，餵養寵物狗能夠顯著改善心情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBYSMALL.2"
msgid "It's a scientific fact that petting a good dog will improve your day."
msgstr "科學證明，餵養寵物狗能夠顯著改善心情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOBY_TREAT"
msgid "I think I'm barking up the wrong tree with this snack."
msgstr "這個零食恐怕不是給人吃的吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.ATTACKER"
msgid "Let's not start a fight with the strongman..."
msgstr "不要和強者挑起戰鬥..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You can't actually \"fight\" fire, %s!"
msgstr "你是沒法打倒火的，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GENERIC"
msgid "It's good to see you, %s!"
msgstr "很高興見到你，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.GHOST"
msgid "I told you you couldn't deadlift that boulder. The numbers were all wrong."
msgstr "我跟你說過不要硬拉那個大石頭了。數值都不對。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! I can take you!"
msgstr "謀殺犯！我能抓到你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is just a big teddy bear."
msgstr "%s只是一隻巨型泰迪熊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOLFGANG_WHISTLE"
msgid "It gives me terrible flashbacks to the gym classes of my youth..."
msgstr "它讓我回憶起了小時候糟糕的體育課……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Hey, stop monkeying around!"
msgstr "嘿，別像猴子一樣胡鬧了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I wonder if this is how the dinosaurs felt."
msgstr "恐龍當時是不是就是這種感覺？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a monkey."
msgstr "是只猴子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.GHOST"
msgid "That's one spooky monkey."
msgstr "那只猴子真嚇人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.MURDERER"
msgid "They've gone ape!"
msgstr "它們發猴瘋了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WONKEY.REVIVER"
msgid "My life has been saved... by a monkey?"
msgstr "我的命居然是……猴子救的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODCARVEDHAT"
msgid "It looks like it's been lovingly carved."
msgstr "看起來像是經過精心雕刻的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been a bit of a sap lately..."
msgstr "%s最近有點活力..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVER"
msgid "%s's gone on a wood chucking rampage!"
msgstr "%s在瘋狂的砍樹，根本停不下來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
msgid "Will you bea-very mad if I don't revive you, %s?"
msgstr "%s，如果我不復活你，你會生氣嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Don't burn yourself out, %s."
msgstr "%s，別把自己燒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GHOST"
msgid "Does \"universal\" coverage include the void, %s?"
msgstr "%s，“宇宙”包括虛無嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSE"
msgid "Take a gander at that!"
msgstr "瞧瞧這玩意！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.GOOSEGHOST"
msgid "Be more careful, you silly goose!"
msgstr "以後長點心，你這頭蠢鵝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSE"
msgid "Gad-zooks, that's a moose!"
msgstr "天老爺啊，這是一頭鹿！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MOOSEGHOST"
msgid "That moose'nt be very comfortable."
msgstr "那一定很不舒服吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.MURDERER"
msgid "Murderer! Bring me an axe and let's get in the swing of things!"
msgstr "兇手！來把斧子，我們砍起來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.REVIVER"
msgid "%s saved everyone's backbacon."
msgstr "%s救下了大家的培根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.BURNT"
msgid "I wouldn't like to sit on that."
msgstr "我可不想坐上去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd like to sit on that!"
msgstr "我想坐上去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Somebody else is sitting on that."
msgstr "別人在坐著。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.BURNT"
msgid "I don't think I'll be using it anymore."
msgstr "以後用不了了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "I use tables periodically."
msgstr "我週期性地使用桌子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WOOD_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "I use tables periodically."
msgstr "我週期性地使用桌子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.DIRT"
msgid "Just looks like a pile of dirt."
msgstr "看起來就像一堆土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.PLANT"
msgid "Seems safe to me."
msgstr "我覺得挺安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM.WORM"
msgid "It's a worm!"
msgstr "它是一隻蠕蟲！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.GENERIC"
msgid "Soft and undulating."
msgstr "柔軟，呈波浪形。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE.OPEN"
msgid "Science compels me to jump in."
msgstr "科學催促我跳進去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMHOLE_LIMITED"
msgid "Guh, that thing looks worse off than usual."
msgstr "啊，那玩意看著不太對啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT"
msgid "Looks delicious."
msgstr "看起來很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_LESSER"
msgid "Kinda wrinkled."
msgstr "有點皺巴巴的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMLIGHT_PLANT"
msgid "Seems safe to me."
msgstr "我覺得挺安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s seems pricklier than usual today."
msgstr "%s今天似乎比平時更多刺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I thought you hated fire, %s."
msgstr "我以為你討厭火，%s."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.GHOST"
msgid "You need some help, lil guy?"
msgstr "需要一些説明吧，小夥伴？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.MURDERER"
msgid "Prepare to get weed whacked, %s!"
msgstr "準備被除草吧，小雜草，%s!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD.REVIVER"
msgid "%s never gives up on his friends."
msgstr "%s從來不會放棄他的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "That's the end of that."
msgstr "它走到了盡頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "Are carrots supposed to have legs?"
msgstr "胡蘿蔔怎麼還長腿了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "You're kind of ugly up close."
msgstr "近看真是醜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's almost cute."
msgstr "有點可愛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.GENERIC"
msgid "It's cute, but it's not ripe yet."
msgstr "挺可愛的，不過還沒熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
msgid "I think it's ripe now."
msgstr "現在應該熟了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.SLEEPING"
msgid "It's snoozing."
msgstr "在打盹呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "How strange, carrying one makes my pocket feel lighter!"
msgstr "真是奇怪，裝在我的口袋裡居然還能發光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORM_BOSS"
msgid "It's a big worm!"
msgstr "大蟲子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.ATTACKER"
msgid "I knew %s couldn't be trusted!"
msgstr "我就知道%s不可信！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s is becoming a survival liability."
msgstr "%s正在變成一個生存的負擔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GENERIC"
msgid "Greetings to you, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.GHOST"
msgid "I reject the reality of ghosts and imps."
msgstr "我拒絕接受有鬼魂和惡魔的現實。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.MURDERER"
msgid "Time to grab the imp by the horns!"
msgstr "是時候正面對抗這個長角的惡魔了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX.REVIVER"
msgid "Thanks for lending a helping claw, %s."
msgstr "多謝你的援助之爪%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_NABBAG"
msgid "He's a chip off the ol' Krampus."
msgstr "跟坎普斯是一個模子裡印出來的傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_REVIVER"
msgid "I can guess what that's fur."
msgstr "我能猜到那個有毛用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOUL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOUL"
msgid "only_used_by_wortox"
msgstr "only_used_by_wortox"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WORTOX_SOULJAR"
msgid "It's rather jarring if you think about it."
msgstr "如果你仔細想想，它還真不是一般的罐子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s is looking especially monstrous today..."
msgstr "%s今天一副兇神惡煞的樣子……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Didn't anyone teach you not to play with fire?!"
msgstr "就沒人教你別玩火嗎？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day, %s!"
msgstr "日安，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.GHOST"
msgid "%s is looking greener around the gills than usual."
msgstr "%s魚鰓周圍比平時更綠了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.MURDERER"
msgid "You're just another murderous merm!"
msgstr "你是條殺人魚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT.REVIVER"
msgid "Why thank you, %s!"
msgstr "為什麼要謝你，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_LUNAR"
msgid "Looking at it makes my head feel funny."
msgstr "看著它讓我的頭感覺怪怪的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WURT_SWAMPITEM_SHADOW"
msgid "Dreadful... but don't tell her I said that."
msgstr "簡直恐怖……但別告訴她是我說的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.ATTACKER"
msgid "I think we need to tweak your primary directive, %s..."
msgstr "%s，我想我們得調整你的首要指令..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You look like you're gonna melt, %s. What happened?"
msgstr "%s！你看起來快融化了。發生什麼事？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GENERIC"
msgid "Good day to you, %s!"
msgstr "日安，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.GHOST"
msgid "I always thought %s could use a heart. Now I'm certain!"
msgstr "我一直認為%s該長點心。現在，我很確定！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.MURDERER"
msgid "%s! You've violated the first law!"
msgstr "%s！你已經違反了第一律法！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78.REVIVER"
msgid "I guess %s got that empathy module up and running."
msgstr "我猜是%s讓感同身受組件啟動並運行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.WX78MODULE_BEE"
msgid "So much science packed into one tiny gizmo."
