msgstr "我要是不給供品它就冷落我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTH_KNIGHTSHRINE.GENERIC"
