msgstr "我想我們今天都在這裡學到了很多東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOTR_FIGHTRING_KIT"
