#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.BURNT"
