msgstr "聞起來像燒焦的毛皮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.YOT_CATCOONSHRINE.EMPTY"
