msgstr "多麼快樂的植物啊!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE_PLANTSTRESSED"
