msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.NO_TARGETS"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTAOE.SPELL_ON_COOLDOWN"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CASTSPELL.TERRAFORM_TOO_SOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wurt"
msgstr "only_used_by_wurt"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.GENERIC"
msgid "It'd be too risky."
msgstr "那樣風險太大了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.NO_TELEPORT_ZONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.NO_TELEPORT_ZONE"
msgid "The timestream here is too unstable... I shouldn't risk it."
msgstr "此時間流極其不穩定……我不該冒險。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.REVIVE_FAILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.REVIVE_FAILED"
msgid "It looks like I was too late..."
msgstr "看來我來晚了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.SHARD_UNAVAILABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.SHARD_UNAVAILABLE"
msgid "There's too much wobble wibbling the timestream."
msgstr "時間流有太多的搖擺不定。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.WARP_NO_POINTS_LEFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CAST_POCKETWATCH.WARP_NO_POINTS_LEFT"
msgid "That's enough backtracking for now."
msgstr "暫時先不走回頭路了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.BURNING"
msgid "I'm not meeting a fiery demise for a change of clothes, thank you!"
msgstr "我不會為了換件衣服被燒死，謝謝你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.GENERIC"
msgid "Now's not the time."
msgstr "現在不是時候。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.INUSE"
msgid "Would you hurry it up a bit in there?"
msgstr "你在裡面能不能快點？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOOCCUPANT"
msgid "I thought I'd hitched up a... must've been in a different timeline."
msgstr "我以為我已經……可能是在另一條時間線裡吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHANGEIN.NOTENOUGHHAIR"
msgid "Oh botheration, it hasn't grown enough hair yet."
msgstr "哎呀麻煩了，它頭髮還沒長足。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.CHARGE_FULL"
msgid "Fully charged."
msgstr "已充滿電。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CHARGE_FROM.NOT_ENOUGH_CHARGE"
msgid "There's not enough charge."
msgstr "電量不足。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.FISH_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "It's too small to measure."
msgstr "它太小了，無法測量。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COMPARE_WEIGHABLE.OVERSIZEDVEGGIES_TOO_SMALL"
msgid "Too small. I guess I shouldn't have picked it so early..."
msgstr "太小了。不該這麼早就摘下來的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.EMPTY"
msgid "I thought I'd already put... ah, I must've done it later."
msgstr "我以為我已經把……啊，我一定是後來做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.INUSE"
msgid "Waiting is so tedious!"
msgstr "等待是如此的乏味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.MISMATCH"
msgid "Hold on... these are the wrong plans! What a waste of time!"
msgstr "等一下……方案錯誤！真是浪費時間！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTALLOWED"
msgid "These won't fit together."
msgstr "這些湊不在一起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.CONSTRUCT.NOTREADY"
msgid "This might not be the best time..."
msgstr "現在可能不是最佳時機……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.GENERIC"
msgid "This is no time for cooking."
msgstr "現在沒有時間做飯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.INUSE"
msgid "I should've gotten here sooner."
msgstr "我應該早點來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.COOK.TOOFAR"
msgid "It's out of my reach."
msgstr "我無法企及。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.HASHAT"
msgid "I can't. Someone left a hat there."
msgstr "做不到。有人把帽子遺落在這裡了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.INUSE"
msgid "Someone's decorating it."
msgstr "已經有人在裝飾它了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.MELTING"
msgid "Its time has run out."
msgstr "它的時間已經到頭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DECORATESNOWMAN.STACKEDTOOHIGH"
msgid "Nope. It's plenty tall."
msgstr "不不不。已經夠高了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DEPLOY.HERMITCRAB_RELOCATE"
msgid "That's right, it's dry. I'll try again later."
msgstr "沒錯，是乾的。我晚點再試試。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.COOKING"
msgid "I'll have to be patient... just be patient... I can be patient!"
msgstr "我得有耐心才行……耐心點……我可以做到耐心點！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.INUSE"
msgid "Could you hurry it up a little?"
msgstr "你能不能快一點？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE.NOTEMPTY"
msgid "Oh! I forgot to check if there was anything still inside."
msgstr "哦！我忘記檢查裡面有沒有東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE_POCKETWATCH.ONCOOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DISMANTLE_POCKETWATCH.ONCOOLDOWN"
msgid "It needs a bit of time to unwind."
msgstr "它需要一點時間來松發條。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DIVEGRAB.MISSED"
msgid "Missed! Bad timing..."
msgstr "失手了！沒抓準時機……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.DRAW.NOIMAGE"
msgid "Hm. I can't quite remember what it looks like..."
msgstr "嗯。我不太記得它什麼樣了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FILL_OCEAN.UNSUITABLE_FOR_PLANTS"
msgid "Whoops, almost gave the plants sea water!"
msgstr "哎呦，差點給植物澆了海水！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.FISH_OCEAN.TOODEEP"
msgid "Ha! That would be like trying to use a pinion for a wheel!"
msgstr "哈！這好比用小齒輪來做車輪一樣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GENERIC.ITEMMIMIC"
msgid "Next time I'll choose the right one."
msgstr "下次我會選對的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.ABIGAILHEART"
msgid "I was hoping this timeline might be different."
msgstr "我本希望這條時間線會不一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.BUSY"
msgid "Please stop what you're doing, this is important!"
msgstr "請停止你正在做的事情，這很重要！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CANTSHADOWREVIVE"
msgid "It's not coming back. Maybe this time that's a good thing?"
msgstr "不會回來了。也許是件好事？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_ALREADY_PLAYING"
msgid "I'll just come back later. Or earlier."
msgstr "我以後再來就好。或者回到從前。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_NOTREADY"
msgid "Oh botheration, I've forgotten the flaghole, haven't I?"
msgstr "嗷，麻煩吶！我是不是忘了旗洞？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.CARNIVALGAME_INVALID_ITEM"
msgid "It needs something that will fit into this small slot..."
msgstr "它需要一個能裝進這個小槽的東西……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DEAD"
msgid "Maybe in a different timeline..."
msgstr "也許要換一條時間線……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.DUPLICATE"
msgid "I'm having deja vu... didn't we already make this? Or will we..."
msgstr "這似曾相識的感覺……我們是以前做過這個？還是將來要做……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.FOODFULL"
msgid "Oh what luck, someone already made food ahead of time!"
msgstr "真走運，有人已經提前做好了食物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, nope. That's not going to work."
msgstr "呃，不行。不管用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.GHOSTHEART"
msgid "Oh. My mistake, I thought you were a friend of mine."
msgstr "哦。我弄錯了，我以為你是我的一個朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSLOG"
msgid "I'll have to get one of those horrible logs..."
msgstr "我得去弄根糟糕的木頭……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NEEDSSHROOM"
msgid "Whoops, almost put that in the mushroom planter."
msgstr "哎呀，差點就放進蘑菇農場裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.MUSHROOMFARM_NOMOONALLOWED"
msgid "It won't grow here. I'm not wasting any more time on it."
msgstr "它不會在這裡生長的。我不會再在這上面浪費時間了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOGENERATORSKILL"
msgid "Please. That would be like trying to put a pendulum on a watch."
msgstr "求別鬧。那不跟在手錶上裝鐘擺一樣麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOMOON"
msgid "This isn't going to work if I can't see the moon."
msgstr "我連月亮都看不到這怎麼成。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTAMONKEY"
msgid "Odd, I could have sworn I could speak monkey at some point."
msgstr "怪了，我有段時間是會說猴語的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTATRIUMKEY"
msgid "I need something that fits perfectly, or the mechanism won't work."
msgstr "要大小剛好才行，否則就不會起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
msgid "Well... that was a waste of time."
msgstr "哎呀……就是在浪費時間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTGEM"
msgid "Please. That would be like trying to put a pendulum on a watch."
msgstr "求別鬧。那不跟在手錶上裝鐘擺一樣麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSCULPTABLE"
msgid "I'm not wasting one more second trying to work with this material."
msgstr "我不會再在這種材料上浪費多一秒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTSTAFF"
msgid "I need something that fits perfectly for the mechanism to work."
msgstr "要大小剛好才能起作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_DANGER"
msgid "I'm not putting my life in danger for a game!"
msgstr "我才不要為了一個遊戲冒生命危險！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_MESSY"
msgid "It kind of reminds me of my old workshop... a pigsty."
msgstr "有點讓我想起我的舊作坊……那個豬圈。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.PIGKINGGAME_TOOLATE"
msgid "It's getting dark. Maybe another time."
msgstr "天要黑了。不然下次吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.QUEENBUSY"
msgid "I don't care what her title is, it's no excuse to keep me waiting!"
msgstr "我不在乎她的頭銜是什麼，那不是讓我一直等的藉口！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Oooooh can't you sleep any faster?"
msgstr "噢，你就不能快點睡嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SLOTFULL"
msgid "I can't fit anything else in there."
msgstr "裡面什麼都放不下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.SPIDERNOHAT"
msgid "As whimsical as that would be, there isn't enough space in my pocket."
msgstr "雖然聽起來有點怪，可是我口袋裡確實放不下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_COOLDOWN"
msgid "It isn't ready yet? Botheration, even tiny trees take ages to grow!"
msgstr "還沒好？麻煩呐，即使是小樹也要花很長時間才能長成！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.TERRARIUM_REFUSE"
msgid "I wonder how the magic from this world might affect it?"
msgstr "不知道這個世界的魔法會對它產生什麼影響？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGGEM"
msgid "I could've sworn this was the right gem."
msgstr "我可以發誓這就是正確的寶石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.WRONGSHADOWFORM"
msgid "Oooh, now this is a puzzle..."
msgstr "噢，這真是個難題……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I don't have time to wait around!"
msgstr "我可沒時間乾等著！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "No, no, I'm doing this out of order!"
msgstr "不對，我順序搞錯了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "If you want this, you'd better drop something fast."
msgstr "你想要的話，最好先丟點東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVEALLTOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "You couldn't sleep a little faster, could you?"
msgstr "你還能睡得再快點嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.BUSY"
msgid "I don't have time to wait around!"
msgstr "我可沒時間乾等著！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.DEAD"
msgid "No, no, I'm doing this out of order!"
msgstr "不對，我順序搞錯了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.FULL"
msgid "If you want this, you'd better drop something fast."
msgstr "你想要的話，最好先丟點東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVETOPLAYER.SLEEPING"
msgid "You couldn't sleep a little faster, could you?"
msgstr "你還能睡得再快點嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE_TACKLESKETCH.DUPLICATE"
msgid "I'm pretty sure I've seen this before. Or maybe I will see it soon?"
msgstr "我很確定以前見過。或者是很快就會見到它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HARVEST.DOER_ISNT_MODULE_OWNER"
msgid "Fine then, keep your secrets to yourself!"
msgstr "那好吧，你就接著保守自己的秘密吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HEAL.NOT_MERM"
msgid "This should buy those merms a little more time."
msgstr "這應該能為魚人們多爭取一點時間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HERD_FOLLOWERS.WEBBERONLY"
msgid "They have no interest in listening to me, and I have no interest in them."
msgstr "它們沒有興趣聽我說話，而我對它們也沒有興趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.BEEF_HITCHED"
msgid "Wait, I already did that!"
msgstr "等等，我已經這樣做過了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.INMOOD"
msgid "I don't have the patience to deal with a mean-tempered beefalo."
msgstr "我沒有耐心去對付一隻脾氣暴躁的皮弗婁牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF"
msgid "What am I forgetting? Something's ringing a bell..."
msgstr "我忘記了什麼？似乎想起點什麼了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.HITCHUP.NEEDBEEF_CLOSER"
msgid "Come on now, trot your way over here."
msgstr "來，小跑幾步過來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.1"
msgid "Ohhh botheration!!"
msgstr "嗷，麻煩呐！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.2"
msgid "Why can't this sail just lower properly when I tell it to?"
msgstr "為什麼帆不聽我話乖乖下降？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.LOWER_SAIL_FAIL.3"
msgid "Ack! I think I pulled something in my back!"
msgstr "啊！我好像扭到背了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.ALREADY_MARKED"
msgid "Did I already pick this one? Yes, I'm pretty sure I did."
msgstr "我已經選了這個嗎？嗯，我肯定選過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MARK.NOT_PARTICIPANT"
msgid "I can join in later. Or maybe earlier."
msgstr "我要不一會兒再參加，要不去之前參加。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.INUSE"
msgid "Oh botheration. I was going to use that, you know!"
msgstr "嗷，麻煩呐。我本來想用那個的，知道吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.SLEEPING"
msgid "Wake up! There are places to go, things to be done!"
msgstr "醒醒吧！還有地方要去，有事情要做！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MOUNT.TARGETINCOMBAT"
msgid "I will not meet my end trampled beneath the hooves of an angry beefalo!"
msgstr "我的結局不是被憤怒的皮弗婁牛用蹄子踩死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.CAVE"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOFULLMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOGHOST"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NONEWMOON"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.MUTATE.NOTNIGHT"
msgid "only_used_by_wendy"
msgstr "only_used_by_wendy"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OCEAN_FISHING_POND.WRONGGEAR"
msgid "Ha! That would be like trying to use a wheel for a pinion!"
msgstr "哈！這好比用車輪來做小齒輪一樣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.PROFESSIONALCHEF"
msgid "It takes too long to cook a fancy meal."
msgstr "做頓好飯簡直太費時間了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.OPEN_CRAFTING.SHADOWMAGIC"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr "嗯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.NOTHING_INSIDE"
msgid "I forgot it would be empty."
msgstr "我忘記它會是空的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICK.STUCK"
msgid "I knew it was stuck."
msgstr "我就知道它卡住了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.FULL_OF_CURSES"
msgid "It won't fool me this time."
msgstr "這次它騙不了我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.INUSE"
msgid "Please hurry up, I need that!"
msgstr "麻煩快點，我急著要！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.1"
msgid "Wait a minute... I don't remember my carrat looking like this."
msgstr "等一下……我記得我的胡蘿蔔鼠不是長這樣的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NOTMINE_YOTC.2"
msgid "Oh botheration, I think I grabbed the wrong carrat."
msgstr "嗷，麻煩呐，我大概是拿錯了胡蘿蔔鼠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NO_HEAVY_LIFTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.NO_HEAVY_LIFTING"
msgid "I might be able to manage it... if I was just a bit younger."
msgstr "我要是稍微再小幾歲……應該就行了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PICKUP.RESTRICTION"
msgid "That's a little outside my area of expertise."
msgstr "這有點超出我的專業領域。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.FERTILIZER"
msgid "Honestly, I'm debating going back and unlearning what I know about it."
msgstr "說實話，我在猶豫要不要回到過去，把我這方面的知識通通抹掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.PLANTREGISTRY_RESEARCH_FAIL.GENERIC"
msgid "This isn't the first time I've seen it."
msgstr "這不是我第一次看到它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUNCECAPTURE.MISSED"
msgid "Missed! Bad timing..."
msgstr "失手了！沒抓準時機……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER.OUT_OF_WATER"
msgid "Didn't I just fill this up? Gardening is so tedious..."
msgstr "我不是剛把這個裝滿了嗎？園藝是如此乏味……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.POUR_WATER_GROUNDTILE.OUT_OF_WATER"
msgid "Didn't I just fill this up? Gardening is so tedious..."
msgstr "我不是剛把這個裝滿了嗎？園藝是如此乏味……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NODEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NODEST"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.ACTIONFAIL.REMOTE_TELEPORT.NOSKILL
