msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_BRICK"
msgid "You've seen one brick, you've seen them all."
msgstr "當你看到了一塊磚，你也就看到了所有的磚塊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WANDA.DESCRIBE.TURF_COTL_GOLD"
msgid "Surely there's a better use for all that gold?!"
msgstr "我敢肯定這些黃金肯定有更好的用途？！"

