msgstr "準備好被收拾吧，討厭的蟲子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.COMBAT_QUIT.GENERIC"
