msgstr "我穿這個是瘋了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH"
