msgid "Sleep now, lay later."
msgstr "現在睡覺，以後再下蛋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCAGE.STARVING"
msgid "Oh, what do birds eat? A nice brisket?"
msgstr "唔，鳥吃什麼？上好牛胸肉？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Mmm, that aroma!"
msgstr "呣，是那種焦香！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is about to turn."
msgstr "這肉快變質了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "The meat is turning!"
msgstr "肉質正在發生改變！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRDTRAP"
msgid "Oh, roast bird! Hm, don't get ahead of yourself, Warly..."
msgstr "烤鳥肉不錯！嗯，沃利，別想的太超前了..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG"
msgid "Nature's perfect food."
msgstr "大自然賜予的完美食物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_EGG_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a few different herbs..."
msgstr "可以加一些不同的香草..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT"
msgid "That bird is looking a bit odd."
msgstr "那只鳥看起來有點異常。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BIRD_MUTANT_SPITTER"
msgid "Something is definitely amiss here."
msgstr "這裡肯定有什麼不對勁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP"
msgid "You don't strike me as particularly spiritual."
msgstr "我並不認為你是精神領袖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_CHARGE_HIT"
msgid "Mon dieu!"
msgstr "我的天啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BISHOP_NIGHTMARE"
msgid "You are grinding my gears, dear fellow."
msgstr "你惹惱了我，親愛的夥計。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLACKFLAG"
msgid "I don't know how comfortable I feel sailing under a pirate flag..."
msgstr "掛著海盜旗航行這事，我有點說不準……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_FIRE"
msgid "Breathing fire!"
msgstr "噴火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA"
msgid "That might hurt somebody."
msgstr "可能會傷到人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_LAVA2"
msgid "That looks very dangerous."
msgstr "看起來很危險。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_PIPE"
msgid "They won't know what hit them."
msgstr "它們不會知道是被什麼射中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_SLEEP"
msgid "A sleep aid!"
msgstr "助眠道具！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLOWDART_YELLOW"
msgid "It's positively electric."
msgstr "它絕對帶電！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEAMULET"
msgid "Brrrrrr!"
msgstr "好冷！！！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEGEM"
msgid "Such a cool blue."
msgstr "好清涼的藍色。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEMOONEYE"
msgid "It should keep watch for us."
msgstr "應該能替我們放哨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.COMMON"
msgid "Time to stretch the brain muscles."
msgstr "是時候開動腦筋了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUEPRINT.RARE"
msgid "This one looks complicated."
msgstr "這個看起來挺複雜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP"
msgid "What deliciousness shall you yield?"
msgstr "你會創造怎樣的美味？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_CAP_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a dash of smoked salt and balsamic vinegar..."
msgstr "可以加點熏鹽和香醋..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah, a blue truffle!"
msgstr "啊，一朵藍色的松露！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.INGROUND"
msgid "It retreats from the light."
msgstr "它躲避著光線。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BLUE_MUSHROOM.PICKED"
msgid "I hope the truffles are restocked soon."
msgstr "我希望松露很快就會補貨。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARDS"
msgid "Sigh. It would be so perfect for grilling salmon."
msgstr "哎。它用來烤鮭魚再好不過了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARON"
msgid "Begone, cochon!"
msgstr "走開，豬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOARRIOR"
msgid "Bring it on, géant cochon!"
msgstr "來吧，大豬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT03"
msgid "Ah non! She is in pieces!"
msgstr "啊不！她碎成片了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT04"
msgid "Ah non! She is in pieces!"
msgstr "啊不！她碎成片了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATFRAGMENT05"
msgid "Ah non! She is in pieces!"
msgstr "啊不！她碎成片了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH"
msgid "Better safe than sorry, non?"
msgstr "未雨綢繆，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATPATCH_KELP"
msgid "That should hold us over for now."
msgstr "這應該能讓我們暫時度過難關。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT"
msgid "Almost there!"
msgstr "快長好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_CHECKPOINT_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Let us throw it in the soup."
msgstr "扔湯裡吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_PRIMEMATE"
msgid "I hope you enjoy the bitter taste of defeat!"
msgstr "希望你喜歡失敗那種苦澀的味道！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK"
msgid "Buoy ahead!"
msgstr "前方有浮標！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY"
msgid "Buoy ahead!"
msgstr "前方有浮標！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_MONKEY_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Where to put it... I wouldn't want anyone to run into it!"
msgstr "放哪好呢……我可不想讓別人碰到它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SEASTACK_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "Where to put it... I wouldn't want anyone to run into it!"
msgstr "放哪好呢……我可不想讓別人碰到它！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_SPECTATOR_DRAGONLING"
msgid "Bonjour! Are you here to cheer me on?"
msgstr "你好！你是來為我喝彩的嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START"
msgid "A good place to start."
msgstr "一個很好的起點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOATRACE_START_THROWABLE_DEPLOYKIT"
msgid "What a big decision."
msgstr "多麼重大的決定。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_CONTAINER"
msgid "A ship should always have a cargo hold stocked with provisions."
msgstr "一艘船應該始終有裝滿補給品的貨艙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ANCIENT_ITEM"
msgid "Ah, a fine vintage."
msgstr "啊，真復古啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING"
msgid "Now our boat has a hard rocky shell."
msgstr "現在，我們的船有了堅硬的岩石外殼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_CRABKING_KIT"
msgid "I will feel a bit safer with an extra layer wrapped around my boat."
msgstr "在船上多裹一層，我會覺得更安全一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP"
msgid "A helpful bit of garnish for the boat, non?"
msgstr "對船來說是個有用的裝飾品，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_KELP_KIT"
msgid "I will feel a bit safer with an extra layer wrapped around my boat."
msgstr "在船上多裹一層，我會覺得更安全一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL"
msgid "I've given my boat a crunchy outer shell."
msgstr "我給船做了個酥脆的外殼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_SHELL_KIT"
msgid "I will feel a bit safer with an extra layer wrapped around my boat."
msgstr "在船上多裹一層，我會覺得更安全一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD"
msgid "Ferocious!"
msgstr "生猛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
msgid "I will feel a bit safer with an extra layer wrapped around my boat."
msgstr "在船上多裹一層，我會覺得更安全一些。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.AMMOLOADED"
msgid "Is it too much to hope for a peaceful voyage?"
msgstr "和平航行這樣的要求算不算太高？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "Its belly is empty."
msgstr "它的肚子空空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON.NOAMMO"
msgid "Ah zut! I have nothing to fill its belly."
msgstr "啊嘖！我沒有東西可以給它填肚子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_CANNON_KIT"
msgid "All the ingredients needed for a fresh cannon."
msgstr "一門新鮮大炮所需的所有材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_GRASS_ITEM"
msgid "It won't go far, but we must start somewhere, non?"
msgstr "雖然它走不遠，但不積跬步無以至千里，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ITEM"
msgid "Allons-y out to sea!"
msgstr "揚帆起航！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_LEAK"
msgid "I should do something about that."
msgstr "我應該做點什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.ACTIVATED"
msgid "Ah, bon! It will take care of the sailing for me."
msgstr "啊，好啊！它將為我處理好航行問題。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET.GENERIC"
msgid "All that is left to do is turn it on."
msgstr "剩下要做的就是把它打開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.ACTIVATED"
msgid "That means it's working, non?"
msgstr "這意味著它正在發揮作用，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_BEACON.GENERIC"
msgid "What a strange little machine."
msgstr "多麼奇怪的小機器啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_MAGNET_KIT"
msgid "I will follow monsieur Higgsbury's recipe as best I can."
msgstr "我將盡可能地遵照希格斯伯裡先生的步驟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR"
msgid "It might be about time to turn it over."
msgstr "也許該翻一下了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOAT_ROTATOR_KIT"
msgid "Aha! I thought my boat was missing something!"
msgstr "啊哈，我就說我的船少了件什麼呢！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_BEEFALOWOOL"
msgid "Soft and dense, like a well-baked loaf of bread."
msgstr "柔軟而緻密，就像一塊烤得很好的麵包。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_KELP"
msgid "Wet and unpleasant, like an old spinach salad."
msgstr "濕漉漉、令人不悅，就像一盤放久了的蔬菜沙拉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_PETALS"
msgid "Light and airy, like a soufflé."
msgstr "像蛋奶酥一樣輕盈透氣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BODYPILLOW_STEELWOOL"
msgid "Stiff and scratchy, like a terrible biscotti."
msgstr "像做失敗的意式脆餅一樣生硬和紮人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Explosions really add some zest to a fight."
msgstr "爆炸確實能為戰鬥增添活力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOMB_LUNARPLANT_WORMWOOD"
msgid "That one seems to have a little extra spice."
msgstr "這個似乎更有料一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESHARD"
msgid "I could make a hearty stock with these."
msgstr "我可以用這些東西熬出一鍋豐盛的高湯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESOUP"
msgid "Bone appétit!"
msgstr "食髓知味!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BONESTEW"
msgid "Warms my soul!"
msgstr "溫暖了我的靈魂！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.BURNT"
msgid "Quelle horreur!"
msgstr "真是可怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOKSTATION.GENERIC"
msgid "Mme. Wickerbottom looks so happy organizing her books."
msgstr "嗯。薇克巴頓夫人整理書籍時神情總是那麼愉悅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BEES"
msgid "I'm more interested in honey than the bees."
msgstr "我對蜂蜜比對蜜蜂更感興趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BIRDS"
msgid "I had hoped it was a poultry cookbook."
msgstr "本以為是禽類烹飪指南。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_BRIMSTONE"
msgid "I don't think that's my forte."
msgstr "不是我的長項。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "I don't think that's my forte."
msgstr "不是我的長項。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FIRE"
msgid "That reminds me, I should make some flame-grilled skewers for dinner."
msgstr "正好提醒了我，應該做一些烤串作為晚餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FISH"
msgid "Sadly, it doesn't include any seafood recipes."
msgstr "可惜它並沒有包含任何海鮮菜譜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_FOSSIL"
msgid "I don't think that's my forte."
msgstr "不是我的長項。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_GARDENING"
msgid "Maybe Mme. Wickerbottom would be interested in starting a herb garden."
msgstr "也許啊，薇克巴頓有興趣為我種一些烹調用的香草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE"
msgid "Maybe Mme. Wickerbottom would be interested in starting a herb garden."
msgstr "也許啊，薇克巴頓有興趣為我種一些烹調用的香草。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_HORTICULTURE_UPGRADED"
msgid "I'm more interested in preparing vegetables after they're grown."
msgstr "比起種菜，我對做菜更感興趣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT"
msgid "I'm more familiar with au gratin than Latin."
msgstr "拉丁語我不熟，但是肉丁我熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_LIGHT_UPGRADED"
msgid "It looks incredibly dense, I thought it'd be more light and airy."
msgstr "這本書真密，我以為它會更輕盈和蓬鬆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_MOON"
msgid "The moon here is a bit less romantic than the one back home."
msgstr "同是月亮，這裡比故鄉少了幾分浪漫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RAIN"
msgid "Rainy days are good for reading."
msgstr "雨天適合閱讀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_RESEARCH_STATION"
msgid "Mme. Wickerbottom could cook up just about anything with that."
msgstr "薇克巴頓夫人幾乎能用它做出任何東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SILVICULTURE"
msgid "Perhaps it will tell me the best places to find mushrooms."
msgstr "也許它能告訴我找到蘑菇的最佳地點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_SLEEP"
msgid "It's tradition to nap after a good meal."
msgstr "美餐一頓後必須小憩片刻，這是傳統。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TEMPERATURE"
msgid "A consistent temperature is very important for cooking."
msgstr "保持溫度穩定對烹飪至關重要。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_TENTACLES"
msgid "I don't see any recipes in this at all."
msgstr "裡面什麼餐譜都沒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOK_WEB"
msgid "Aside from the petit monsieur, I don't think spiders and I will ever get along."
msgstr "除了那位小先生以外，我應該跟其他蜘蛛都相處不來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOMERANG"
msgid "Oh good. I have separation anxiety."
msgstr "噢好吧。我有分離焦慮症。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BOOTLEG"
msgid "Oh... oh my, was this someone's actual leg?"
msgstr "哦……哦，天哪，這是真的人腿嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FORGEDITEM"
msgid "Perhaps I could fix it, if I had the ingredients."
msgstr "如果我有原料的話，也許我可以修復它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BROKEN_FUMAROLETOOLITEM"
msgid "Back into the oven it goes!"
msgstr "回爐重造！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BRUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BRUSH"
msgid "For tidying unkempt beast hair."
msgstr "為了整理亂糟糟的獸毛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUGNET"
msgid "For catching alternative protein."
msgstr "用於捕捉另類的高蛋白動物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.GENERIC"
msgid "Salad of the sea!"
msgstr "海水沙拉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_PLANT.PICKED"
msgid "She needs time to regrow, non?"
msgstr "她需要時間重新成長，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BULLKELP_ROOT"
msgid "Perhaps it'll grow if I plant it."
msgstr "如果種下去，也許會有收穫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLE"
msgid "A cool dry place to keep food."
msgstr "一個保持食物新鮮的方法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNDLEWRAP"
msgid "A good food wrap."
msgstr "一個很棒的食物包裝。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYMAN"
msgid "I have so many good rabbit recipes..."
msgstr "我有很多不錯的兔肉烹飪食譜..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUNNYSTEW"
msgid "Ah, lapin a la cocotte. A classic."
msgstr "啊，無水燉兔肉，經典菜啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BURNT_MARSH_BUSH"
msgid "What a shame."
msgstr "令人遺憾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUSHHAT"
msgid "Snacks to go?"
msgstr "帶著走的小吃？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTER"
msgid "I thought I would never see you again, old friend!"
msgstr "我還以為再也見不到你了，我的老朋友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Your aerial dance is so soothing to behold..."
msgstr "你的空中舞蹈看起來如此舒心..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLY.HELD"
msgid "Don't slip from my butterfingers."
msgstr "別從我的黃油手中溜走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYMUFFIN"
msgid "Delectable!"
msgstr "味道不錯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "I wonder what dishes I could create with these?"
msgstr "我想知道用這些東西可以做成什麼菜？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARD"
msgid "If only you were more turkey than vulture..."
msgstr "如果你更像火雞而不是禿鷹該有多好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Mmm, that aroma!"
msgstr "呣，是那種焦香！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is about to turn."
msgstr "這肉快變質了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.BUZZARDCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "The meat is turning!"
msgstr "肉質正在發生改變！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CABBAGEROLLS"
msgid "A surprisingly time consuming dish, but well worth the wait."
msgstr "非常費時製作的美味，但絕對值得等待。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.GENERIC"
msgid "I bet it has a sharp flavor."
msgstr "我打賭它的味道很刺激。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS.PICKED"
msgid "It will live to prick again."
msgstr "它會重新長出刺來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_FLOWER"
msgid "Such a pretty flower from such a prickly customer!"
msgstr "這個多刺的傢伙開出的花這麼漂亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT"
msgid "I hope it does not prickle going down."
msgstr "我希望它不要紮到我的手。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CACTUS_MEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Could use some tortillas and melted queso..."
msgstr "可以配上一些玉米餅和融化的乳酪..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CALIFORNIAROLL"
msgid "Classic Japanese fusion!"
msgstr "經典的日式融合料理！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.EMBERS"
msgid "I should stoke the fire."
msgstr "我應該把火燒得旺點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.GENERIC"
msgid "To keep the dark at bay."
msgstr "驅散黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.HIGH"
msgid "Rivals a grease fire!"
msgstr "比得上油著火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.LOW"
msgid "It is getting low."
msgstr "火勢小了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.NORMAL"
msgid "I should like to sit by you for a moment."
msgstr "我想要在你旁邊坐一會。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAMPFIRE.OUT"
msgid "I will have to light you again."
msgstr "我得再點燃你一次。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.GENERIC"
msgid "Sing me your sweet song, mon amie."
msgstr "為我唱一首香頌吧，我的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY.HELD"
msgid "Bonjour monsieur."
msgstr "你好，先生。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANARY_POISONED"
msgid "The poor thing!"
msgstr "可憐的傢伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANDYBAG"
msgid "Where I keep all my confections!"
msgstr "我所有的糖果都會裝在裡面！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANE"
msgid "Now we are cooking with gas!"
msgstr "現在我們如虎添翼了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CANNONBALL_ROCK_ITEM"
msgid "I hope it won't be needed."
msgstr "希望用不到它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.COOLDOWN"
msgid "Bravo!"
msgstr "好樣的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON.GENERIC"
msgid "None of the ships I worked on had cannons."
msgstr "我還沒在炮艦上工作過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALCANNON_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER"
msgid "It adds a lovely atmosphere, non?"
msgstr "它增加了一種可愛的氣氛，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_BANNER_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE"
msgid "Hm... I should cook some eggs for breakfast."
msgstr "嗯……我理當做點蛋類料理當早餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_EGGRIDE_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.GENERIC"
msgid "What a charming figurine."
msgstr "多麼迷人的小雕像啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.RARE"
msgid "A fine piece, extra rare."
msgstr "一件精美的作品，特別罕見。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE.UNCOMMON"
msgid "This one's medium rare."
msgstr "這個就只有中等罕見了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT"
msgid "I wonder what could be inside?"
msgstr "不知道裡面是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON2"
msgid "I wonder what could be inside?"
msgstr "不知道裡面是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_FIGURE_KIT_SEASON3"
msgid "I wonder what could be inside?"
msgstr "不知道裡面是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP"
msgid "How pleasant!"
msgstr "多麼令人愉悅啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_LAMP_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT"
msgid "Perhaps it will attract normal sized crows?"
msgstr "也許它能引來正常大小的烏鴉？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALDECOR_PLANT_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALFOOD_CORNTEA"
msgid "It really shouldn't work, yet somehow it does..."
msgstr "按道理不應該這麼好喝，可是它還真的好喝……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_FOOD"
msgid "Birds certainly have unique tastes."
msgstr "鳥的品位還真特別。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_NEST"
msgid "A door, tres petite."
msgstr "小扇嬌小的門。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_FEEDCHICKS_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Quite the demanding group of diners."
msgstr "真是一群挑剔的食客啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFBALL"
msgid "Look at those cute little dimples!"
msgstr "瞧這些可愛的小點點！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFCLUB"
msgid "A gentle instrument!"
msgstr "一件温柔的廚具！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_DIY"
msgid "If I don't arrange it the same as before, will the outcome be different?"
msgstr "如果我不按以前那樣佈置，結果會不會不同？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_EASY"
msgid "This course is but an appetizer."
msgstr "這個場地不過是道開胃菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_HARD"
msgid "Now we are spicing things up!"
msgstr "現在我們要加點料了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFGAME_KIT_MEDIUM"
msgid "Medium! Just the way I like it!"
msgstr "中等辣度！正是我的口味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_CUTOUT"
msgid "Aren't you quite the unwelcome guest!"
msgstr "你可真是個不受歡迎的客人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FAN"
msgid "The wind is an unwelcome guest!"
msgstr "風是不速之客！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_FENCE"
msgid "Simple, it holds the course together."
msgstr "很簡單，它把球場維繫在一起。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_MOVINGWALL"
msgid "Like a nightmare soufflé."
msgstr "像噩夢般的蛋奶酥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPINNER"
msgid "It would make a real mess of dinner!"
msgstr "它會把晚餐攪得一團糟！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_SPRING"
msgid "I wonder if it can flip crepes."
msgstr "不知道它能不能翻可麗餅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLFPROP_WORMHOLE"
msgid "It has fast digestion."
msgstr "它消化得真快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE"
msgid "The ball is delivered here!"
msgstr "球要送到這裏！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_HOLE_KIT"
msgid "Where shall we end?"
msgstr "我們該在哪裏收尾？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.GENERIC"
msgid "All I need now is a token."
msgstr "現在我只需要一枚代幣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.INACTIVE"
msgid "It's missing the key ingredient! The flaghole!"
msgstr "缺少一味關鍵成分！旗洞！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE.PLAYING"
msgid "The game has already begun!"
msgstr "遊戲已經開始了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_GOLF_TEE_KIT"
msgid "Where should we begin?"
msgstr "我們該從哪裏開始？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_CHICK"
msgid "Over here, s'il vous plait!"
msgstr "請到這邊來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_HERDING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Scrambled eggs are another specialty of mine."
msgstr "我有一道特色菜叫炒蛋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.GENERIC"
msgid "A door, tres petite."
msgstr "小扇嬌小的門。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_CARD.PLAYING"
msgid "Perhaps this is the right one?"
msgstr "或許是這個？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_MEMORY_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Sometimes you must crack some eggs to get an omelette, non?"
msgstr "有時候不打幾顆蛋是做不出煎蛋的，對不對？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_PUCKDROP_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "Oh my, it's a good thing that isn't a real egg."
msgstr "哦，天哪，還好不是真蛋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_BUTTON.PLAYING"
msgid "Shall I press it now? Or... now?"
msgstr "我是現在按還是……現在按？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "A test of my timing skills, non?"
msgstr "這是對我計時技能的考驗，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.GENERIC"
msgid "A door, tres petite."
msgstr "小扇嬌小的門。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_SHOOTING_TARGET.PLAYING"
msgid "Stay out of the nest... and my soup!"
msgstr "離那個窩和我的湯都遠點！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_KIT"
msgid "I'll have it whipped up in no time at all."
msgstr "我三下五除二就能給它做好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "I should feed it something shiny."
msgstr "我應該給它喂點發光的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVALGAME_WHEELSPIN_STATION.PLAYING"
msgid "I'm quite good at this one!"
msgstr "這個我很擅長！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_BALL"
msgid "Perhaps I'll toss it around with the children."
msgstr "我扔給孩子們算了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_CROWKID"
msgid "Bonjour! And who might you be, little one?"
msgstr "你好！你是誰呢，小傢伙？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_GAMETOKEN"
msgid "A token for le carnaval!"
msgstr "嘉年華的代幣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_HOST"
msgid "He's a bit odd, but so is everything around here, non?"
msgstr "他是有點奇怪，可話說回來，這裡有不奇怪的東西麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, it's looking a bit bland around here."
msgstr "嗯，這裡有點乏味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_2"
msgid "Having more decorations around would certainly give it some zest!"
msgstr "多一點裝飾品才會多一點味道！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA.LEVEL_3"
msgid "Magnifique!"
msgstr "好棒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PLAZA_KIT"
msgid "This tree has a certain je ne sais quoi."
msgstr "這棵樹有種無以名狀的特質。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH.GENERIC"
msgid "They have quite a menu of prizes to choose from!"
msgstr "它們的獎品功能表十分豐富！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZEBOOTH_KIT"
msgid "All the ingredients are together, now let's get cooking!"
msgstr "所有原料都備齊了，現在讓我們開做吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC"
msgid "One lonely ticket."
msgstr "一張孤獨的獎票。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_LARGESTACK"
msgid "Mon dieu, a mountain of tickets!"
msgstr "我的天啊，一座獎票的小山！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_PRIZETICKET.GENERIC_SMALLSTACK"
msgid "Quite a few tickets."
msgstr "獎票真不少啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_SEEDPACKET"
msgid "They could use a bit of seasoning."
msgstr "可以加一點調味料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_A"
msgid "Ah, I remember this style being quite popular in Paris."
msgstr "我記得很清楚，這個款式當年風靡整個巴黎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_B"
msgid "It provides a nice bit of shade."
msgstr "它提供了一個很好的陰涼之處。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARNIVAL_VEST_C"
msgid "When at a crow carnival, dress like the crows do, non?"
msgstr "在烏鴉嘉年華上，要像烏鴉那樣穿衣服，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_BLADE_MOONGLASS"
msgid "Will it slice le jambon?"
msgstr "它能切火腿嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.BURNT"
msgid "C'est la vie..."
msgstr "這就是生活……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARPENTRY_STATION.GENERIC"
msgid "A bit of furniture would be nice around here."
msgstr "在這裡添置點傢俱確實不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder what you'd taste like."
msgstr "不知道你是什麼味道的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.GENERIC"
msgid "I... think I had a nightmare like this once."
msgstr "我以前有過這樣的噩夢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.HELD"
msgid "Would you be a meat or a vegetable?"
msgstr "你是肉呢還是蔬菜呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT.SLEEPING"
msgid "Bonne nuit."
msgstr "晚安。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARRAT_GHOSTRACER"
msgid "Oh! Well aren't you... cute?"
msgstr "啊！你怎麼這麼……可愛？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT"
msgid "Fresh picked produce!"
msgstr "新鮮採摘的作物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_COOKED"
msgid "Could use a dash of olive oil and cilantro..."
msgstr "可以加點橄欖油和香菜..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_OVERSIZED"
msgid "How many different ways could I prepare carrots of this size..."
msgstr "這麼大的胡蘿蔔，我可以用多少種不同的方法來烹調啊……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_PLANTED"
msgid "Ah, a fresh carrot!"
msgstr "啊，新鮮的胡蘿蔔！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARROT_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "未來的食材，就等著你來種!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNING"
msgid "Oh dear!"
msgstr "噢，不好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that won't help our explorations much."
msgstr "這對我們的探險不會有太大幫助。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CARTOGRAPHYDESK.GENERIC"
msgid "I hope my penmanship is legible."
msgstr "希望你們能讀懂我的筆跡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOON"
msgid "What perky little ears."
msgstr "多麼神氣的小耳朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.EMPTY"
msgid "Vacant of critters."
msgstr "空的動物巢穴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "How many critters can fit in there?"
msgstr "裡面可以住多少只動物？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATCOONHAT"
msgid "Not quite my style."
msgstr "不太像我的風格。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CATTOY_MOUSE"
msgid "I'm afraid I don't have any clockwork cheese."
msgstr "恐怕我沒有發條乳酪給你。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm sure I'm strong enough to move it."
msgstr "我很強壯，可以移得動它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVEIN_BOULDER.RAISED"
msgid "I can't get at it."
msgstr "我夠不到。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA"
msgid "Bananas! Just the flavor I needed!"
msgstr "香蕉！正缺這一味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_BURNT"
msgid "I would have liked more fresh bananas."
msgstr "要是香蕉再新鮮一點就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_COOKED"
msgid "Could use some oats and a few chocolate chips..."
msgstr "可以加一些燕麥和巧克力粒..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_BANANA_TREE"
msgid "There must be monkeys close by."
msgstr "附近肯定有猴子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE"
msgid "I wonder what is underneath that?"
msgstr "我想知道下面有什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.FULL"
msgid "Someone else is having their turn in there."
msgstr "裡面有人呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.GENERIC"
msgid "I wonder what is underneath that?"
msgstr "我想知道下面有什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_OPEN.OPEN"
msgid "Dare I?"
msgstr "我敢進去嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_ENTRANCE_RUINS"
msgid "What is within?"
msgstr "裡面有什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.FULL"
msgid "I'll wait til there's a little more room."
msgstr "我還是等裡面空一點吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.GENERIC"
msgid "Now isn't a good time to leave."
msgstr "現在離開不太好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_EXIT.OPEN"
msgid "I should like to see the surface again."
msgstr "我想再次看見地面上的世界。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN"
msgid "How does anything grow down here?"
msgstr "怎麼會有東西長在這下面？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_FERN_WITHERED"
msgid "It did not survive this environment."
msgstr "它沒能在這裡的環境生存下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.DEAD"
msgid "It is dead."
msgstr "已死亡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.GENERIC"
msgid "A walking pressure cooker!"
msgstr "行走的高壓鍋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.SLEEPING"
msgid "Perhaps a good time to harvest?"
msgstr "也許是收割的好時機？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_MITE.VENTING"
msgid "Most unappetizing!"
msgstr "太倒胃口了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GAS"
msgid "Reminds me of rotten eggs."
msgstr "一股臭雞蛋的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "I do not wish to wait for what comes out!"
msgstr "我沒想等等看會噴出什麼來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.HOT"
msgid "Steaming as a method of cooking preserves nutrients and flavor!"
msgstr "清蒸這種烹飪方法能同時保留營養和風味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CAVE_VENT_ROCK.MIASMA"
msgid "It smells of death and disease!"
msgstr "有死亡和疾病的味道！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEILING_ROPE"
msgid "If you can't take the heat, climb the rope!"
msgstr "受不了熱就順着繩子往上爬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CEVICHE"
msgid "Truly what I live for!"
msgstr "我生存的真正意義！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARCOAL"
msgid "This, a grill and some meat and I'd have dinner."
msgstr "這個加上一個烤架和一些肉，我的晚餐就有著落了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIERESIDUE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIEROSE"
msgid "only_used_by_winona"
msgstr "only_used_by_winona"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HAND"
msgid "It needs an important ingredient."
msgstr "它需要一種重要原料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_HECKLER"
msgid "What a rude bird!"
msgstr "多麼粗魯的鳥！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_LECTURN"
msgid "A play? Here?"
msgstr "一齣戲？這裡？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_NPC"
msgid "Mon dieu... Is that the face I've seen peering from the shadows?"
msgstr "我的天啊……是我之前見過的從暗影中窺視的那張臉嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHARLIE_STAGE_POST"
msgid "I have the feeling I am being watched."
msgstr "我有一種被監視的感覺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK1"
msgid "Broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "壞掉的棋子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK2"
msgid "More broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "更多壞掉的棋子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSJUNK3"
msgid "And yet more broken chess pieces?"
msgstr "還有更多壞掉的棋子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANCHOR"
msgid "I think Maman would like this."
msgstr "媽媽會喜歡這個的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ANTLION"
msgid "I do like her better like this."
msgstr "我更喜歡她這樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER"
msgid "I can't believe we survived that beast!"
msgstr "不敢相信我們沒被怪獸殺死！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEARGER_MUTATED"
msgid "A second course of monster that I didn't ask for!"
msgstr "我沒要的第二道怪物主菜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEFALO"
msgid "What a beautifully marbled steak."
msgstr "多麼漂亮的大理石紋路的牛排。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BEEQUEEN"
msgid "Muse for my new honey glaze!"
msgstr "我的新蜜汁醬的繆斯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a bishop."
msgstr "看著有點像主教。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BISHOP.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "我的天！在動！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_BUTTERFLY"
msgid "How lovely!"
msgstr "好可愛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CARRAT"
msgid "Looking at it is making me a little hungry..."
msgstr "光是看著我就口水直流了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CATCOON"
msgid "At least this one won't try to sneak off with my lunch."
msgstr "至少這個不會叼著我的午餐偷偷溜走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYHOUND"
msgid "I'm glad it's not trying to bite me."
msgstr "它沒打算咬我，真開心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CLAYWARG"
msgid "I'm not sure why we memorialized this very scary creature."
msgstr "真不知道為什麼要紀念這個可怕的生物。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_CRABKING"
msgid "I'm getting a sudden craving for seafood."
msgstr "我突然很想吃海鮮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER"
msgid "I have to admit, I think I prefer him this way."
msgstr "我得承認，我更喜歡他這個樣子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DAYWALKER2"
msgid "He put me off pork for some time."
msgstr "它讓我好一段時間都不想吃豬肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS"
msgid "It was much scarier in the flesh."
msgstr "肉身怪獸要可怕多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEERCLOPS_MUTATED"
msgid "Brr... it still gives me the shivers..."
msgstr "啵……我就算現在看到還是會渾身發抖……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DEPTHWORM"
msgid "How could I forget the chewing."
msgstr "我怎麼可能忘記那個咀嚼聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_DRAGONFLY"
msgid "I was afraid I was going to be broiled alive!"
msgstr "我可真怕被活烤了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Did it just blink?"
msgstr "它剛剛眨眼了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_FORMAL"
msgid "This must be the king?"
msgstr "這個是國王吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_GUARDIANPHASE3"
msgid "A three course fight I won't soon forget."
msgstr "讓我久久難以平復的三道主菜之戰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_HORNUCOPIA"
msgid "One can dream."
msgstr "有夢想總是好的"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KITCOON"
msgid "I think Mme. Wickerbottom is particularly fond of this one."
msgstr "我認為薇克巴頓女士會特別鍾情這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KLAUS"
msgid "A table centerpiece fit for a holiday feast."
msgstr "適合節日盛宴的餐桌擺件。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a knight."
msgstr "看著有點像騎士。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_KNIGHT.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "我的天！在動！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MALBATROSS"
msgid "I hope this won't bring us ill luck at sea..."
msgstr "希望這個不要讓我們在海上時遇到厄運……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MANRABBIT"
msgid "As far as battles go, it was probably the most pleasant."
msgstr "這應該是最愉快的一次戰鬥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MINOTAUR"
msgid "Perhaps now you can keep watch over my crock pot."
msgstr "你適合幫我守著烹飪鍋。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOON"
msgid "Hits my eye like a big pizza pie."
msgstr "像一塊披薩一樣讓我眼前一亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MOOSEGOOSE.1"
msgid "I should whip up some roast goose with cranberry sauce."
msgstr "我應該做點烤鵝肉配蔓越莓醬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_MUSE"
msgid "This one looks like a queen."
msgstr "這個看起來像女王。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PAWN"
msgid "It looks a bit like a pawn."
msgstr "看著有點像卒子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_PIPE"
msgid "I hope it doesn't set a bad example for the little ones."
msgstr "我希望它不會為小孩子們樹立一個壞榜樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks a bit like a rook."
msgstr "看著有點像戰車。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_ROOK.STRUGGLE"
msgid "Mon dieu! It's moving!"
msgstr "我的天！在動！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_SHARKBOI"
msgid "It seemed to think it was top of the food chain."
msgstr "它似乎認為自己是食物鏈的頂端。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_STALKER"
msgid "If only I could use those bones in a broth."
msgstr "我要是能用這些骨頭熬個湯就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TOADSTOOL"
msgid "Stone mushroom soup anyone?"
msgstr "石蘑菇湯有沒有人要喝呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_TWINSOFTERROR"
msgid "They weren't the most polite guests, non?"
msgstr "他們並不是最禮貌的客人，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "It comes in petit!"
msgstr "它還有小份的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_LUNAR"
msgid "That was a bad combination."
msgstr "糟糕的搭配。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "The portable version."
msgstr "出了個便攜版。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WARG_MUTATED"
msgid "I'm relieved it's just a statue."
msgstr "還好只是一座雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_WORMBOSS"
msgid "It sure had an appetite."
msgstr "它那時的胃口真是驚人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTD"
msgid "Ah, the sweet taste of victory!"
msgstr "啊，勝利的甜美滋味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTH"
msgid "It was really hot and cold with this one."
msgstr "這一位忽冷忽熱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESSPIECE_YOTS"
msgid "I remember the chewing."
msgstr "我還記得那個咀嚼聲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER"
msgid "You look cute and inedible."
msgstr "你看起來很可愛，但是不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.GENERIC"
msgid "The eye follows me wherever I go..."
msgstr "不論我去哪裡，它的視線總是跟著我..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTER_EYEBONE.WAITING"
msgid "It sleeps."
msgstr "它睡著了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHESTUPGRADE_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Ah! Can this give me the storage space I crave?"
msgstr "啊！它能提供我渴望的存儲空間嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.CHEST_MIMIC_REVEALED
