#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER"
msgid "It is not polite to slurp."
msgstr "吃飯吧唧嘴是不禮貌的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPERPELT"
msgid "Wear this? What in heavens for?"
msgstr "穿這個？為什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURPER_PELT"
msgid "Wear this? What in heavens for?"
msgstr "穿這個？為什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE"
msgid "You would flavor a soup nicely. Your shell could be the bowl!"
msgstr "你可以讓湯變得鮮美。你的殼可以當作碗來用！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHAT"
msgid "Be the snail."
msgstr "變成蝸牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLEHOLE"
msgid "Yuck!"
msgstr "呸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLESLIME"
msgid "Nature giveth, and nature grosseth."
msgstr "大自然的產物，夠噁心的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SLURTLE_SHELLPIECES"
msgid "If only I had crazy glue."
msgstr "要是我有瘋狂快乾膠就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "Hello food... uh, friend."
msgstr "你好，我的食物...呃，朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "I suppose I could whip something up for you."
msgstr "我想我可以給你隨便搞點吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "Sleep well, petite oiseau."
msgstr "睡個好覺吧，小鳥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "You look famished!"
msgstr "你看上去餓壞了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLGHOST"
msgid "Oh! You gave me a little fright!"
msgstr "噢！你嚇到我了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT"
msgid "Fresh protein!"
msgstr "新鮮的蛋白質！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SMALLMEAT_DRIED"
msgid "Could use a teriyaki glaze..."
msgstr "可以加點紅燒醬汁..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAPPER"
msgid "Please don't take any bites out of me."
msgstr "千萬別咬我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWBALL_ITEM"
msgid "Oh fun!"
msgstr "哦，好玩！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "A work of art!"
msgstr "是一件藝術品！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNOWMAN.SNOWBALL"
msgid "It needs... something."
msgstr "它缺點……什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNURTLE"
msgid "Escar-goodness gracious!"
msgstr "哦，天哪！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.GENERIC"
msgid "Now to let the ingredients marinade."
msgstr "現在來醃制一下食材吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.SPOILED"
msgid "It's not my idea of a fine meal, but the plants will love it."
msgstr "這不是我想要的美食，但植物們會喜歡的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER.STALE"
msgid "It needs a bit more time to stew."
msgstr "它需要多一點時間來燉煮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SOIL_AMENDER_FERMENTED"
msgid "Ah, c'est fini!"
msgstr "啊，結束了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPAT"
msgid "I do enjoy a good mutton."
msgstr "我很喜歡吃羊肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR"
msgid "For kebab-ing."
msgstr "烤肉串用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_GUNGNIR"
msgid "That's just a big skewer."
msgstr "一根大肉籤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_LANCE"
msgid "Maybe I could make kabobs?"
msgstr "做幾串烤肉？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR"
msgid "I'm better with a spatula."
msgstr "我這手還是更適合炒菜的鏟子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPEAR_WATHGRITHR_LIGHTNING"
msgid "A rather formidable skewer!"
msgstr "相當令人敬畏的烤串簽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICEPACK"
msgid "My bag of chef's tricks!"
msgstr "我的神奇廚師袋！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_CHILI"
msgid "My own special recipe."
msgstr "我自己的特別食譜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_GARLIC"
msgid "Without garlic powder, life is not worth living."
msgstr "沒有蒜粉，生活根本不值得。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SALT"
msgid "Salt, at last! I could weep!"
msgstr "食鹽，終於啊！就要喜極而泣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPICE_SUGAR"
msgid "The original all natural sweetener."
msgstr "天然甜蜜素。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.DEAD"
msgid "Please no rain!"
msgstr "拜託，別下雨！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.GENERIC"
msgid "You are not for eating."
msgstr "你不是用來吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER.SLEEPING"
msgid "It should make itself a silk pillow."
msgstr "它應該給自己做一個絲綢枕頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Burnt to perfection."
msgstr "火候恰到好處。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "It is dead, yes?"
msgstr "是死了吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "It makes my stomach turn."
msgstr "這讓我反胃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN"
msgid "A spider has to live somewhere, I suppose."
msgstr "我覺得這裡肯定住著蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERDEN_BEDAZZLER"
msgid "It's nice to see the petit monsieur expressing his creativity!"
msgstr "這位小先生發揮了他的創意，真是太好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDEREGGSACK"
msgid "This is probably a delicacy somewhere."
msgstr "這在某個地方可能是一道美味佳餚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERGLAND"
msgid "Alternative medicine."
msgstr "另類的藥。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHAT"
msgid "Well, it is on my head now. Best make the most of it."
msgstr "現在它戴在我的腦袋上了。最好是充分利用它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE"
msgid "I have no reason to investigate any further."
msgstr "我沒有理由繼續深入調查了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERHOLE_ROCK"
msgid "I'd prefer not to get closer."
msgstr "我還是別離太近。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEEN"
msgid "I will not bend the knee to the likes of you!"
msgstr "我不會向你這種生物下跪的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "She is developing a nice char."
msgstr "她正在發出迷人的焦香味。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "She looks dead..."
msgstr "她看起來死了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDERQUEENCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "No, thank you!"
msgstr "不要，謝謝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_DROPPER"
msgid "Ah, the old \"drop from the ceiling and commit violent acts\" act."
msgstr "啊，“從天而降並實施暴力行為”的老派做法。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER"
msgid "I suppose it's good to have a healthier alternative."
msgstr "有更健康的選項當然是好事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HEALER_ITEM"
msgid "It only appeals to a very specific palate."
msgstr "它只對一種非常特殊的舌頭有吸引力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_HIDER"
msgid "A spider that turtles!"
msgstr "背著殼的蜘蛛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.DEAD"
msgid "Thank goodness, it's over."
msgstr "謝天謝地，它玩完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.GENERIC"
msgid "That's no ordinary spider."
msgstr "這絕不是尋常的蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_MOON.SLEEPING"
msgid "I shouldn't disturb it's nap."
msgstr "我不要擾蛛清夢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_REPELLENT"
msgid "Unfortunately, it seems only spiders can shoo other spiders."
msgstr "不幸的是，似乎只有蜘蛛才能驅趕其他蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_SPITTER"
msgid "So many spiders!"
msgstr "好多蜘蛛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.DEAD"
msgid "It knew the risks."
msgstr "它知道了風險。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Does this mean you are even more warlike than the others?"
msgstr "你是不是比其他蜘蛛更好戰？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WARRIOR.SLEEPING"
msgid "It is having a flashback to the spider war..."
msgstr "它正在夢中進行蜘蛛大戰..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WATER"
msgid "Mon dieu, these spiders have gotten their sea legs!"
msgstr "我的天啊，這些蜘蛛已經不暈船了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPIDER_WHISTLE"
msgid "Oh dear, it's quite sticky."
msgstr "啊天啊，真黏啊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FISH.GENERIC"
msgid "Such a shame..."
msgstr "真可惜..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPOILED_FOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "It is a sin to waste food..."
msgstr "浪費食物是犯罪..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Something that pretty must taste good, right?"
msgstr "長這麼好看一定很好吃，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MEDIUM.HELD"
msgid "How precious."
msgstr "相當寶貴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_MOON"
msgid "Keep those away from my soufflés!"
msgstr "讓那些東西遠離我的蛋白牛奶酥！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like floating candy."
msgstr "看著像漂浮奶糖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_SMALL.HELD"
msgid "How precious."
msgstr "相當寶貴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.GENERIC"
msgid "I can't believe mushrooms made something so pretty."
msgstr "不敢相信蘑菇能做這麼漂亮的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SPORE_TALL.HELD"
msgid "How precious."
msgstr "相當寶貴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SQUID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SQUID"
msgid "Incandescent calamari!"
msgstr "白熾的槍烏賊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFFCOLDLIGHT"
msgid "I appreciate it on sweltering afternoons."
msgstr "在炎熱的午後有妙用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFFLIGHT"
msgid "Too much power to hold in one hand."
msgstr "一手掌握這麼大的能量並非易事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I could stir up some real trouble with this."
msgstr "要是想搗亂，用這個准沒錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAFF_TORNADO"
msgid "Does nature like being tamed?"
msgstr "大自然都喜歡被馴服嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.AWAKE"
msgid "I've got to hand it to you, I was startled!"
msgstr "服了你了，嚇到我了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEHAND.HIDING"
msgid "Oh, what a nice table setting."
msgstr "噢，好精美的餐桌擺設。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.SITTING"
msgid "Oh, what a nice table setting."
msgstr "噢，好精美的餐桌擺設。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STAGEUSHER.STANDING"
msgid "I've got to hand it to you, I was startled!"
msgstr "服了你了，嚇到我了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE"
msgid "I always get you upside down with stalactites..."
msgstr "倒過來就成了鐘乳石..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALAGMITE_TALL"
msgid "Rocks to be had."
msgstr "待開採的岩石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER"
msgid "We should have left it sleeping!"
msgstr "應該讓它睡著吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_ATRIUM"
msgid "This won't be an easy fight."
msgstr "這場仗不容易打。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_MINION"
msgid "What creeps!"
msgstr "好嚇人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STALKER_NPC"
msgid "He seems to have had a change of heart."
msgstr "他看起來回心轉意了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STASH_MAP"
msgid "Ah, it looks like this will lead me to some treasure!"
msgstr "啊，看來它將帶我找到寶藏！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.EMPTY"
msgid "Oops."
msgstr "哎呀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEGLOMMER.GENERIC"
msgid "Must have been a pretty important, uh, thingy..."
msgstr "肯定是個很重要的，呃，東西..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP"
msgid "Headless harpsmen."
msgstr "無頭的豎琴師。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEHARP_HEDGESPAWNER"
msgid "That poor statue seems to have been left alone for a long time."
msgstr "那座可憐的雕像似乎孤獨了很久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUEMAXWELL"
msgid "He is literally made of stone."
msgstr "他確實是石頭做成的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.GENERIC"
msgid "A lovely marble statue."
msgstr "可愛的大理石雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE1"
msgid "Well, as they say, if it ain't baroque!"
msgstr "俗話說的好，要是沒壞，就別修！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE2"
msgid "She seems regal."
msgstr "她儀容莊嚴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STATUE_MARBLE.TYPE3"
msgid "Some fresh cut flowers would brighten it up!"
msgstr "找些鮮切花點綴會變得更美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEELWOOL"
msgid "I used to use this to scrub dishes."
msgstr "我以前會用它來洗盤子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL"
msgid "I'll steer us in the right direction!"
msgstr "它會給我們指一個正確的方向！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STEERINGWHEEL_ITEM"
msgid "We can't set sail without this."
msgstr "少了這個東西我們就不能揚帆起航了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STINGER"
msgid "It would really sting to not have a use for this."
msgstr "這東西派不上用場真頭痛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.GENERIC"
msgid "Mon chair."
msgstr "我的椅子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_CHAIR.OCCUPIED"
msgid "Leur chair."
msgstr "他人的椅子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.GENERIC"
msgid "All it's missing are homecooked food and good wine."
msgstr "就差幾道家常菜和美酒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STONE_TABLE.HAS_ITEM"
msgid "All it's missing are homecooked food and good wine."
msgstr "就差幾道家常菜和美酒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.BROKEN"
msgid "It has been scrambled."
msgstr "它被翻炒過了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STORAGE_ROBOT.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour little forager."
msgstr "你好，小覓食者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STRAWHAT"
msgid "Now I am on island time."
msgstr "現在我在享受島上時光。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STUFFEDEGGPLANT"
msgid "Slightly smoky flesh, savory filling. Ah!"
msgstr "稍微煙熏過的茄肉，外加美味的餡料。啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STUFFING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.STUFFING"
msgid "To preserve the crispness, I actually cook it separate from the turkey."
msgstr "為了達到脆脆的口感，我把它跟火雞分開，單獨做。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED"
msgid "I wonder if I can find some culinary use for this."
msgstr "不知道能不能用在烹調上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PICKED_DRIED"
msgid "A fine ingredient!"
msgstr "上等的原料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_PLANT"
msgid "What an adorable little plant."
msgstr "好可愛的小植物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUCCULENT_POTTED"
msgid "I would have preferred to cook it, but c'est la vie."
msgstr "我本想做熟吃的，但這就是生活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I was hoping there would still be a fresh clam inside..."
msgstr "我還指望著能挖到個新鮮的扇貝……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKENCHEST.LOCKED"
msgid "Ah, zut! Locked."
msgstr "啊呀！閉上了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPERTACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "C'est super!"
msgstr "妙極！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR"
msgid "I fear it won't be standing much longer."
msgstr "它恐怕撐不了多久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_BROKEN"
msgid "Crumbled like a dry pastry."
msgstr "像酥皮一樣碎成了粉末。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_COMPLETE"
msgid "It's nice to have some stability."
msgstr "有一定的穩定性是件好事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE"
msgid "I fear it won't be standing much longer."
msgstr "它恐怕撐不了多久了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_BROKEN"
msgid "If at first you don't succeed..."
msgstr "如果一開始你沒有成功..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_COMPLETE"
msgid "Looks well done to me!"
msgstr "我覺得做得很好！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_DREADSTONE_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "What's cooking under there?"
msgstr "裡面在悄悄煮什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUPPORT_PILLAR_SCAFFOLD"
msgid "What's cooking under there?"
msgstr "裡面在悄悄煮什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SURFNTURF"
msgid "Mwah! Perfection."
msgstr "嘖！完美。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
msgid "I feel so much better all of the sudden."
msgstr "我突然感覺好多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETPOTATO"
msgid "All the sweetness of the holidays."
msgstr "節日的甜蜜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWEETTEA"
msgid "Ah... je me sens relaxé."
msgstr "啊，我覺得很輕鬆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SWORD_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "Beautiful and dangerous."
msgstr "美麗而危險。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.BURNT"
msgid "Oh dear, it looks a bit overdone."
msgstr "噢，天啊，火候過頭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.GENERIC"
msgid "Ah yes! A proper feasting table!"
msgstr "啊，是的！一張得體的餐桌！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.HAS_FOOD"
msgid "A masterpiece!"
msgstr "一個傑作！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TABLE_WINTERS_FEAST.WRONG_TYPE"
msgid "Ah no! That does not seem right!"
msgstr "啊不！看起來不對！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLECONTAINER"
msgid "I like my tackle to be as organized as my kitchen."
msgstr "我的釣具要像我的廚房一樣整理的井井有條。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLESKETCH"
msgid "Ah, it looks like a recipe for some fishing tackle."
msgstr "啊，看起來像是某種釣具的配方。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TACKLESTATION"
msgid "I've got bigger fish to fry! And bake, and poach, and..."
msgstr "我有更大的魚去炸！還有烤，煮，以及……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TAFFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TAFFY"
msgid "I hope it never dislodges from my teeth!"
msgstr "我不想它離開我的牙齒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRD"
msgid "Leggy."
msgstr "大長腿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG"
msgid "I wonder what its incubation period is?"
msgstr "我想知道孵化它要多久？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_COOKED"
msgid "Could use sliced fried tomatoes and beans..."
msgstr "可以做成切片番茄炒蛋，再加點豆子..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "Oh, you poor egg, you are so cold!"
msgstr "噢，你這顆可憐的蛋，凍到了吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.GENERIC"
msgid "There is activity!"
msgstr "那裡有響動！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.HOT"
msgid "I hope you don't hardboil."
msgstr "我希望你沒有被烤熟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.LONG"
msgid "This is going to take some dedication."
msgstr "這種事需要投入點時間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDEGG_CRACKED.SHORT"
msgid "A hatching is in the offing!"
msgstr "就快孵化出來了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.GENERIC"
msgid "No vacancy here."
msgstr "這裡沒有空位。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLBIRDNEST.PICKED"
msgid "Empty nest syndrome is setting in."
msgstr "空巢綜合征降臨了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TALLEGGS"
msgid "Crispy on the outside, with a nice runny center."
msgstr "外酥裡嫩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TAMALES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TAMALES"
msgid "You can taste the care that went into this dish."
msgstr "你能嘗到廚師的悉心烹製。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.GENERIC"
msgid "You are sort of tall, I guess..."
msgstr "我猜你也算比較高的吧..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.HUNGRY"
msgid "Teenagers, always hungry!"
msgstr "青少年總是容易餓！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.SLEEPING"
msgid "A growing bird needs their rest."
msgstr "正在長身體的小鳥需要充分休息。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TEENBIRD.STARVING"
msgid "Are you trying to eat me out of base and home?"
msgstr "你是想把我吃得傾家蕩產嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.GEMS"
msgid "It requires more purple gems."
msgstr "它需要更多的紫寶石。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEBASE.VALID"
msgid "It is operational."
msgstr "它正在運轉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.ACTIVE"
msgid "Where shall we go, thing?"
msgstr "你說我們該去哪裡呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.GENERIC"
msgid "It leads somewhere. And that is what I am afraid of."
msgstr "它通往某個地方，這正是我害怕的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.LOCKED"
msgid "It denies my access."
msgstr "它拒絕了我的訪問。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BASE.PARTIAL"
msgid "It requires something additional."
msgstr "它還需要別的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_BOX"
msgid "\"This\" likely connects to a \"that.\""
msgstr "這東西很可能要連到某個東西上。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_CRANK"
msgid "Definitely for a cranking action of some kind."
msgstr "顯然是用來完成某種轉動動作的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_POTATO"
msgid "This, I do not even..."
msgstr "這個，我甚至都沒有..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELEPORTATO_RING"
msgid "One ring to teleport them all!"
msgstr "至尊戒，行諸界！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TELESTAFF"
msgid "Let us take a trip. I am not picky as to where."
msgstr "讓我們來場旅行，我不在乎去哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENT.BURNT"
msgid "A good night's sleep, up in smoke."
msgstr "美夢成雲煙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENT.GENERIC"
msgid "For roughing it."
msgstr "湊合著用用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE"
msgid "Calamari?"
msgstr "魷魚？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPIKE"
msgid "This would stick in my throat."
msgstr "它會像魚刺一樣梗在我的喉嚨裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLESPOTS"
msgid "Would make a decent kitchen rag."
msgstr "可以做一塊不錯的廚房抹布。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_GARDEN"
msgid "If only it were squid and not... whatever it is..."
msgstr "如果它是魷魚而不是現在這樣...那該多好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR"
msgid "If only it were squid and not... whatever it is..."
msgstr "如果它是魷魚而不是現在這樣...那該多好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_ARM"
msgid "If only it were squid and not... whatever it is..."
msgstr "如果它是魷魚而不是現在這樣...那該多好..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TENTACLE_PILLAR_HOLE"
msgid "I'm ready to take the plunge."
msgstr "我準備好縱身一躍了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.COOLDOWN"
msgid "For now, all seems well."
msgstr "暫時風平浪靜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.CRIMSON"
msgid "That petit tree doesn't look well at all."
msgstr "那棵小樹看起來一點都不健康。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.ENABLED"
msgid "What a lovely and fearsome light!"
msgstr "既可愛又可怕的光！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.GENERIC"
msgid "Is that broccoli growing inside? Non, it's a tiny tree!"
msgstr "裡面長的是西蘭花嗎？不是，是一棵小樹！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.SPAWN_DISABLED"
msgid "I think I'll sleep a bit better now."
msgstr "我現在會睡得好一點了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUM.WAITING_FOR_DARK"
msgid "I feel as though it's cooking up something..."
msgstr "我覺得它好像在醞釀著什麼……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.BURNT"
msgid "C'est fini."
msgstr "完成了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "It doesn't look quite so strange now, non?"
msgstr "現在看起來不那麼奇怪了，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TERRARIUMCHEST.SHIMMER"
msgid "Mon dieu, I think my eyes are playing tricks on me..."
msgstr "我的天啊，我的雙眼居然想捉弄我……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE"
msgid "Thule-... thulec-... it rolls off the tongue, does it not?"
msgstr "銩...銩...順口就念出來了，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITEBUGNET"
msgid "I don't mind the taste of bug."
msgstr "我不介意蟲子的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THULECITE_PIECES"
msgid "A pocketful of thule."
msgstr "一口袋銩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.THURIBLE"
msgid "It smells like a dish that's begun to burn."
msgstr "聞起來像是快要焦的菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.ABANDONED"
msgid "Perhaps we'll try again later, non?"
msgstr "我們一會兒再試一次，怎麼樣？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.GENERIC"
msgid "He looks very well fed."
msgstr "他看起來吃得很飽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.LOST_TRACK"
msgid "What's wrong, monsieur? Did you lose the scent?"
msgstr "怎麼了，先生？你找不到氣味了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NEARBY"
msgid "Hmm, I wonder if there's one nearby?"
msgstr "嗯，不知道附近是不是有一隻？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.NOTHING_TO_TRACK"
msgid "Perhaps there's nothing left to find."
msgstr "也許沒剩下什麼要找的了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.SUCCESS"
msgid "Ah, he found something!"
msgstr "啊，他有發現！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TARGET_TOO_FAR_AWAY"
msgid "Maybe we should try elsewhere, non?"
msgstr "我們也許應該換個地方試試，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING"
msgid "Something has caught his attention."
msgstr "有東西引起了他的注意。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TICOON.TRACKING_NOT_MINE"
msgid "Oh excusez-moi, I didn't know you were preoccupied!"
msgstr "噢，抱歉，我不知道你已經有安排了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED"
msgid "I'm afraid you're bothering the other plants, mon ami."
msgstr "恐怕你打擾到其他植物了，我的朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEEDSALVE"
msgid "Those weeds turned out to be a useful ingredient after all."
msgstr "那些雜草原來還是一種有用的食材。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TILLWEED_DRIED"
msgid "A fine ingredient!"
msgstr "上等的原料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.GENERIC"
msgid "What massive legs you have!"
msgstr "你的腿真粗！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL.RAGE"
msgid "It seems quite mad now!"
msgstr "它好像很生氣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.EMPTY"
msgid "Was there supposed to be something here?"
msgstr "這裡本應該有什麼嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.GENERIC"
msgid "How delectable! I should chop it down."
msgstr "棒極了！我要砍下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOADSTOOL_CAP.INGROUND"
msgid "What's that poking out?"
msgstr "突出來的是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO"
msgid "Mmm... I can smell the sauces already."
msgstr "嗯，我已經能聞到醬汁的美味了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_COOKED"
msgid "A nice light snack."
msgstr "很好的零食。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_OVERSIZED"
msgid "What a formidable tomato!"
msgstr "多麼強大的番茄啊!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOMATO_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from these?"
msgstr "能長出什麼新鮮的原料呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT"
msgid "For a night out on the town...?"
msgstr "晚上戴著它去城裡尋開心...？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOPHAT_MAGICIAN"
msgid "I can't think of any occasion I'd wear that to."
msgstr "我沒有戴它的場合。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TORCH"
msgid "Not great for caramelizing crème brûlée, but it will do for seeing."
msgstr "不適合烤焦糖布丁，但是能提供點視野。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOURTIERE"
msgid "Ah oui, now that's a meat pie!"
msgstr "啊，這就對了，這才是肉餅應有的樣子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.ACTIVE"
msgid "Ready to receive the dinner guests."
msgstr "準備好迎接晚宴的客人了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Is someone coming for dinner?"
msgstr "晚宴的客人要到了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.ACTIVE"
msgid "Well, it will be quicker at least."
msgstr "至少能快點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TOWNPORTALTALISMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "The sensation takes some getting used to."
msgstr "這種感覺需要花點時間適應。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAILMIX"
msgid "Energy food!"
msgstr "高能量食物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAILS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAILS"
msgid "Be gentle, please!"
msgstr "請溫柔待我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRANSISTOR"
msgid "Positively charged to get my hands on one!"
msgstr "帶正電的小零件，我忍不住想擁有！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP"
msgid "I do not wish to be so tricky, but the dinner bell calls me."
msgstr "我不想使詭計，但開飯的鈴聲在召喚我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_BRAMBLE"
msgid "My salady friend made this."
msgstr "沙拉朋友做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's cooled off."
msgstr "它冷卻下來了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HELD"
msgid "I'm cooking up a plan..."
msgstr "我正在醖釀一個計劃……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.HOT"
msgid "My pursuers will be well roasted."
msgstr "誰敢追我就等着被烤熟吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_FUMAROLE.WARM"
msgid "It's been reduced to medium-low."
msgstr "火力已經調成中小火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.CLOSED"
msgid "Don't take a bite out of me!"
msgstr "千萬別咬我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_STARFISH.GENERIC"
msgid "That's an unusual looking starfish."
msgstr "那海星長得真奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH"
msgid "This is not a cruelty-free trap."
msgstr "這是個殘忍的陷阱。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRAP_TEETH_MAXWELL"
msgid "I must remember where this is..."
msgstr "我一定得記起這是哪裡..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.BURNT"
msgid "Its treasure-chesting days are over."
msgstr "它作為藏寶箱的日子結束了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "Treasure!"
msgstr "寶藏！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "The real treasure is the extra storage space."
msgstr "真正的寶藏是額外的存儲空間。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREASURECHEST_TRAP"
msgid "Hmmm, something does not feel right about this..."
msgstr "嗯，我感覺這個有點不對勁..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREECLUMP"
msgid "Someone or something does not want me to tree-spass."
msgstr "有什麼人或什麼東西不想我穿過這片樹叢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREEGROWTHSOLUTION"
msgid "A growing tree should eat well!"
msgstr "一棵成長中的樹一定不能缺營養！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.BURNING"
msgid "Smells like roasting vegetables."
msgstr "聞起來像燒烤時蔬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.CHOPPED"
msgid "It is ready to harvest."
msgstr "可以收穫了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm. Minerals and fiber."
msgstr "嗯。礦物質和纖維。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SAPLING"
msgid "A fine young sapling."
msgstr "鮮嫩的小樹苗。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TREE_ROCK_SEED"
msgid "First we plant, then we harvest."
msgstr "先播種，後收穫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRIDENT"
msgid "What dish could accomodate a fork of that size?"
msgstr "什麼樣的料理才用得到這樣大的叉子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_1"
msgid "Someone must have really lost their marbles."
msgstr "肯定有人真的掉了彈珠。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_10"
msgid "Manmade masticators."
msgstr "人造咀嚼器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_11"
msgid "He doesn't seem trustworthy to me."
msgstr "他看起來不值得我信任。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_12"
msgid "I know of no recipe that calls for this."
msgstr "我不知道有什麼菜譜需要這東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_13"
msgid "You'd look so sweet in your own little garden."
msgstr "你在你自己的小花園裡會看著非常可愛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_14"
msgid "I could still use this for measuring."
msgstr "我還是可以拿這個來量東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_15"
msgid "What is your angle, mon ami?"
msgstr "你想怎麼做，朋友？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_16"
msgid "What is your angle, mon ami?"
msgstr "你想怎麼做，朋友？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_17"
msgid "A pity."
msgstr "遺憾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_18"
msgid "What could be inside?"
msgstr "裡面會是什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_19"
msgid "It's having a hard time staying upright."
msgstr "它很難保持直立。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_2"
msgid "I'll hum my own tune."
msgstr "我會哼出自己的調子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_20"
msgid "You scratch my back, I scratch yours, non?"
msgstr "你把我的背抓傷了，我也會把你抓傷，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_21"
msgid "No kitchen is complete without one."
msgstr "少了這個就不是完整的廚房了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TRINKET_22
