msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SAVANNA"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SHELLBEACH"
