msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_SINKHOLE"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_UNDERROCK"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_VAULT"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_VENT"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURF_WOODFLOOR"
msgid "It's like an ingredient for the ground."
msgstr "這就像是一種給地面的調料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURKEYDINNER"
msgid "I'm getting sleepy just looking at it!"
msgstr "只是看著它我就困了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP"
msgid "Root vegetables are at the root of all good meals."
msgstr "根塊類的蔬菜是所有美食的根本。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_COOKED"
msgid "It will do in a pinch, but I can do better."
msgstr "這樣也能吃，不過我能做的更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURNIP_SEEDS"
msgid "What fresh ingredients will grow from these?"
msgstr "能長出什麼新鮮的原料呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TURTILLUS"
msgid "They seem a bit prickly, non?"
msgstr "是不是有點尖了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNING"
msgid "It, oh, it appears to be on fire."
msgstr "它，哦，它似乎著火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.BURNT"
msgid "Crisp, no?"
msgstr "很脆，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "No more for now."
msgstr "沒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.DISEASED"
msgid "It's under the weather."
msgstr "狀態不太好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGYTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It's a tree made of kabob sticks."
msgstr "長滿了烤肉籤子的樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT"
msgid "It will grow into a fine tree."
msgstr "會長成一棵好樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_NUT_SAPLING"
msgid "Just a petite bébé."
msgstr "是一個小寶寶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGGY_OLD"
msgid "That tree looks like it's on its way out."
msgstr "這棵樹快要去了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWIGS"
msgid "The start of a good cooking fire."
msgstr "用來生火做飯的好材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR1"
msgid "I promise, I'm not as delicious as I appear!"
msgstr "我保證，我並不像看起來那麼好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.TWINOFTERROR2"
msgid "I promise, I'm not as delicious as I appear!"
msgstr "我保證，我並不像看起來那麼好吃！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UMBRELLA"
msgid "I will try to remember not to open indoors."
msgstr "我會試著記住不要在室內打傘。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UNAGI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UNAGI"
msgid "More like \"umami\"! Ooooh, mommy!"
msgstr "媽呀！好鮮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.UNIMPLEMENTED"
msgid "It appears unfinished."
msgstr "看起來還沒完成。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CHANDELIER_BROKEN"
msgid "Lucky I was not standing under when it fell!"
msgstr "幸好它掉下來時我沒站在下面！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.GENERIC"
msgid "I love it when there are directions!"
msgstr "有指引可太好了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.KEYROOM"
msgid "Voilà! Here we are!"
msgstr "哇啦！我們到了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_COMPASS.NOTVAULT"
msgid "It is of no use to me here."
msgstr "在這裏它對我毫無用處。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.GENERIC"
msgid "It seems we have company."
msgstr "看來我們有伴了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER.SOCKETED"
msgid "That guest has been seated!"
msgstr "賓客已經入座了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_CRAWLER_LEVER"
msgid "I wonder what might happen if I pull that lever?"
msgstr "我想知道拉動那根拉桿會怎樣？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_DOOR"
msgid "It seems they were very particular about who was invited in."
msgstr "看來它們對誰能受邀進入非常挑剔。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_DECON_MISTER"
msgid "I suppose the way it works has been lost to time."
msgstr "它的工作原理多半已經失傳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY"
msgid "What secrets might it unlock?"
msgstr "它會揭開什麼秘密呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_ACTIVATOR"
msgid "There is an important ingredient missing."
msgstr "缺少了一味關鍵原料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_EXIT"
msgid "I cannot climb back up!"
msgstr "我爬不回去了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "An ominous centerpiece!"
msgstr "不祥的餐桌擺件！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_KEY_PEDESTAL.PICKED"
msgid "It has been taken!"
msgstr "它被拿走了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_LOBBY_EXIT"
msgid "A rope would make my descent slightly less nerve-wracking, non?"
msgstr "有根繩子的話，我下去的時候就不會那麼心驚膽戰了，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB"
msgid "Is it a part of something?"
msgstr "這是某個東西的一部分嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_ORB_REFINED"
msgid "Voila! Beautiful!"
msgstr "哇啦！大美啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD"
msgid "How do I keep getting mixed up in these things..."
msgstr "我怎麼老是捲進這種事情裏……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR"
msgid "What are the missing ingredients?"
msgstr "還缺哪幾味原料？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CONSTR_PLANS"
msgid "Important ingredients for the big tower!"
msgstr "這是大塔的重要原料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_CRAFTED"
msgid "Keep out the unruly customers!"
msgstr "把難纏的食客擋在外面！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT"
msgid "That is a bold design."
msgstr "那是個大膽的設計。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_DORMANT_CRAFTED"
msgid "This appliance needs a power source."
msgstr "這台電器需要能量源。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_PILLAR_GUARD_PIECE"
msgid "Ah yes, an ingredient for the tower!"
msgstr "啊沒錯，一味塔的原料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_REFINER_PEDESTAL"
msgid "It looks like a fancy mixer."
msgstr "它看起來像台高級攪拌機。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_RUNE"
msgid "I have no idea."
msgstr "我完全看不懂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE1"
msgid "Oh my, he's rotting."
msgstr "天啊，他在腐爛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE2"
msgid "The end of the bugs?"
msgstr "蟲子的結局？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_STATUE.LORE3"
msgid "I am relieved they are only statues."
msgstr "幸好它們只是雕像。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.BROKEN"
msgid "It is in need of repair."
msgstr "它需要修理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Instant people delivery!"
msgstr "即時人員傳送！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TELEPORTER.UNPOWERED"
msgid "There is no juice."
msgstr "沒電了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.BROKEN"
msgid "I'm afraid the switch is broken."
msgstr "恐怕開關已壞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VAULT_TORCH.GENERIC"
msgid "Mood lighting!"
msgstr "氛圍燈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGGIEOMLET"
msgid "The best way to start the day is with a hot breakfast."
msgstr "開始新的一天的最佳方式是享用熱早餐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGGIE_OVERSIZED_ROTTEN"
msgid "Non! What a terrible waste!"
msgstr "不！多麼可怕的浪費！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VEGSTINGER"
msgid "Add a little spice."
msgstr "加一點香料."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VICTORIAN_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "It's hard not to think about seafood with all these scalloped edges."
msgstr "這些扇貝狀的邊角很難讓人不想到海鮮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "Leftovers from those nightmares."
msgstr "噩夢的剩飯剩菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTHHAT"
msgid "To protect my head while unraveling my mind."
msgstr "在保護頭部的同時還能解開我思想上的疙瘩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_BOOMERANG"
msgid "Many happy returns!"
msgstr "高興的飛回！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_KIT"
msgid "I usually whip things up from scratch."
msgstr "我習慣從頭開始處理。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_SCYTHE"
msgid "Did I just see it twitch?"
msgstr "它剛剛是抽搐了一下嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOIDCLOTH_UMBRELLA"
msgid "I fear it will bring bad luck whether it's opened indoors or not."
msgstr "恐怕在不在室內打開，它都會帶來厄運。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.VOLTGOATJELLY"
msgid "I ground the horns up myself."
msgstr "我親手研磨的羊角。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAFFLES"
msgid "Oh, brunch, I have missed you so!"
msgstr "噢，早午餐，我好想念你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT"
msgid "But can it cook a soufflé?"
msgstr "它做得了蛋奶酥嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE"
msgid "The main course?"
msgstr "這是主菜了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CONSTRUCTIONSITE_KIT"
msgid "Must be vacuum packed!"
msgstr "真空包裝！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_CREATION_PARTS"
msgid "These must be the sides."
msgstr "這些多半是小菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_LEG"
msgid "The legs are very tough!"
msgstr "這腿可真結實！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_POSSESSED"
msgid "Sorry! I'm sure you make great soufflés!"
msgstr "我錯了！我敢肯定你做的蛋奶酥很棒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGBOSS_ROBOT_SECRET"
msgid "Some sort of centerpiece?"
msgstr "個性款餐桌擺件？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_BEACON"
msgid "So the petit blender will not spin out of control."
msgstr "這樣小攪拌機就不會失控了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.DAMAGED"
msgid "These leftovers can only be used to fix another!"
msgstr "這些剩下的東西只能用作維修了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.GENERIC"
msgid "This is overwhelming!"
msgstr "受不了了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_FLYING.INACTIVE"
msgid "Maybe it can chop veggies?"
msgstr "也許它能切菜？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_PARTS"
msgid "It looks like part of a cake mixer."
msgstr "這看起來像是蛋糕攪拌機的一部分。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.DAMAGED"
msgid "I can repair it or use the parts to repair another."
msgstr "我可以修好它，或者用零件修理相同產品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.FRIENDLY"
msgid "A portable chopper."
msgstr "便攜破壁機。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.GENERIC"
msgid "They are running amok!"
msgstr "這下徹底失控了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGDRONE_ROLLING.INACTIVE"
msgid "Maybe it can mix batter?"
msgstr "也許它能攪拌麵糊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKBITS_KIT"
msgid "Reminds me of my mixer."
msgstr "讓我想起了我的攪拌機。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNKHAT"
msgid "It stirs up such pugnacious thoughts in my mind!"
msgstr "激起了我好鬥的心理！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_BITS"
msgid "Ingredients for some sort of machine?"
msgstr "某種機器的原料？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_CAGEWALL"
msgid "This will be a private party."
msgstr "這將是一場私人派對。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_FLOOR_KIT"
msgid "We are expanding this location!"
msgstr "我們要在這裡擴建！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_LEVER"
msgid "What appliance is this for?"
msgstr "這是控制什麼家電的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGPUNK_WORKSTATION"
msgid "But does it blend?"
msgstr "但它能攪拌嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_1"
msgid "The glove is... solid?"
msgstr "這手套是……實體的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_ITEM_2"
msgid "Why can I touch this?"
msgstr "為什麼我能摸到這個？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MACHINERY"
msgid "Abandoned."
msgstr "被遺棄了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_MUTATIONS_NOTE"
msgid "Zut alors! I thought it would be a recipe!"
msgstr "混帳！我還以為是菜譜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC"
msgid "Bonjour! Are you in need of assistance?"
msgstr "你好！你需要幫助嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_MUTATIONS"
msgid "Monsieur, I aim to please."
msgstr "先生，我願意取悅您。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_NPC_WAGPUNK"
msgid "The gentleman is in a rush to get somewhere."
msgstr "這位紳士急著走。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_1"
msgid "This must be what I'm looking for!"
msgstr "這應該就是我在找的東西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_2"
msgid "Surely this must be the tool he wants?"
msgstr "這應該就是他想要的工具吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_3"
msgid "That certainly looks like a scientific tool of some sort!"
msgstr "那個一看就是某種科學工具！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_4"
msgid "Perhaps that is what he is looking for?"
msgstr "也許這就是他在找的東西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAGSTAFF_TOOL_5"
msgid "It's a tool of some sort, hopefully the one I'm looking for."
msgstr "它是某種工具，希望是我要找的那種。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK"
msgid "That doesn't look safe."
msgstr "看起來不太安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_ANCIENT"
msgid "That doesn't look safe."
msgstr "看起來不太安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_GRASS"
msgid "That doesn't look safe."
msgstr "看起來不太安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKINGPLANK_YOTD"
msgid "That doesn't look safe... but it does look quite nice."
msgstr "看起來不太安全……但樣式確實漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALKING_STICK"
msgid "A well made walking cane."
msgstr "製作精良的手杖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE"
msgid "A bit unsettling, non?"
msgstr "有點令人不安，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_DREADSTONE_ITEM"
msgid "Oh dear, did I just hear it whisper?"
msgstr "我的天，我剛剛是聽到它說悄悄話了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.BURNT"
msgid "That is what I expected."
msgstr "和我預料中一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY.GENERIC"
msgid "Calling it a \"wall\" is kind of a stretch."
msgstr "稱它為“牆”有些勉強。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_HAY_ITEM"
msgid "Hay look, a wall!"
msgstr "嘿快看，一堵草牆！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK"
msgid "I do kind of wish it was made of cheese."
msgstr "我真希望它是乳酪做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_MOONROCK_ITEM"
msgid "I can't believe this was once on the moon."
msgstr "不敢相信這曾是月亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS"
msgid "Look at the carvings..."
msgstr "看看這雕花的手藝..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_2"
msgid "Look at the carvings..."
msgstr "看看這雕花的手藝..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_RUINS_ITEM"
msgid "The stories these tell... fascinating..."
msgstr "這些東西所講述的故事...很有意思..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP"
msgid "It was just thrown together."
msgstr "就是隨便扔到一起的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_SCRAP_ITEM"
msgid "It was just thrown together."
msgstr "就是隨便扔到一起的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE"
msgid "Good stone work."
msgstr "不錯的石製品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_2"
msgid "Good stone work."
msgstr "不錯的石製品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_STONE_ITEM"
msgid "I feel secure behind this."
msgstr "在牆後我感到很安全。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.BURNT"
msgid "Wood burns. Who knew? ...Me!?"
msgstr "木頭是易燃物。誰知道呢？...我嗎！？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD.GENERIC"
msgid "Putting down stakes."
msgstr "放置木樁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALL_WOOD_ITEM"
msgid "Delivers a rather wooden performance as a wall."
msgstr "可以修成一堵相當呆板的木牆。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS"
msgid "They move faster than you'd think."
msgstr "它們的行動速度比你以為的快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUSHAT"
msgid "Smells a little musty..."
msgstr "聞起來有點黴味..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.EMPTY"
msgid "Yes, vacancy."
msgstr "是的，是空的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_CAMP.GENERIC"
msgid "Some outdoorsy types made this."
msgstr "一些喜歡野外生活的人造了這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALRUS_TUSK"
msgid "It won't be needing this anymore."
msgstr "它不再需要這個了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Are you trying to scare us, %s?"
msgstr "你想嚇我們嗎, %s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s, are you feeling well?"
msgstr "%s, 你還好吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GENERIC"
msgid "Salut, %s!"
msgstr "嗨，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.GHOST"
msgid "You're not finished just yet, mon ami!"
msgstr "你的生命還沒有結束，我的朋友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.MURDERER"
msgid "You are worse than the monsters from your stories!"
msgstr "你比你故事裡的怪獸還可怕！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTER.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is very helpful."
msgstr "%s非常樂於助人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WALTERHAT"
msgid "A tidy little chapeau."
msgstr "一個整潔的小蓋帽。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.ATTACKER"
msgid "That doesn't seem like a good use of your time, Mme. %s."
msgstr "你的時間用來做這個可不好，%s夫人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Is there... a reason you're setting fires, Mme. %s?"
msgstr "你放火是有什麼理由嗎，%s夫人？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, Mme. %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s夫人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.GHOST"
msgid "Let's get you back on your feet, Mme. %s!"
msgstr "我來幫助你重新站起來，%s夫人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.MURDERER"
msgid "I can never forgive you for what you've done, Mme. %s!"
msgstr "我絕不會原諒你的所作所為，%s夫人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDA.REVIVER"
msgid "I knew Mme. %s would come in my time of need."
msgstr "我就知道%s夫人會為我雪中送炭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.GENERIC"
msgid "Hmm. I wouldn't eat that one."
msgstr "呣。我可不會吃那頭牛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WANDERINGTRADER.REVEALED"
msgid "Bonjour, Monsieur Boeuf! What do you have?"
msgstr "你好啊，牛先生！你有什麼好東西？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNING"
msgid "The wardrobe is burning!"
msgstr "衣櫃在燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.BURNT"
msgid "We had some nice things in there."
msgstr "以前裡面裝過不少好東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARDROBE.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish I'd had the chance to bring more clothes with me."
msgstr "當初多帶一些衣物就好了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARG"
msgid "Leader of the pack."
msgstr "族群的首領。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Au revoir."
msgstr "別了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "The sight of it turns my stomach."
msgstr "看著它我就反胃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "This cannot be!"
msgstr "怎麼會這樣！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGLET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGLET"
msgid "I won't be put on the menu today!"
msgstr "你休想把我印上菜單！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Overcooked."
msgstr "火候過頭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Maybe it's hungry."
msgstr "也許它餓了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Dogs are nice. I should pay tribute to them."
msgstr "狗是好的動物。我們應該致敬它們。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s, why fight when we can cook?"
msgstr "%s，能做飯打什麼架?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Mon dieu! Watch the fire!"
msgstr "我的天啊！瞧瞧這火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GENERIC"
msgid "Heh. Bonjour, mon a-ME."
msgstr "呵呵，你好啊，啊，原來是我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.GHOST"
msgid "I cook so I don't have to think about my own mortality."
msgstr "我烹飪是為了不用去煩惱生死。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.MURDERER"
msgid "Mon dieu! I'm a monster!"
msgstr "我的天啊！我是個怪獸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WARLY.REVIVER"
msgid "It's quite nice to have myself around."
msgstr "有我自己在真好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAR_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Dressing for some rather tough beef!"
msgstr "十分堅硬的牛肉品相！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WASPHIVE"
msgid "Not your average bees."
msgstr "裡面不是普通的蜜蜂。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERBALLOON"
msgid "A balloon, filled with water? What a funny idea."
msgstr "氣球，塞了水？多麼有趣的點子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.EMPTY"
msgid "Perhaps there's a lake nearby..."
msgstr "也許附近能有個湖……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERINGCAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Perhaps the garden might like a little drink, non?"
msgstr "也許園子想喝點兒了，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON"
msgid "Despite its name, it is mostly filled with deliciousness!"
msgstr "雖然名字很平淡，但瓜肉很美味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONHAT"
msgid "Aaaahhhhhh sweet relief..."
msgstr "啊啊啊啊啊，甜蜜的降溫方式..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELONICLE"
msgid "I feel like a kid again!"
msgstr "我感覺又回到了童年！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_COOKED"
msgid "Could use mint and feta..."
msgstr "可以加點薄荷和羊乳酪..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I'm sure I can find a use for all this watermelon."
msgstr "我相信我一定能找到這些西瓜的用途。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERMELON_SEEDS"
msgid "Future ingredients, just waiting to be grown!"
msgstr "未來的食材，就等著你來種!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT"
msgid "Oh my! It's lovely!"
msgstr "哦，我的天！真可愛！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BABY"
msgid "It's growing nicely."
msgstr "它長得很好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_BOMB"
msgid "Pardonnez-moi! I didn't realize those barnacles were yours!"
msgstr "對不起，我不知道那些藤壺是你的！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPLANT_PLANTER"
msgid "Where shall I start planting my sea garden?"
msgstr "我應該從哪裡開始種植我的海上花園？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERPUMP"
msgid "Fires on a ship are not to be taken lightly."
msgstr "船上發生火災，不可掉以輕心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_PILLAR"
msgid "Une grande surprise!"
msgstr "一個巨大的驚喜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATERTREE_ROOT"
msgid "A lonely tree root."
msgstr "孤單的樹根。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.ATTACKER"
msgid "I fear %s more than anyone here."
msgstr "我最害怕%s了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s's fires burn as wildly as her passions."
msgstr "%s的火如同她的激情一樣，熊熊燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.GHOST"
msgid "I'm surprised I outlived %s, frankly."
msgstr "我還挺吃驚的，我竟然活的比%s長，說真的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.MURDERER"
msgid "%s has done something truly abominable."
msgstr "%s幹了一件大壞事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR.REVIVER"
msgid "%s is a great ally, indeed."
msgstr "%s確實是位偉大的盟友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHRHAT"
msgid "I don't have the confidence to pull it off like she does."
msgstr "我沒自信能戴出她的效果。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_IMPROVEDHAT"
msgid "Mademoiselle Wigfrid does have a very commanding presence."
msgstr "薇格弗德確實有統帥風範。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WATHGRITHR_SHIELD"
msgid "Mon dieu, it's heavier than it looks!"
msgstr "我的天啊，沒看出來這麼沉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXED_PLANT"
msgid "Tsk, filled with preservatives!"
msgstr "嘖嘖，加滿了添加劑！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXPAPER"
msgid "Wax paper! Always useful in the kitchen."
msgstr "蠟紙耶！在廚房總會有用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.ATTACKER"
msgid "%s has been irritable lately."
msgstr "%s最近特別惹人嫌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Let's not trust %s with flammable things for now."
msgstr "暫時別給%s易燃品。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GENERIC"
msgid "Salut, %s."
msgstr "嗨，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.GHOST"
msgid "That looks very uncomfortable."
msgstr "看起來很不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.MURDERER"
msgid "I may not have it in me to forgive %s."
msgstr "我的境界還不到能原諒%s的地步。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELL.REVIVER"
msgid "%s isn't bad, just a little crunchy on the outside."
msgstr "%s並不壞，只是有個堅硬的外殼."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WAXWELLJOURNAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Maman used to keep a journal, before her memory went."
msgstr "媽媽在記憶裡衰退前曾經寫過一本日記。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.ATTACKER"
msgid "What have you been up to, petit monsieur?"
msgstr "你最近在幹嘛，小先生？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Fire is dangerous you know, petit monsieur."
msgstr "小先生，火很危險的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GENERIC"
msgid "Salut, petit monsieur %s."
msgstr "嗨, 小%s先生."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.GHOST"
msgid "Oh, you poor thing."
msgstr "哦，你這個可憐的傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.MURDERER"
msgid "What a terrible creature."
msgstr "多麼可怕的生物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER.REVIVER"
msgid "I should make him a little treat later."
msgstr "我稍後要給他做點好吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBERSKULL"
msgid "Stop staring at me or I'll bury you!"
msgstr "別盯著我，不然我會埋了你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEBBER_SPIDER_MINION"
msgid "Oh, my. Bonjour, petit araignée."
msgstr "哎呀呀。你好，小蜘蛛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEED_IVY"
msgid "What are you doing in my lovely garden?"
msgstr "你在我可愛的花園裡做什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.ATTACKER"
msgid "Have you been up to mischief, Mademoiselle %s?"
msgstr "最近又淘氣了，%s小姐？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "You know better than to set flames, Mademoiselle %s."
msgstr "不要淘氣放火，%s小姐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GENERIC"
msgid "Salut, Mademoiselle %s."
msgstr "嗨，%s小姐。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.GHOST"
msgid "Oh non, non, non. Let's get you fixed up."
msgstr "哦，不不不。咱們把你修好吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.MURDERER"
msgid "She's inflicted her grief upon others. Abominable."
msgstr "她把悲痛發洩到了別人身上。令人髮指。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY.REVIVER"
msgid "I'll cook her favorite dish for supper tonight."
msgstr "今天晚餐，我要做她最喜歡的菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WENDY_RESURRECTIONGRAVE"
msgid "C'est la vie."
msgstr "這就是生活。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_BEAVER"
msgid "You're mastering this curse business, mon ami!"
msgstr "你熟練掌握了詛咒這門手藝，我的朋友！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_GOOSE"
msgid "Well... that certainly is... something."
msgstr "好吧...那肯定...很厲害。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WEREITEM_MOOSE"
msgid "Excusez-moi, but why does this smell like meat?"
msgstr "抱歉，為什麼這個有肉味？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.ATTACKER"
msgid "I didn't expect him to be the violent sort."
msgstr "真沒料到他這麼暴力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "Watch where you light those fires, %s."
msgstr "小心點，不要到處點火，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.GHOST"
msgid "Is there a medic on this island?"
msgstr "島上有醫務員嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.MURDERER"
msgid "What a terrible act you've committed."
msgstr "看看你做了多惡劣的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WES.REVIVER"
msgid "I love your act, by the way."
msgstr "順便說一下，我特別欣賞你的表演。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETGOOP"
msgid "Thankfully my sous chefs aren't here to witness this abomination..."
msgstr "還好我的幫廚沒有看到這醜惡的一幕..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETPAPER"
msgid "It's a tiny bit soggy."
msgstr "被水浸的濕噠噠的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WETPOUCH"
msgid "I hope the contents don't fall out."
msgstr "希望裡面的東西別掉出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WHIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WHIP"
msgid "I'd rather whip up a nice meringue."
msgstr "我寧可打點蛋白霜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.ATTACKER"
msgid "I thought you were more responsible that that, Mme. %s."
msgstr "本以為你是個靠譜的人呢，%s夫人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I assume she meant it to be a controlled burn."
msgstr "她應該以為能控制住火勢吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, Mme. %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s夫人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.GHOST"
msgid "It's not your time to go quite yet, Mme. %s."
msgstr "你還不能沉默，%s夫人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.MURDERER"
msgid "Mme. %s has done an unthinkable deed."
msgstr "%s夫人幹了一件不可思議的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WICKERBOTTOM.REVIVER"
msgid "Mme. %s is a reliable sort."
msgstr "%s夫人是個靠譜的人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.ATTACKER"
msgid "Been in a tussle recently, %s?"
msgstr "最近約架了，%s？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "She was bound to start a fire sometime."
msgstr "她遲早要縱火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GENERIC"
msgid "Salut, %s!"
msgstr "嗨，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.GHOST"
msgid "Would a nice bowl of hot soup help?"
msgstr "來一碗美味的熱湯會好點嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.MURDERER"
msgid "I've burned my bridges with that one."
msgstr "我跟那個人已經沒有回頭路了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW.REVIVER"
msgid "You can rely on %s when it's important."
msgstr "%s在關鍵時候能靠得住。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILLOW_EMBER"
msgid "only_used_by_willow"
msgstr "only_used_by_willow"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.ATTACKER"
msgid "Let's all calm down with a nice bowl of soup."
msgstr "美美喝一碗湯冷靜冷靜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "I don't want to nitpick how you light fires, but..."
msgstr "我不想挑剔你點火的方式，但是..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.GHOST"
msgid "Oh my. Does that hurt?"
msgstr "哎呀。痛不痛啊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.MURDERER"
msgid "Mon dieu! You're a murderer!"
msgstr "我的天啊！你是個殺人兇手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WILSON.REVIVER"
msgid "You've been a big help, %s."
msgstr "你幫了大忙了，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.GENERIC"
msgid "It reminds me a bit of my days on the trawler."
msgstr "讓我想起了那些在拖網漁船上的日子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.HOLDING_ITEM"
msgid "Just what have I fished from the depths?"
msgstr "我從深淵裡釣出了什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINCH.RETRIEVING_ITEM"
msgid "Ah bon! I've caught something!"
msgstr "啊，太棒了！我抓到了個東西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.ATTACKER"
msgid "You've been much too rough lately, %s."
msgstr "你最近有些過於粗魯了，%s。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.FIRESTARTER"
msgid "%s started quite the fire recently."
msgstr "%s最近到處縱火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GENERIC"
msgid "Bonjour, %s!"
msgstr "你好，%s！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.GHOST"
msgid "Let's fix you up, alright?"
msgstr "咱們把你修好，好不好？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.MURDERER"
msgid "She's done a truly awful thing."
msgstr "她幹了件大壞事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA.REVIVER"
msgid "I admire %s's sense of duty."
msgstr "我欽佩%s的使命感。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNING"
msgid "It, oh, it appears to be on fire."
msgstr "它，哦，它似乎著火了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.BURNT"
msgid "Crisp, non?"
msgstr "脆不脆？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.GENERIC"
msgid "It's nice to have Winona around."
msgstr "有薇諾娜在真好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.LOWPOWER"
msgid "It's getting a bit low, Winona."
msgstr "電量在變低，薇諾娜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OFF"
msgid "What sort of fuel does this take?"
msgstr "它用什麼燃料呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_HIGH.OVERLOADED"
msgid "Too hot!"
msgstr "太熱了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.WINONA_BATTERY_LOW.BURNING
