msgstr "總算沒東西著火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOHORTICULTURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ACTIONFAIL.READ.NOHORTICULTURE"
