msgstr "是時候打敗草率撤退的人了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_KLAUS_UNCHAINED"
msgid "Its true power has been unlocked!"
msgstr "它的真正的力量已經被解鎖！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_KNOCKEDOUT"
msgid "Ugh. My head hurts."
msgstr "呃。腦袋好疼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTNING_DAMAGE_AVOIDED"
msgid "Can't touch this!"
msgstr "這個不能摸！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LIGHTSOUT_SHADOWHAND"
msgid "Hmm... could you be... trying to help?"
msgstr "呣……你是想……幫我嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LOWRESEARCH"
msgid "That wasn't very informative."
msgstr "它增進不了多少見識。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARGUARDIAN_INCOMING"
msgid "Again? What now?"
msgstr "又來？現在要怎樣？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_CORPSES"
msgid "That's not a good sign."
msgstr "那可不是好兆頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNARHAIL_BIRD_SOUNDS"
msgid "What is that racket?"
msgstr "是誰在聒噪？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_LUNAR_RIFT_MAX"
msgid "Something has changed..."
msgstr "有些事情已經改變了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MAX_CLOCKWORKS"
msgid "Too many of this piece on the board already, I suppose."
msgstr "棋盤上的這顆棋子多半已經夠多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MEGA_FLARE_SEEN"
msgid "That flare's going to send some poor fool into a world of trouble."
msgstr "那顆信號彈會為某個倒楣蛋帶來無窮的麻煩。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.1"
msgid "Why did I eat that accursed thing?!"
msgstr "我為什麼要吃那該死的東西？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF.2"
msgid "When will this infernal burning cease?!"
msgstr "這烈獄般的灼燒到底什麼時候才能停？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MITEGLAND_DEBUFF_DONE"
msgid "That was a mistake I won't be repeating soon."
msgstr "這個錯誤我短時間內不會再犯了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_1"
msgid "I've just had the most unpleasant feeling..."
msgstr "我剛剛有一種不愉快的感覺……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGE"
msgid "A monkey? Have I not suffered enough humiliation already?!"
msgstr "一隻猴子？難道我遭受的羞辱還不夠多嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MONKEY_CURSE_CHANGEBACK"
msgid "Nobody. Bring this up. Again."
msgstr "這事以後誰都不准再提。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.ANNOUNCE_MOONALTAR_MINE.GLASS_LOW"
