#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WINONA_CATAPULT.BURNT"
