msgid "So, what happened to you?"
msgstr "所以，你發生了什麼事情？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks flammable."
msgstr "看上去可以燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_GROUND"
msgid "I don't want to mess with that."
msgstr "我不想跟那扯上任何關係。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.HAUNTED_POCKET"
msgid "It's burning a hole in my pocket. Heh."
msgstr "我的口袋燒了個孔。嘿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL1"
msgid "Ugh, it's weird!"
msgstr "啊，好詭異！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL2"
msgid "Burning is still an option."
msgstr "還是可以選擇燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LEVEL3"
msgid "Yeah sure, it's floating now, why not."
msgstr "當然了，它現在還浮起來了，為什麼不呢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.LONG"
msgid "Looks flammable."
msgstr "看上去可以燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.MEDIUM"
msgid "Ugh, it's weird!"
msgstr "啊，好詭異！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABIGAIL_FLOWER.SOON"
msgid "Burning is still an option."
msgstr "還是可以選擇燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.ACTIVATED"
msgid "Copycat!"
msgstr "學人精！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_MINION.GENERIC"
msgid "Someone's obsessed with bugs."
msgstr "誰迷蟲子迷成這樣？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ABYSSPILLAR_TRIAL"
msgid "Just pull it already!"
msgstr "趕緊拉，等什麼！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACCOMPLISHMENT_SHRINE"
msgid "I hate that arrow!"
msgstr "我討厭那個箭頭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN"
msgid "Hey there, tree seed."
msgstr "嘿，你好啊，大樹種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN_COOKED"
msgid "Looks like you won't become a tree after all."
msgstr "看起來你終究變不成一棵樹了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ACORN_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "你很快就會長成一棵真正的樹的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ADVENTURE_PORTAL"
msgid "Maybe that leads home."
msgstr "也許那是回家的路。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHAT"
msgid "It makes the inside of my head so noisy..."
msgstr "它讓我的腦袋嗡嗡響……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIANHATSHARD"
msgid "It was surprisingly hard to pull that thing apart."
msgstr "沒想到那東西那麼難拉開。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_CONTAINED"
msgid "What's that weird machine?"
msgstr "那是什麼怪機器？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.DEAD"
msgid "Heh. Take that moon, or whatever!"
msgstr "呵。這招咋樣，月亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh, I KNEW we shouldn't have been messing with all that dumb science junk."
msgstr "呃，我早就說了別玩那些愚蠢的科學垃圾吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "It's burning white hot!"
msgstr "燒到白熱化了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE1_LUNARRIFT_GESTALT"
msgid "I bet that's the one."
msgstr "我打賭就是那個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.DEAD"
msgid "Got it for sure that time."
msgstr "那回十拿九穩了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2.GENERIC"
msgid "You think you're so tough?! Burn!"
msgstr "你覺得自己很強麼？！燒吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE2SPIKE"
msgid "Ugh, get these things out of my way!"
msgstr "呃，別讓這些東西擋了我的路！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3"
msgid "Pretty, but it'll be even prettier when it burns!"
msgstr "現在還不算漂亮，燒起來才算漂亮！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEAD"
msgid "Guess it's finally done."
msgstr "這下總算完了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3DEADORB"
msgid "Uh, hey old guy? You might not want to get that close..."
msgstr "啊，老傢伙？你可別靠太近了……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE3TRAP"
msgid "Hey, that's just playing dirty!"
msgstr "喂，你玩陰的啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ALTERGUARDIAN_PHASE4_LUNARRIFT"
msgid "What do we do? There's nothing to burn!"
msgstr "咋辦？沒東西燒呀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AMULET"
msgid "I have no idea what it does, but it feels good to wear it!"
msgstr "我不知道它是什麼，但戴著它不錯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR"
msgid "Dropping it is a lot more fun than pulling it back up."
msgstr "丟它下去比拉它起來好玩多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCHOR_ITEM"
msgid "Ooo, let's build an anchor."
msgstr "噢，我們來造一個錨吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_GEM"
msgid "It's so pretty, let's toss it in the fire!"
msgstr "太漂亮了，把它扔進火裡吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION"
msgid "Ew, is that berry... squirming?"
msgstr "呃，那個漿果是……在蠕動嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTFRUIT_NIGHTVISION_COOKED"
msgid "It's not moving anymore. Thanks, fire!"
msgstr "它不會再動了。感謝你，火焰！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.GENERIC"
msgid "It's... it's so beautiful..."
msgstr "它……它真漂亮……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_GEM.STUMP"
msgid "Nooooooooo!!"
msgstr "不！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.GENERIC"
msgid "What an ugly tree."
msgstr "這樹太醜了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_NIGHTVISION.STUMP"
msgid "It made an ugly stump too."
msgstr "留下的樹樁也是醜的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.GENERIC"
msgid "It's almost a tree."
msgstr "幾乎就是一棵樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_SEASON"
msgid "What's wrong? Is it too cold out? Too hot?"
msgstr "怎麼了？室外太冷了嗎？太熱了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING.WRONG_TILE"
msgid "I don't think it likes this type of dirt."
msgstr "我覺得它並不喜歡這種土。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SAPLING_ITEM"
msgid "I bet you want some dirt, don't ya?"
msgstr "我打賭你想要點土，對不對？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENTTREE_SEED"
msgid "Huh. That's a weird-looking seed."
msgstr "哈。那種子看起來好奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR"
msgid "Oooo! An afterlife intercom."
msgstr "哇！與來世相通。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_ALTAR_BROKEN"
msgid "The dead can't get through here."
msgstr "死靈沒法從這裡出去。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_HUSK"
msgid "Oh yeah. I know a double-cross when I see one."
msgstr "這有啥。我一看就知道誰是叛徒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANCIENT_STATUE"
msgid "Drat, won't burn."
msgstr "該死，又不會燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANIMAL_TRACK"
msgid "It leads to my new friend."
msgstr "它會引導我找到新朋友。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTCHOVIES"
msgid "They taste super salty and gross."
msgstr "他們的味道很鹹，有點噁心。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.GENERIC"
msgid "What do you want?!"
msgstr "你想要什麼？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.UNHAPPY"
msgid "There's gonna be tremors in our future."
msgstr "我們將來應該會感受到震動。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLION.VERYHAPPY"
msgid "You're in a good mood."
msgstr "你心情不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONHAT"
msgid "Pfft, what a dumb-looking hat. I love it."
msgstr "噗，這帽子看著傻傻的。我簡直愛了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ANTLIONTRINKET"
msgid "Buncha junk."
msgstr "一堆垃圾"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE"
msgid "Burn, bug!"
msgstr "燃燒吧，蟲子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_CENTIPEDE_HUSK"
msgid "Just a bunch of broken parts."
msgstr "就是些壞掉的零件。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.BURNT"
msgid "At least it went out in a blaze of glory."
msgstr "至少它是在榮耀的火焰中毀滅的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_LONG"
msgid "The fire still has quite a bit of work to do."
msgstr "火要做的工作還很多。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
msgid "The fire is doing its thing!"
msgstr "火的工作就快完成了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.DONE"
msgid "Fire makes everything better. Mmm!"
msgstr "火可以讓一切東西變得更好。嗯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_COOKPOT.EMPTY"
msgid "Fire's the best ancient invention there is!"
msgstr "火焰就是最好的遠古發明！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX"
msgid "Great. We turned on the mysterious thing and got another mysterious thing."
msgstr "這下好了。我們打開了一個神秘的東西，結果又出來了另外一個神秘的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh, I feel a puzzle coming on..."
msgstr "呃，感覺是個謎題……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_LOCKBOX_DISPENCER.POWEROFF"
msgid "Looks like it's busted."
msgstr "看起來壞掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_MOON_STATUE"
msgid "Huh. These look different from the other statues down here."
msgstr "哈。這些跟其他雕塑看起來不一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_ORCHESTRINA_MAIN"
msgid "It won't burn? Well, I'm out of ideas."
msgstr "燒不著嗎？那我可沒主意了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Shoulda known it wouldn't be that easy."
msgstr "早該料到不會這麼容易。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_PORTAL.POWEROFF"
msgid "Another portal? You don't think...?"
msgstr "又一個傳送門？會不會是……？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.GENERIC"
msgid "Point the way!"
msgstr "指明方向！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR.IDLE"
msgid "Nothing left to find, I guess."
msgstr "看來不剩什麼了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RESONATOR_ITEM"
msgid "It's humming to itself."
msgstr "它在自己哼歌。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_1"
msgid "A bunch of old mumbo jumbo."
msgstr "一堆舊東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_2"
msgid "If it doesn't burn I don't care."
msgstr "要是點不著，我就不在乎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_3"
msgid "A bunch of old mumbo jumbo."
msgstr "一堆舊東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_4"
msgid "If it doesn't burn I don't care."
msgstr "要是點不著，我就不在乎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_RUNE_STATUE.LINE_5"
msgid "A bunch of old mumbo jumbo."
msgstr "一堆舊東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.GENERIC"
msgid "Yeah, that doesn't look suspicious."
msgstr "哼，那個看起來不對勁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_DESK.POWEROFF"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's not working."
msgstr "不管怎麼樣，它都沒起任何作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SECURITY_PULSE"
msgid "Hey! Get back here!"
msgstr "喂！回來！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.GEMS"
msgid "Something's missing here."
msgstr "一定是缺少了什麼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARCHIVE_SWITCH.VALID"
msgid "I'm sure nobody would mind if I borrowed one of those gems."
msgstr "我相信沒人會介意我借用這些寶石的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORDRAGONFLY"
msgid "Yay! More FIRE!!!"
msgstr "耶！讓火來得更猛烈些吧！！！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORDREADSTONE"
msgid "It's fine I guess."
msgstr "湊合還行吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORGRASS"
msgid "A waste of flammable materials."
msgstr "浪費這麼多易燃材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORMARBLE"
msgid "If you're gonna fight you might as well be protected."
msgstr "如果你要去戰鬥，你可能也會得到保護。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORRUINS"
msgid "Human beings probably shouldn't wear this."
msgstr "人類大概不應該穿它吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSKELETON"
msgid "Can't hit me in this thing!"
msgstr "不能用這個打我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSLURPER"
msgid "Oh, ick! Ick! Ick! Ick! Eeeeeewwwwww!"
msgstr "呃，呸！呸！呸！呸！真噁心！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORSNURTLESHELL"
msgid "Less defense! More offense!"
msgstr "更少防守！更多進攻！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORWAGPUNK"
msgid "It looks pretty fireproof, but there's only one way to know for sure..."
msgstr "它看起來很防火，但只有一種方法可以確定……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMORWOOD"
msgid "Now I can take on the world!"
msgstr "現在，我可以挑戰整個世界了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_BRAMBLE"
msgid "I think Wormwood made it."
msgstr "應該是沃姆伍德做的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_CARROTLURE"
msgid "Do they come roasted?"
msgstr "它們烤熟了嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "I make it look good."
msgstr "只有穿在我身上它才好看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_LUNARPLANT_HUSK"
msgid "This must be one of Wormwood's."
msgstr "這多半是沃姆伍德的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_SANITY"
msgid "Like being wrapped in smoke."
msgstr "像被包裹在煙霧裡一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_VOIDCLOTH"
msgid "I think I look good in red."
msgstr "我覺得我穿紅色很好看。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARMOR_YOTH_KNIGHT"
msgid "Looks like it could take a beating."
msgstr "看起來挺抗揍的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.BURNT"
msgid "It said \"Don't play with matches\", but the \"Don't\" is crossed out now."
msgstr "它說“不要玩火柴”，但現在“不要”被劃掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.GENERIC"
msgid "Less reading! More burning!"
msgstr "少讀！多燒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_PANEL.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I could doodle something rude here."
msgstr "我可以在這弄些粗魯的塗鴉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.BURNT"
msgid "It said \"Don't play with matches\", but the \"Don't\" is crossed out now."
msgstr "它說“不要玩火柴”，但現在“不要”被劃掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.GENERIC"
msgid "Less reading! More burning!"
msgstr "少讀！多燒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ARROWSIGN_POST.UNWRITTEN"
msgid "I could doodle something rude here."
msgstr "我可以在這弄些粗魯的塗鴉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.GENERIC"
msgid "Leftovers from a fire. I wish it was still here."
msgstr "燒完後剩下的東西。真希望火還沒滅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_EYE_BONE"
msgid "I bet that eye thing was quite a sight wreathed in fire!"
msgstr "我猜這個長著眼睛的東西燃燒起來肯定相當壯觀！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_GLOMMERFLOWER"
msgid "I wish I saw the way that weird flower burned."
msgstr "真希望我看到了這朵奇怪的花是怎麼燃燒的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASH.REMAINS_THINGIE"
msgid "I wish this thing was still burning, whatever it was."
msgstr "不管這東西是什麼，我都希望它能繼續燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS"
msgid "They're all chewy like this. They need fire."
msgstr "它們都很耐嚼。需要一點火焰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUSSOUP"
msgid "Even water and vegetables taste better with fire."
msgstr "即使是水和蔬菜，用火煮一下也會比原來更好吃。”"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_COOKED"
msgid "Not so chewy now, are you?"
msgstr "現在好多了，對嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_OVERSIZED"
msgid "I have a feeling it'll be asparagus leftovers for a long time..."
msgstr "我感覺很長一段時間內都要吃蘆筍剩飯……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ASPARAGUS_SEEDS"
msgid "This'll make some food."
msgstr "這應該能做些吃的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.CHARGING"
msgid "Something weird's going on."
msgstr "發生了一些奇怪的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.COOLDOWN"
msgid "I'll come back another time."
msgstr "我會在另一個時間回來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.DESTABILIZING"
msgid "Is it gonna explode?!"
msgstr "它要爆炸了嗎？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.OFF"
msgid "Why would anyone want to live down here?"
msgstr "為什麼會有人想住在那下面？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_GATE.ON"
msgid "It lit up!"
msgstr "門亮了，門開了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_KEY"
msgid "The horns make it really easy to turn."
msgstr "這些角方便別人轉動它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.OFF"
msgid "Ew, creepy."
msgstr "呃，令人毛骨悚然。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_LIGHT.ON"
msgid "It's somehow even creepier when it's on."
msgstr "打開後怎麼好像更令人毛骨悚然了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_OVERGROWTH"
msgid "It's in some other language."
msgstr "這是一些其他的語言。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_1"
msgid "It's got a picture of some gross looking people."
msgstr "這是一些粗野的人的圖片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_2"
msgid "Can't tell what that was a picture of."
msgstr "不能告訴我圖片裡是什麼嗎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_3"
msgid "I think someone spilled ink on this picture."
msgstr "我覺得有人把墨濺到圖片上了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_4"
msgid "Oh, gross! The people're losing their skin in this one!"
msgstr "哦，好噁心！這張圖片裡，人們正在失去他們的皮膚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_RUBBLE.LINE_5"
msgid "It's just a picture of a city."
msgstr "這只是一張城市的圖片。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ATRIUM_STATUE"
msgid "Eerily lifelike."
msgstr "詭異又逼真。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.AXE"
msgid "It's very sharp."
msgstr "它非常鋒利。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.GENERIC"
msgid "Even the babies are ugly."
msgstr "即使是小寶寶也很醜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BABYBEEFALO.SLEEPING"
msgid "WAKE UP!"
msgstr "醒醒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACKPACK"
msgid "You could fit like a million lighters in here."
msgstr "你可以往裡面裝比如說一百萬個打火機。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BACONEGGS"
msgid "The yellow mucus-y part is gross, but the bacon is great!"
msgstr "溏心蛋黃部分有點噁心，但是培根非常美味！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALATRO_MACHINE"
msgid "Let me win or I'll set you on fire."
msgstr "讓我贏，不然我就把你燒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOON"
msgid "That's just asking to be popped."
msgstr "它剛剛是在找打。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONHAT"
msgid "Hey, a rabbit! Not bad!"
msgstr "嘿，一隻兔子！不錯啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONPARTY"
msgid "Hey, when are you gonna make a hot air balloon? I could help!"
msgstr "嘿，你什麼時候做一個熱氣球？我可以幫你！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.DEFLATED"
msgid "No flying away!"
msgstr "別飛走！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONSPEED.GENERIC"
msgid "Thanks! I'll be able to set fires twice as fast with this thing!"
msgstr "謝謝！有了它我放火可以事半功倍了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONS_EMPTY"
msgid "I could fill them with flammable gas."
msgstr "我能用可燃氣體裝滿它們。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BALLOONVEST"
msgid "Squeak-squeak-squeak! Ha ha where's Maxwell, this'll drive him crazy!"
msgstr "吱吱吱！哈哈，麥斯威爾呢，他聽到肯定要瘋掉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANABUSH"
msgid "Bananas growing outside the caves? Weird."
msgstr "香蕉長在洞穴外面？很奇怪。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANAJUICE"
msgid "Blech, it's cold!"
msgstr "哎呀，真冷啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANANAPOP"
msgid "This is the opposite of burning."
msgstr "這是燃燒的對立面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE"
msgid "Eww, no!"
msgstr "哦，不！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BANDAGE_BUTTERFLYWINGS"
msgid "Does it work on third-degree burns?"
msgstr "它對三度燒傷有效嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE"
msgid "Ew, it came from the water."
msgstr "哎呦，它是從水裡來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLEPITA"
msgid "Pita pita, barnacle eater."
msgstr "皮塔皮塔，藤壺終結者。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESTUFFEDFISHHEAD"
msgid "You know, I don't think I'm that hungry after all."
msgstr "算了，我不餓了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLESUSHI"
msgid "I can still see the barnacle hiding under there."
msgstr "我還能看到藤壺藏在下面。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLE_COOKED"
msgid "Fire made it better."
msgstr "火讓它變得更美妙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BARNACLINGUINE"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "我就不客氣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASALT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BASALT"
msgid "It's too hard to break!"
msgstr "太難鑿碎了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BAT"
msgid "Cute little guy!"
msgstr "可愛的小傢伙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATBAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATBAT"
msgid "That thing's great for batting at enemies."
msgstr "那事對打擊敵人有益。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATCAVE"
msgid "What would happen if I dropped a match in there?"
msgstr "要是我在那邊扔根火柴，會發生什麼事情呢？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATHBOMB"
msgid "I still don't want to take a bath."
msgstr "我還是不想洗澡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATNOSE"
msgid "Ewww."
msgstr "咦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.BATNOSEHAT"
msgid "Is that even a real hat?"
