msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING.INERT"
msgid "I think it could use something glittery."
msgstr "應該給它點綴點綴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CANNONTOWER"
msgid "That's not very welcoming."
msgstr "太不好客了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_CLAW"
msgid "Keep your claws off my boat!"
msgstr "你的鉗子離我的船遠點！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_ICEWALL"
msgid "Ice wall? Light'er up!"
msgstr "冰牆？把它點著燒了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB"
msgid "What's with all the pinching?"
msgstr "你這掐人還有完沒完了？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRABKING_MOB_KNIGHT"
msgid "Who ordered more crab?"
msgstr "是誰點了這麼多螃蟹？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTERLAB"
msgid "Is there anything cute in there??"
msgstr "那裡面有什麼可愛的東西嗎？？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_BULBIN"
msgid "My bulbous little buddy."
msgstr "既是小胖墩又是小伙伴。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_DRAGONLING"
msgid "We were made for each other."
msgstr "我們是為彼此而生的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EETS"
msgid "Aww, you're weird! It's kind of cute."
msgstr "嗷，你個小怪物！別説還有點可愛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_EYEOFTERROR"
msgid "Hey, looking good today!"
msgstr "嘿，你今天看起來不錯啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_GLOMLING"
msgid "Aww, I could just squish your gross lil face!"
msgstr "噢，我可以擠扁你噁心的小臉！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_KITTEN"
msgid "You're the perfect lapwarmer."
msgstr "你是完美的腿部取暖器。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LAMB"
msgid "Look at those creepy little eyes. Aww."
msgstr "看那些詭異的小眼睛。噢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_LUNARMOTHLING"
msgid "She loves flames!"
msgstr "她喜歡火焰！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PERDLING"
msgid "I could just eat you up."
msgstr "我可以就把你吃了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRITTER_PUPPY"
msgid "Hah, you don't even know you're smelly."
msgstr "哈，你甚至都不知道自己發臭了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROW.GENERIC"
msgid "I think it's waiting for me to die."
msgstr "我猜它是在等我死掉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CROW.HELD"
msgid "Not so smart now, are you?"
msgstr "聰明不起來了，對嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CRUMBS"
msgid "Haha. That little guy is losing his parts."
msgstr "哈哈。那個小傢伙零件掉了一地。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CURSED_MONKEY_TOKEN"
msgid "Is that a real tooth on it? Haha, cool."
msgstr "這上面是真牙嗎？哈哈，很酷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTGRASS"
msgid "Cut grass, ready for burning. Or maybe crafting."
msgstr "乾草是很好的燃料，也可以用來合成其他東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTLESS"
msgid "At least it'll make good firewood."
msgstr "至少它可以做很好的柴火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTLICHEN"
msgid "Blah, tastes like sawdust."
msgstr "呸，一股鋸屑的味道。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTREEDS"
msgid "Cut reeds, ready for burning. Or maybe crafting."
msgstr "采下的蘆葦是很好的燃料。也可以用來合成其他東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.CUTSTONE"
msgid "Perfectly squared for maximum enjoyment."
msgstr "完全是四四方方的，看著真舒服。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.GENERIC"
msgid "You jerk! I was just trying to help!"
msgstr "你這個混蛋！我只是想幫忙！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER.IMPRISONED"
msgid "Looks like somebody's having a bad day."
msgstr "看來有人今天心情不好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.BURIED"
msgid "He's going to be one cranky pig."
msgstr "他會變成一頭暴躁的豬。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.GENERIC"
msgid "Maybe I was wrong about him."
msgstr "也許我想錯他了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER2.HOSTILE"
msgid "Temper, temper. Some things never change."
msgstr "注意脾氣，脾氣。有些事情永遠不會改變。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.EXPOSED"
msgid "It won't break. I didn't try that hard, but still."
msgstr "它就是不斷。雖然我沒用力，但也不用這麼牢靠吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DAYWALKER_PILLAR.GENERIC"
msgid "How crazy would I have to be to try and break that pillar?"
msgstr "我得瘋成什麼樣才會想去弄斷那根柱子？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEADLYFEAST"
msgid "Fire didn't cure this dish of being nasty."
msgstr "連火也治不了這盤菜的卑鄙本性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEAD_SEA_BONES"
msgid "GROSS! What if I'd stepped on it by accident?"
msgstr "噁心！我要是不小心踩到怎麼辦？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNING"
msgid "YES! BURN!"
msgstr "就是這樣！燒吧！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.BURNT"
msgid "I wish it was still burning."
msgstr "真希望火還沒滅。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.CHOPPED"
msgid "One less tree in the world."
msgstr "世上又少了一棵樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.GENERIC"
msgid "It looks like it would burn well."
msgstr "看起來它會燒得很旺。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECIDUOUSTREE.POISON"
msgid "A fire would set'em straight."
msgstr "一把火就能讓它們老實。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECK_OF_CARDS"
msgid "If it's not a full deck, at least we have kindling."
msgstr "不怕這副牌不齊，拿來燒火也是可以的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_CENTERPIECE"
msgid "Okay."
msgstr "還行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.EMPTY"
msgid "It's empty. Might as well burn it."
msgstr "它是空的。還不如燒掉它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.FRESHLIGHT"
msgid "Not as good as a fire, but at least we won't be in the dark."
msgstr "不像火焰那麼好，但至少我們不會處於黑暗中。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.GENERIC"
msgid "Just a bunch of dumb flowers."
msgstr "只是一束愚蠢的花朵。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.OLDLIGHT"
msgid "We're gonna be in the dark soon."
msgstr "我們很快就要處於黑暗之中了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_FLOWERVASE.WILTED"
msgid "Those need replacing."
msgstr "那些需要替換。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_LAMP"
msgid "A torch works just as well."
msgstr "火炬也一樣能用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.GENERIC"
msgid "It's fine."
msgstr "還可以。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PICTUREFRAME.UNDRAWN"
msgid "My burning desire isn't to draw."
msgstr "我燃燒的欲望不是畫畫。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DECOR_PORTRAITFRAME"
msgid "It's missing the fire in their eyes."
msgstr "少了眼中的火焰。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER.ANTLER"
msgid "Don't think that horn makes you special, deer."
msgstr "不要認為那個角讓你顯得比較特別，鹿。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER.GENERIC"
msgid "I wish everyone'd stop fawning over that smelly thing!"
msgstr "我希望大家不要再對那個發出臭味的東西皺眉了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS"
msgid "Holy crap!"
msgstr "哇靠！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Nice and toasty!"
msgstr "舒服又暖和。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "That body looks cold. I should fix that."
msgstr "那具屍體看起來很冷。我應該解決這個問題。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "That's... not good."
msgstr "那可……不妙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.GENERIC"
msgid "But how will anything burn?"
msgstr "那還怎麼燒東西啊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD.NOEYEBALL"
msgid "There we go."
msgstr "好啦！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPSEYEBALL_SENTRYWARD_KIT"
msgid "Fine. I'll build it. But I might burn it later."
msgstr "好。我會建造它。但我以後可能會燒掉它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEERCLOPS_EYEBALL"
msgid "Stop staring at me!"
msgstr "不准再盯著我！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER_ANTLER"
msgid "It's a big, weird antler."
msgstr "這是個又大又怪異的鹿角。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEER_GEMMED"
msgid "Marginally better smelling than most animals here."
msgstr "至少比這裡的大部分動物的味道好一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DEPLETED_GRASS.GENERIC"
msgid "What a sorry looking piece of... grass?"
msgstr "樣子多麼淒慘的...草？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESERTHAT"
msgid "Not very stylish."
msgstr "不是非常時髦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESICCANT"
msgid "I love this stuff."
msgstr "我超喜歡這玩意兒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DESICCANTBOOSTED"
msgid "Moisture is the enemy!"
msgstr "潮氣才是最大敵人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIRTPILE"
msgid "Who just leaves dirt lying around in the forest?"
msgstr "是誰走的時候在森林裡留下了這一堆泥土？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.COLD"
msgid "It's making some kind of noise."
msgstr "它在發出某種雜訊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.GENERIC"
msgid "It's full of electrical junk."
msgstr "它全身上下都是電子垃圾。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.HOT"
msgid "Gah! Enough with the beeping!"
msgstr "討厭！別再嗶嗶嗶地叫了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARM"
msgid "This thing is getting noisier."
msgstr "這東西越來越吵了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGROD.WARMER"
msgid "Must be close!"
msgstr "一定很近了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.GENERIC"
msgid "Not sure what this does. Doesn't seem like it's fiery things."
msgstr "不知道這是用來幹嘛的。看起來不像是能夠燃燒的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.READY"
msgid "Just needs to be unlocked with a key. Not fire, unfortunately."
msgstr "只需要用鑰匙解鎖就可以了。很遺憾，不是用火來解鎖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODBASE.UNLOCKED"
msgid "It's whirring now!"
msgstr "它在發出呼呼的聲音！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DIVININGRODSTART"
msgid "I'll make something out of it."
msgstr "我要用它搞點名堂出來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOCK_KIT"
msgid "It'll be nice to cover up the water with some nice, flammable wood."
msgstr "用一些漂亮的、易燃的木頭來遮住水面是極好的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOCK_WOODPOSTS_ITEM"
msgid "More fuel for the fi- I mean decoration for the dock!"
msgstr "更多的燃料拿來放——我是說建碼頭！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DOLL_BLUEPRINT"
msgid "Awww, my beefalo's gonna be so hideous and adorable!"
msgstr "啊，我皮弗婁牛會變得又醜又萌!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_KIT"
msgid "Who wants to build this thing? Anyone?"
msgstr "誰想造這個啊？有人嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBOAT_PACK"
msgid "All the boat junk you could ever need in one package."
msgstr "你能用的上的那些船垃圾都在這一個包裡了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONBODYHAT"
msgid "Aww, I always get caught in the middle!"
msgstr "噢，我總是卡在中間！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONCHILISALAD"
msgid "I can't wait to eat it."
msgstr "我等不及要吃了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLY"
msgid "It's filled with fire!"
msgstr "它肚子裡面都是火！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.GENERIC"
msgid "I'm not sure why you'd want something that DOESN'T burn..."
msgstr "我搞不懂，你為什麼想要不能燃燒的東西..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.DRAGONFLYCHEST.UPGRADED_STACKSIZE"
msgid "Why hide away so much potential kindling?"
