#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING"
