msgstr "走開，討厭的雨！晾乾！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYINGINRAIN_NOTMEAT"
msgid "Forget the rain! Dry!"
msgstr "走開，討厭的雨！晾乾！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.DRYING_NOTMEAT"
msgid "How long does it take this stuff to dry?!"
msgstr "這東西要多久才能乾？！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATRACK_HERMIT_MULTI.GENERIC"
msgid "Nice, but burning still beats drying."
msgstr "不錯，但燒掉比曬乾更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MEATYSALAD"
