msgstr "看起來跟老房子一樣容易著火。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "Are you supposed to be important or something?"
msgstr "所以你比較重要麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Did I do that? It's hard to keep track."
msgstr "是我幹的嗎？燒的多了容易混了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "I shouldn't burn it... but I want to..."
msgstr "我不應該燒它……但我想……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "Hahaha-! Uh, I mean, oh no..."
msgstr "哈哈哈！額，我的意思是，哦，不……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "What's all this stuff for?"
msgstr "這些東西是做什麼用的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "I bet that would catch fire reeeal easy."
msgstr "我打賭那東西一點就著。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "Ugh, the SMELL coming from that thing!"
msgstr "啊，那東西臭不可聞啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "I can't look inside? But that just makes me want to even more!"
msgstr "我不能朝裡面看嗎？但這只會讓我更想去看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "I can't look inside? But that just makes me want to even more!"
msgstr "我不能朝裡面看嗎？但這只會讓我更想去看！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "I feel like it's staring straight through me."
msgstr "我感覺它直勾勾地盯著我，像是要把我看穿一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
