msgstr "嚇人……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "It'd be handy if it wasn't so badly made."
msgstr "做工太粗糙了，不然得話還是有點用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "What a nice, flammable-looking tool shed!"
msgstr "既漂亮又易燃的工具棚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "What a nice, flammable-looking tool shed!"
msgstr "既漂亮又易燃的工具棚！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "It'd be handy if it wasn't so badly made."
msgstr "做工太粗糙了，不然得話還是有點用的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
