msgid "I've got to figure out what I'm gonna do with all this onion..."
msgstr "我得想想怎麼處置這些洋蔥……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ONION_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "這只是一把種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALPRECIOUSGEM"
msgid "It's glittery and mesmerizing, like a fire!"
msgstr "它像火焰一樣閃爍著，令人著迷！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OPALSTAFF"
msgid "Gotta hold it with my sleeve so my hands don't get cold."
msgstr "必須用袖子兜住它，這樣我的雙手就不會變涼了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEAMULET"
msgid "It picks up burning materials!"
msgstr "它在撿燃料！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEGEM"
msgid "It'll make your fingers tingle."
msgstr "這會刺痛你的手指。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGEMOONEYE"
msgid "It's a rock. Ugh!"
msgstr "是塊岩石。啊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.ORANGESTAFF"
msgid "It gives me a headache."
msgstr "它讓我頭疼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTER"
msgid "You rotten little bandit!"
msgstr "你這小破強盜！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks empty. Might as well torch it."
msgstr "上面是空的。一把火解決的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN.HAS_LOOT"
msgid "I should take whatever's in there. Then torch it."
msgstr "我應該把裡面的東西都拿走。然後燒了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.OTTERDEN_DEAD"
msgid "I think we're going down."
msgstr "我們要沉底了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONETREE"
msgid "Ooooh, another tree to burn!"
msgstr "哦，又有一棵樹可以燒了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SAPLING"
msgid "One day you'll grow big enough to be worth cutting down for firewood."
msgstr "等你有天長大了，就可以被砍掉當柴燒了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SCALE"
msgid "Ewww, trees have scales?!"
msgstr "呃，樹上還有鱗片？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PALMCONE_SEED"
msgid "Not quite a tree yet."
msgstr "還沒有完全成為一棵樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANDORASCHEST"
msgid "Kind of tacky."
msgstr "有點俗氣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANETTONE"
msgid "Am I just hungry, or does everything look extra tasty?"
msgstr "是我餓了還是每道菜看起來都美味可口？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PANFLUTE"
msgid "Music is boring."
msgstr "音樂很無聊。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAPYRUS"
msgid "I bet it'd burn!"
msgstr "我肯定它能夠燃燒！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PAVLOVA"
msgid "It's so delicate looking, I just want to smush it."
msgstr "看起來極脆弱，我想一把打碎。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEGHOOK"
msgid "It's got a weaponized butt!"
msgstr "它的屁股也是武器！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUIN"
msgid "Run away, tiny dancers."
msgstr "快跑，小小舞蹈家。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.BURNING"
msgid "Burn, pengie, burn."
msgstr "燒吧，小企鵝，燒吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.GENERIC"
msgid "Shall I do the honors?"
msgstr "要不我來處理一下？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PENGUINCORPSE.REVIVING"
msgid "Do I even have to say it?"
msgstr "還用我多說？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER"
msgid "Good. These are the hot ones."
msgstr "好。辣的在這裡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPERPOPPER"
msgid "My mouth is on fire!"
msgstr "我的嘴巴著火了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_COOKED"
msgid "First rule of vegetables: fire makes it better."
msgstr "蔬菜的第一條規則：火讓它變得更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_OVERSIZED"
msgid "That's a lot of hot stuff!"
msgstr "這麼多火辣辣的東西！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEPPER_SEEDS"
msgid "It's just a bunch of seeds."
msgstr "這只是一把種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERD"
msgid "Evil bird! Get away from those yummy berries!"
msgstr "臭鳥！別靠近那些美味的漿果！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDFAN"
msgid "It's a big ol' fan."
msgstr "是個超級老粉絲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Well, that's burned now."
msgstr "好吧，現在被燒掉了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "What do we have to do now?"
msgstr "我們現在必須做什麼？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PERDSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "I don't even like gobblers!"
msgstr "我甚至都不喜歡火雞！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PEROGIES"
msgid "Tasty things, sealed with fire."
msgstr "用火來封口的美味餃子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS"
msgid "Stupid flowers. They're almost useless."
msgstr "愚蠢的花。幾乎是毫無用處。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm... So dry. So flammable."
msgstr "嗯……真乾……真易燃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL"
msgid "Ew, they're sticky."
msgstr "好噁心，太黏了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETALS_EVIL_DRIED"
msgid "Mmm... So dry. So flammable."
msgstr "嗯……真乾……真易燃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PETRIFIED_TREE"
msgid "How am I supposed to burn it now?"
msgstr "我現在該如何燒掉它？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHLEGM"
msgid "Gross! Let's burn it."
msgstr "噁心！讓我們燒了它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PHONOGRAPH"
msgid "Oh, Maxwell will love this."
msgstr "噢，這是麥斯威爾的菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE"
msgid "It's very pointy."
msgstr "它很尖銳。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKAXE_LUNARPLANT"
msgid "The dumb plant still gets to hit stuff. It's what it would've wanted."
msgstr "愚蠢的植物仍然可以打東西。跟它活著的時候一個德性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PICKLEDHERRING"
msgid "How does it smell so good?"
msgstr "怎麼這麼好聞？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "水沖來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "你，我喜歡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE3"
msgid "Eat dirt!"
msgstr "吃土！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITE4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "很喜歡使用這些符號。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER1"
msgid "All washed up."
msgstr "水沖來的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER2"
msgid "You, I like."
msgstr "你，我喜歡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER3"
msgid "Eat dirt!"
msgstr "吃土！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGELITEFIGHTER4"
msgid "Sure does like using those signs."
msgstr "很喜歡使用這些符號。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGUARD"
msgid "I like his attitude!"
msgstr "我喜歡他的態度！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGGYBACK"
msgid "It's a backpack made out of butts!"
msgstr "用豬屁股做的背包！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "It can always get worse, I guess."
msgstr "人生不如意，十有八九。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I guess I have it alright."
msgstr "比起那傢伙，我的處境還不算太糟。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "Nice redecorating job!"
msgstr "裝修工作做得不錯！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.FULL"
msgid "He's doing pig things in there."
msgstr "他在裡面幹一些豬的事情。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "These pigs have questionable taste in architecture."
msgstr "這些豬在建築方面的品味真的很有問題。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGHOUSE.LIGHTSOUT"
msgid "You jerk! Let me in!"
msgstr "你個蠢貨！讓我進去！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGKING"
msgid "Blech. What a slob."
msgstr "呸，懶漢一個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.DEAD"
msgid "I wonder how they taste."
msgstr "真想嘗嘗它們的味道如何。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.FOLLOWER"
msgid "Ick. It's following me."
msgstr "討厭。它在跟著我。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GENERIC"
msgid "Ugh. They're fragrant."
msgstr "呃，真是臭死了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.GUARD"
msgid "He's not the boss of me!"
msgstr "他可不是我的Boss！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGMAN.WEREPIG"
msgid "Bring it on, piggie!"
msgstr "出招吧，小豬！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.BURNT"
msgid "Burnt. I like it."
msgstr "燒焦了。我喜歡。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.EMPTY"
msgid "Needs meat."
msgstr "需要肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSHRINE.GENERIC"
msgid "Where's the shrine to me?"
msgstr "怎麼就沒人給我修個廟供起來？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGSKIN"
msgid "Ha ha. A pig's butt."
msgstr "哈哈。豬屁股。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTENT"
msgid "It smells terrible!"
msgstr "太難聞了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIGTORCH"
msgid "These pigs sure know how to have a good time."
msgstr "這些豬可真知道享受。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_COIN"
msgid "Finally, someone to do my dirty work."
msgstr "終於啊，有人能替我幹活了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_TOKEN"
msgid "I'd burn it, but it might be worth something."
msgstr "我要燒了它，但它可能有價值。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE"
msgid "Hey there, tree seed."
msgstr "嘿，你好啊，大樹種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE_SAPLING"
msgid "You'll be a real tree soon."
msgstr "你很快就會長成一棵真正的樹的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_FLAG_POLE"
msgid "It would look a lot cooler with flames around it."
msgstr "如果周圍有火焰，它看起來會更酷。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIRATE_STASH"
msgid "Treasure! Heh, I'm pretty good at this."
msgstr "寶藏！呵，我對這個很在行。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PITCHFORK"
msgid "Three times the pointiness."
msgstr "三倍那麼尖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT"
msgid "Eww, it's all slimy."
msgstr "真噁心，又黏又滑。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTMEAT_COOKED"
msgid "Fire makes everything better."
msgstr "火可以讓一切東西變得更好。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANTREGISTRYHAT"
msgid "Nooo I don't want my head full of plant nerd facts!"
msgstr "我可不想滿腦子都是植物書呆子的知識!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd eat it if I had to."
msgstr "我不得已才吃它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.GROWING"
msgid "Hurry up, you stupid plant!"
msgstr "快點長，你個愚蠢的植物！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.READY"
msgid "Oh boy. Vegetables."
msgstr "我的乖乖。新鮮的蔬菜。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLANT_NORMAL.WITHERED"
msgid "It's crackly and dry. Good kindling!"
msgstr "它已經乾枯而且裂開了。真是不錯的引火柴！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_DOLL"
msgid "What a weird story."
msgstr "多麼奇怪的故事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_PRINCESS_YOTH"
msgid "For some reason, I can relate to the main character."
msgstr "不知道為什麼，我還挺能共情主角的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VAULT"
msgid "I liked the ending."
msgstr "我喜歡這個結局。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYBILL_THE_VEIL"
msgid "There's so much talking in this one."
msgstr "這戲對話多了一點。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PLAYER.ATTACKER"
msgid "Why, %s... that fire in your eyes!"
