msgstr "%s，冷靜。想要借伯尼嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WOODIE.BEAVERGHOST"
