msgstr "它們很可愛。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_FRUITDRAGON.RIPE"
