msgstr "晚安，小傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.WORMWOOD_MUTANTPROXY_LIGHTFLIER"
