#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD"
msgid "Just doin' their job."
msgstr "他們在堅守崗位。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_LUNAR"
msgid "I'm sure he's got a sparkling personality."
msgstr "我相信他一定有閃光的個性。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMGUARD_SHADOW"
msgid "Whoa, I'll just stay outta your way."
msgstr "哇，我就不妨礙你了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHAT"
msgid "Do I look a little green around the gills? Ha!"
msgstr "魚鰓是不是讓我的臉顯得有點綠？哈！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.BURNT"
msgid "Hooboy, that's a powerful stench."
msgstr "我的天，味道可真刺鼻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHEAD.GENERIC"
msgid "I'd better hammer down that eyesore."
msgstr "我最好要去掉那個醜瞎了的東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.BURNT"
msgid "A waste of building materials."
msgstr "浪費建築材料。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE.GENERIC"
msgid "I could disassemble that."
msgstr "我可以拆掉它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.BURNT"
msgid "All that work, up in smoke..."
msgstr "多少辛勤苦幹都燒成了一柱煙……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMHOUSE_CRAFTED.GENERIC"
msgid "Hm, I should teach that kid how to use a level."
msgstr "嗯，我要教那孩子用水平儀。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMKING"
msgid "Are you the boss around here?"
msgstr "你是這裡的老闆嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.BURNT"
msgid "Yeesh, what a mess."
msgstr "咦，一團亂麻。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE.GENERIC"
msgid "Not bad handiwork."
msgstr "這手藝不錯。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.BURNT"
msgid "Guess it's back to the drawing board."
msgstr "看來又得從圖紙開始了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMTHRONE_CONSTRUCTION.GENERIC"
msgid "Whatcha makin' there, kid?"
msgstr "在建什麼呢，小朋友？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_NOKING"
msgid "It looks kinda gloomy."
msgstr "看著挺鬱悶的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERMWATCHTOWER_REGULAR"
msgid "Now that's a proper tree fort!"
msgstr "這才是像樣的樹堡！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY"
msgid "Get your merm hats here!"
msgstr "來這取你們的魚人帽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_ARMORY_UPGRADED"
msgid "Get your merm hats here!"
msgstr "來這取你們的魚人帽！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_LUNAR"
msgid "You're a rather prickly one, ain't ya?"
msgstr "知道你不好惹，沒說錯吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_PRINCE"
msgid "Looks like someone got a promotion!"
msgstr "看起來有人升職了！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_SHADOW"
msgid "Can't seem to catch a break, can ya?"
msgstr "都不帶休息的啊？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL"
msgid "Should get the job done... I hope."
msgstr "應該能完成任務……希望吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED"
msgid "I know a toolshed when I see one."
msgstr "我一看就知道這是工具棚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOLSHED_UPGRADED"
msgid "I know a toolshed when I see one."
msgstr "我一看就知道這是工具棚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MERM_TOOL_UPGRADED"
msgid "It's an improvement."
msgstr "總算比原來好點了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLE"
msgid "Wonder where this came from?"
msgstr "這東西是從哪來的？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MESSAGEBOTTLEEMPTY"
msgid "Might as well reuse this."
msgstr "可以重複利用一下。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.BURNT"
msgid "Aw shoot, I hope the big guy isn't too upset."
msgstr "噢糟糕，我希望那個大塊頭別太難過。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MIGHTY_GYM.GENERIC"
msgid "I might've helped him a little bit on the mechanical side of things."
msgstr "我可能在機械的部分出過一點力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MILKYWHITES"
msgid "That's not appetizing.."
msgstr "毫無食欲……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINERHAT"
msgid "I put that behind me."
msgstr "那已經是歷史了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIBOATLANTERN"
msgid "Nice to have some more light out here on the water."
msgstr "水面泛著光就放心多了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFAN"
msgid "Swirly."
msgstr "轉呀轉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINIFLARE"
msgid "Safety in numbers, hey?"
msgstr "人越多越安全，對不？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.GENERIC"
msgid "Cutesy little drawing."
msgstr "可愛的小圖。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.MINISIGN.UNDRAWN"
