#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUMPKIN_SEEDS"
msgid "A handful of seeds."
msgstr "一把種子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUNCHINGBAG"
msgid "Whatcha say? Wanna go a few rounds?"
msgstr "你怎麼說？想打幾個回合嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PUREBRILLIANCE"
msgid "I ain't dazzled by much, but that'll do it."
msgstr "沒多少東西能迷住我，但那個就可以。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.PURPLEAMULET"
