msgstr "它對建築具有破壞力。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WINONA.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_ALTAR_QUEEN"
