msgstr "咦！不是怪獸，是沃爾夫岡的小船罷了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOLFGANG.DESCRIBE.BOAT_BUMPER_YOTD_KIT"
