msgid "It's like wearin' a cozy pair of long johns while I work."
msgstr "就像幹活時穿了條暖乎乎的秋褲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.FUMAROLE_FARM_HOE.GENERIC"
msgid "Looks like it's aboot to break apart."
msgstr "看起來快要裂開了。"

