msgstr "你要是穿上這個，就沒人能把你怎麼樣了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORHEAVY"
msgid "Looks pretty safe, eh?"
msgstr "看起來很安全，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHT"
msgid "Won't do anyone much good."
msgstr "對誰都沒有多大用處。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORLIGHTSPEED"
msgid "Does nothing fast."
msgstr "對速度沒多大説明。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUM"
msgid "Better wood armor than nothin'."
msgstr "木盔甲總比啥也沒有的強。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMDAMAGER"
msgid "Looks sharp, eh?"
msgstr "看起來很鋒利，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMORMEDIUMRECHARGER"
msgid "Good for a little recharge."
msgstr "有一點充能作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ARMOR_HP"
msgid "Better armor up."
msgstr "最好穿上盔甲。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BATTLESTANDARD"
msgid "Let's chop that Battle Standard!"
msgstr "讓我們切碎那面戰鬥旗幟！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BERNIE"
msgid "Hey there little fella."
msgstr "嘿，你好呀小傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_BOARLORD"
msgid "He seems confused, eh?"
msgstr "他看起來很懵，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_CROWNDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "Get a loada that hat!"
msgstr "瞧那頂帽子！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_ELEMENTAL"
msgid "What an odd little fellow."
msgstr "古怪的小傢伙。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_EYECIRCLETHAT"
msgid "I don't see much use for that."
msgstr "我覺得那個對我沒什麼用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FEATHERCROWNHAT"
msgid "I don't think agility is my thing, eh?"
msgstr "我覺得敏捷不是我的風格，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_FIREBOMB"
msgid "I'll leave that for someone else."
msgstr "我把這個留給別人吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGFLOWERHAT"
msgid "That flower'd look nice with my beard."
msgstr "那朵花跟我的鬍子很配。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEALINGGARLANDHAT"
msgid "That'll make ya quick on yer feet."
msgstr "那個能讓你的腳步變得輕快。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_HEAVYBLADE"
msgid "I could use that."
msgstr "我能用得上那個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE"
msgid "Needs another piece."
msgstr "它需要另一件東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_KEYHOLE_FULL"
msgid "Looks good."
msgstr "看上去一切就緒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LIGHTDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I'd swing an axe a little harder with that."
msgstr "有了那個，我揮斧頭都能更有勁。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_LUCY"
msgid "Something's different aboot you, Lucy."
msgstr "你有些不一樣了，露西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.GENERIC"
msgid "Don't trust that as far as I can throw it."
msgstr "只要我能扔，就別相信那個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_PORTAL.ON"
msgid "Let's head back to camp, Lucy."
msgstr "我們回營地吧，露西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_RECHARGERHAT"
msgid "They're reinvigorating rocks."
msgstr "這些寶石有恢復活力的作用。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_SPAWNER"
msgid "Better keep an eye on that."
msgstr "最好小心那個東西。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_STRONGDAMAGERHAT"
msgid "I could do some real damage with that."
msgstr "有了那個東西，我可以大肆破壞了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAARENA_TIARAFLOWERPETALSHAT"
msgid "I oughta leave that for someone else."
msgstr "我應該把這個留給別人。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE"
msgid "Death by axe!"
msgstr "一斧劈死！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_COCOON"
msgid "Lil buddy cooled right off."
msgstr "小夥伴馬上冷靜下來。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG.GENERIC"
msgid "There's a fire burning in there."
msgstr "它裡面在燃燒。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COLD"
msgid "She could use a parka."
msgstr "她需要一件派克大衣。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_EGG_CRACKED.COMFY"
msgid "Cozier than a moose wrapped in duct tape!"
msgstr "比用管道膠帶裹起來的駝鹿還舒服！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.CONTENT"
msgid "Look how happy she is!"
msgstr "看她多高興！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.GENERIC"
msgid "That's my lil critter."
msgstr "這是我的小蟲子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.HUNGRY"
msgid "Poor gal's getting hungry."
msgstr "可憐的姑娘餓了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_PET.STARVING"
msgid "Skinnier than a blue heron's legs."
msgstr "比青鷺的腿還瘦。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVAE_TOOTH"
msgid "Not as sharp as Lucy!"
msgstr "不像露西那麼鋒利！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.COOL"
msgid "My trees are safe now."
msgstr "現在我的樹安全了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVASPIT.HOT"
msgid "Aaaah! Tree killer!"
msgstr "啊啊啊啊！樹木殺手！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND"
msgid "I wouldn't get too close to that, eh?"
msgstr "我不會靠那個太近的，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LAVA_POND_ROCK"
msgid "Boulder-dash."
msgstr "推石小子。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFLOAF"
msgid "Not my cup of tea."
msgstr "非我杯茶。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATBURGER"
msgid "It never tastes the same as actual meat..."
msgstr "味道和真正的肉是不一樣的……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEAFYMEATSOUFFLE"
msgid "I wouldn't touch that with a ten foot pike pole."
msgstr "就算給我跟三米長的杆子，我都不要碰它。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF"
msgid "I'm sorry aboot all of those trees!"
msgstr "我很抱歉我對那些樹做的事！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_IDOL"
msgid "To fight a tree, you gotta think like a tree..."
msgstr "要想與一棵樹戰鬥，你必須像一棵樹一樣思考……"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LEIF_SPARSE"
msgid "I'm sorry aboot all of those trees!"
msgstr "我很抱歉我對那些樹做的事！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LICHEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LICHEN"
msgid "Looks barely edible."
msgstr "看起來幾乎不能吃。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIFEINJECTOR"
msgid "This should cure those sniffles."
msgstr "這應該能治癒鼻塞。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTBULB"
msgid "It looks chewy."
msgstr "它看起來很耐嚼。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTCRAB"
msgid "The little fella's just minding its own business."
msgstr "這小傢伙在忙自己的事。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTER"
msgid "Keep it away from the trees!"
msgstr "不要讓它靠近樹！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTFLIER"
msgid "Keep lighting my way and we'll get along just fine, bud!"
msgstr "繼續照亮我的路，我們會相處得很好，夥計！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.CHARGED"
msgid "Nice goat, nice goat!"
msgstr "好山羊，好山羊！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOAT.GENERIC"
msgid "That's a nice pair of horns you've got there."
msgstr "你的羊角挺不錯的。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNINGGOATHORN"
msgid "I'm sure the goat didn't need it."
msgstr "我相信山羊不需要這個。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.CHARGED"
msgid "It's pretty as the Northern lights."
msgstr "像北極光一樣漂亮。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIGHTNING_ROD.GENERIC"
msgid "Weather's not going to get the drop on me now."
msgstr "現在我不會被閃電劈了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LITTLE_WALRUS"
msgid "Why are they so far south?"
msgstr "它們為什麼要住在這麼偏南的地方？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGLOG"
msgid "I want to keep you, and call you \"Frank\"."
msgstr "我要留著你，以後你就叫“弗蘭克”吧。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE"
msgid "I feel conflicted, eh?"
msgstr "我覺得很矛盾，不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_ROOT"
msgid "Hey there's a piece of wood in there."
msgstr "嘿，裡面有木頭。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LIVINGTREE_SAPLING"
msgid "Yep. That'll be a fine tree one day."
msgstr "對。有一天它會長成漂亮的大樹。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERBISQUE"
msgid "Looks so smooth and creamy, but I'd still prefer salmon."
msgstr "雖然看起來肉質嫩滑，但我還是更喜歡三文魚。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOBSTERDINNER"
msgid "I'd prefer salmon."
msgstr "我更喜歡鮭魚肉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOG.BURNING"
msgid "Oh no! Don't put another log on the fire!"
msgstr "噢，不要！別把另一根木頭放在火上！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOG.GENERIC"
msgid "It makes it all worthwhile."
msgstr "一切都值得了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LORDFRUITFLY"
msgid "You came to the wrong garden, bud."
msgstr "你來錯花園了，夥計。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.LOST_TOY_1"
msgid "There's something unnatural aboot that thing... wouldn't ya say, Luce?"
msgstr "那東西有點不自然……對不，露西？"

