msgstr "我為此感到抱歉。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MAPSCROLL"
