msgstr "好吧，它現在毀了。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.MARSH_BUSH.GENERIC"
