msgstr "慢慢裝著，像糖蜜那麼慢。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.QUAGMIRE_SUGARWOODTREE.TAPPED_READY"
