msgstr "雖然我說話偶爾吐舌頭，但那種語言我真不會。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.ACTIONFAIL.GIVE.NOTDISH"
