#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.BURNT"
