msgstr "好吧，該熄的總是會熄。"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRATSHRINE.EMPTY"
