msgstr "哼，我一眼就看出你也是惡作劇的同道中人！"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WORTOX.DESCRIBE.YOTC_CARRAT_GYM_DIRECTION.BURNT"
