msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WILLOW.WILLOW_BERNIEAI_DESC"
msgid "Bernie will activate to fight hostile lunar and shadow aligned creatures regardless of Willow's sanity."
msgstr "無論薇洛的理智高低，伯尼都會啟動並攻擊敵對的月亮和暗影陣營的生物。"

