msgstr "荊棘外殼專家"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BERRYBUSHCRAFTING_DESC"
