msgstr "開花時獲得更好的過熱保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_OVERHEATPROTECTION_TITLE"
