msgstr "完全盛開時在日光下，生命值會慢慢恢復。"

#. STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKILLTREE.WORMWOOD.BLOOMING_PHOTOSYNTHESIS_TITLE"
