msgid "An 'unsuitably blue' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "‘不搭配藍色’馬甲由上等皮弗婁牛毛製成。但不幸的是，馬甲並不保暖。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_red_firehound
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_sweatervest_red_firehound"
msgid "A 'firehound red' colored vest made of the finest beefalo wool. Unfortunately, it's not actually warm."
msgstr "‘火獵犬紅色’馬甲由上等皮弗婁牛毛製成。但不幸的是，馬甲並不保暖。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_swimsuit2_blue_lightning
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_swimsuit2_blue_lightning"
msgid "A 'lightning goat blue' colored suit for swimming in, if you could swim. Which you can't."
msgstr "‘閃電山羊藍色’泳衣，適合游泳，可惜你不會遊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_swimsuit_red_ruby
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_swimsuit_red_ruby"
msgid "A daring 'red gem red' colored outfit for swimming."
msgstr "大膽的‘紅寶石紅’泳衣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tanktop_tiecollar_yellow_goldenrod
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_tanktop_tiecollar_yellow_goldenrod"
msgid "This 'downright neighborly yellow' top just screams \"springtime\"! Seriously. Please make it stop screaming."
msgstr "這件\"十足鄰居黃色\"的頂部僅僅尖叫道\"春天來了\"！認真地說，請讓它停止尖叫吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_toga_white_pure
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_toga_white_pure"
msgid "As they say, \"when in Rome\"!"
msgstr "就像他們說的，\"入鄉隨俗\"！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_brown_fawn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_brown_fawn"
msgid "A fashionable but unprotective trench coat in a 'werebeaver brown' color."
msgstr "外觀時尚但不具備防護功能的‘海狸褐色’風衣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_grey_dark
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.body_trenchcoat_grey_dark"
