#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pottedferncotl
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pottedferncotl"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nMay the blood-red Camellia flower awaken your deepest desires."
msgstr "裝備此物品以更改你的角色背景畫像。\n\n願血紅的山茶花喚醒你最深的渴望。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pottedfernrose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pottedfernrose"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nRoses are red. Violets are blue. These won't stop her from killing you."
msgstr "裝備此物品以更改你的角色背景畫像。\n\n玫瑰是紅色的。紫羅蘭是藍色的。這些並不能阻止她殺掉你。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pumpkinlantern
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.playerportrait_bg_pumpkinlantern"
msgid "Equip this item to change your character's background portrait.\n\nIf you stare long into the abyss of a Jack O' Lantern mouth, it will also stare into you."
msgstr "裝備此物品以更改你的角色背景畫像。\n\n當你凝視著南瓜燈的大嘴時，南瓜燈也在凝視著你。"

