#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_formal"
msgid "Walter wears his badges proudly. A filled sash is no small feat."
msgstr "沃爾特驕傲地戴著他的獎章。一條掛滿獎章的緞帶可不是誰都有的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_ice"
msgid "Walter is always sure to put on the proper winter wear before venturing out into the snow."
msgstr "沃爾特在冒險進入雪地之前，一定會穿上合適的冬裝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_lunar"
msgid "Walter was thrilled to discover that the moon has its own Scouts program."
msgstr "沃爾特興奮地發現還有月亮童子軍計畫。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_nature"
msgid "The natural world is full of dangers, and this stout-hearted adventurer is ready to face them all!"
msgstr "自然界充滿了危險，而這位堅毅的冒險家已經準備好面對所有的危險了!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_none"
msgid "Walter's standard-issue Pinetree Pioneer uniform."
msgstr "沃爾特的制式松樹先鋒隊隊服。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_rose"
msgid "Has Walter started a new troop, the Rosy Rangers?"
msgstr "沃爾特是否組建了一支新部隊——玫瑰遊騎兵隊？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_shadow"
msgid "Walter has gone from a pure-hearted Pioneer to a mischievous menace!"
msgstr "沃爾特已經從內心純潔的先鋒隊員墮落成了一名愛惡作劇的危險分子！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_survivor"
msgid "Walter's time in the Pinetree Pioneers prepared him for the Constant better than most."
msgstr "沃爾特在松樹先鋒隊得到的訓練，讓他比大多數人更能適應永恆領域。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_ventriloquist
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_ventriloquist"
msgid "He may love to talk, but Walter's no dummy."
msgstr "他也許喜歡說話，但沃爾特絕非笨蛋。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_victorian"
msgid "Walter is often so eager to talk about the news that people don't need to buy the papers."
msgstr "沃爾特太熱衷聊新聞，他的顧客其實都不用買報紙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walter_yule"
msgid "Walter considers himself a bit of an expert on picking the perfect pine tree."
msgstr "沃爾特自認為是挑選完美松樹的專家。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_20s
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_20s"
msgid "Walter looks every bit the ace in this cap."
msgstr "沃爾特戴上這頂帽子，怎麼看怎麼像王牌飛行員。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ancient"
msgid "This hat will keep a Pinetree Pioneer's ears warm."
msgstr "這頂帽子能為松樹先鋒的耳朵保暖。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_bee
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_bee"
msgid "This hat will really help you get into a bee's head."
msgstr "這頂帽子能真正幫助你想蜜蜂之所想。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_beep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_beep"
msgid "This hat will really help you get into a bee's head."
msgstr "這頂帽子能真正幫助你想蜜蜂之所想。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_detective
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_detective"
msgid "The most effective headwear for hunting down clues... or deer."
msgstr "這個頭飾有助於尋找線索……或是鹿。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_formal"
msgid "The one in charge is usually the one wearing the biggest hat."
msgstr "想看誰是一把手，就看誰戴的帽子最大。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ice"
msgid "The pom-pom is actually very practical and necessary."
msgstr "那個絨球其實是非常實用和必要的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_lunar"
msgid "The perfect hat for sailing through the stars."
msgstr "在星空中航行的完美帽子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_nature"
msgid "It's like a cape for your head!"
msgstr "像是頭上披的斗篷一樣！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_rose"
msgid "The only thing that can top a ramble among the roses."
msgstr "唯一能勝過在玫瑰叢中漫步的東西。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_shadow"
msgid "Nothing says \"I break all the rules\" like turning your baseball cap to the side."
msgstr "沒有什麼比把棒球帽轉到一邊更能說明“我要打破所有規則”了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_survivor"
msgid "One of the first rules of survival is knowing when to stay out of sight."
msgstr "野外求生的第一條準則就是學會什麼時候從視線中消失。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ventriloquist
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_ventriloquist"
msgid "Hats off to another chilling tale well told!"
msgstr "向又一個驚心動魄的故事脫帽致敬，講得好！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_victorian"
msgid "Any other cap is simply old news."
msgstr "其他的帽子根本就是舊聞。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.walterhat_yule"
msgid "The finishing touch for the top of your head."
msgstr "拍腦袋的點睛之筆。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop"
msgid "Wandashop Costume"
msgstr "旺達主教服裝"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop_d"
msgid "Wanda is a fan of all clockwork, even if it's hostile."
msgstr "旺達熱愛所有形式的發條，包括有敵意的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_bishop_p"
msgid "Wanda is a fan of all clockwork, even if it's hostile."
msgstr "旺達熱愛所有形式的發條，包括有敵意的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_formal"
msgid "Wanda can always be counted on to arrive right on time."
msgstr "旺達總是會準時到場。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_ice"
msgid "Venturing into the unknown can be a very chilling experience if one's not prepared."
msgstr "沒準備好就冒然闖入未知領域可能會讓人心寒。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_lunar"
msgid "Wanda sees a bright future for herself under the watchful eye of the moon."
msgstr "旺達在月亮的注視下看到了自己的光明未來。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_masquerade"
msgid "This guest is here to have the time of her life."
msgstr "這位客人是來享受美好時光的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_nature"
msgid "Wanda can track the passage of time in the rings of fallen trees."
msgstr "旺達通過枯木上的年輪來追蹤時間的流逝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_none"
msgid "Wanda's most time-tested look."
msgstr "旺達最經得起時間考驗的造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_rose"
msgid "The life of a rose garden is cyclical - blossoms wither and fade, then bloom anew."
msgstr "玫瑰園的生命是週期性的——花朵枯萎、凋謝，然後重新綻放。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_shadow"
msgid "Why fight an inevitable future?"
msgstr "為什麼要對抗不可避免的未來？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_steampunk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_steampunk"
msgid "Surely a little fiddling with the timeline here and there won't do any harm."
msgstr "稍微擺弄一下時間線能出什麼岔子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_western"
msgid "Sheesh, Wanda! Hold yer horses!"
msgstr "哎呀，旺達！管好你的馬！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wanda_yule"
msgid "Wanda is working around the clock trying to build enough toys in time for the holidays!"
msgstr "旺達正夜以繼日地工作，為的是在假期前造出足夠的玩具！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_armoire
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_armoire"
msgid "Extra roomy, and indispensable in a game of hide and seek."
msgstr "空間格外大，捉迷藏遊戲裡必不可少。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_crystal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_crystal"
msgid "Give your clothes that extra sparkle."
msgstr "給你的衣服一份格外的閃耀。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_gothic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_gothic"
msgid "You could have sworn you heard a disapproving growl from deep within when you tried to hang up a Hawaiian shirt."
msgstr "當你試圖掛起一件夏威夷花襯衫時，你發誓你聽見了它發自內心深處的抗議嘶吼。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_heart
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_heart"
msgid "Love the new look."
msgstr "喜歡新的樣子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_vine
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_vine"
msgid "This thorny wardrobe will have you looking sharp."
msgstr "這個帶刺的衣櫃會讓你看起來十分犀利。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wardrobe_yule"
msgid "The perfect storage for sweater weather."
msgstr "毛衣天氣的完美收納。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_candyman
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_candyman"
msgid "The sweetest confectioner around!"
msgstr "最最甜美的甜點師！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat"
msgid "Warrat Costume"
msgstr "沃蘿蔔鼠服裝"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat_d"
msgid "This vegetable costume is a bold choice for a candy holiday."
msgstr "在糖果節穿蔬菜裝是一個大膽的選擇。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_carrat_p"
msgid "This vegetable costume is a bold choice for a candy holiday."
msgstr "在糖果節穿蔬菜裝是一個大膽的選擇。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_chef
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_chef"
msgid "Being trapped in the Constant has given Warly plenty of time to perfect his signature recipes."
msgstr "被困于永恆領域反而讓沃利有足夠的時間來完善他的招牌食譜。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_fisherman
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_fisherman"
msgid "Sometimes Warly wants to feel like the catch of the day."
msgstr "休閒帥氣的漁夫裝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_formal"
msgid "Feast your eyes on this fine diner."
msgstr "請盡情欣賞這位精緻的食客。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_ice"
msgid "Warly has put together his finest outfit to attend the Snow Ball."
msgstr "沃利為參加下雪舞會準備了最精緻的禮服。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_lunar"
msgid "Warly brings a golden touch to cuisine and couture."
msgstr "沃利對美食和華服都能點石成金。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_masquerade"
msgid "This mysterious gentleman has whipped up a cracking ensemble."
msgstr "這位神秘的紳士炮製了一套炸裂的套裝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_nature"
msgid "Warly has found a deep appreciation for the natural world and all it provides."
msgstr "沃利十分欣賞大自然所提供的一切。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_none"
msgid "Warly's most comfortable outfit."
msgstr "沃利最舒服的裝束。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_pirate"
msgid "Warly felt that his usual ship's steward duties were getting a little bland."
msgstr "沃利覺得船舶的日常管理工作平淡如水。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_rose"
msgid "A high court dinner demands guests look as rich as the meal in which they partake."
msgstr "高庭盛宴要求客人要像桌上的美食一樣外表精緻。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_shadow"
msgid "A shadow-corrupted chef is a recipe for disaster."
msgstr "被暗影腐化的廚師必將炮製出災難。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_survivor"
msgid "Warly is the master of castaway cuisine."
msgstr "沃利是荒野美食的大師。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_victorian"
msgid "Warly's developed a taste for adventure and is heading out to sea."
msgstr "沃利喜歡上了冒險，正向大海出發。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.warly_yule"
msgid "Warly's Winter Feast ensemble is never half-baked."
msgstr "沃利的冬季盛宴套裝從來都不會不溫不火。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waterballoon_insect
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waterballoon_insect"
msgid "Put out fires with a splashy splat."
msgstr "\"啪一聲就把火撲滅了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wateringcan_cactus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wateringcan_cactus"
msgid "A prickly pear with water to spare."
msgstr "能倒出水的刺梨。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wateringcan_rustic
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wateringcan_rustic"
msgid "With a little care and attention, it could be good as new."
msgstr "只要稍加保養，它就可以像新的一樣好。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_banana
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_banana"
msgid "Headwear so a-peeling, it's bananas."
msgstr "像香蕉一樣剝開的頭飾，真是瘋狂啊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_cantaloupe
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_cantaloupe"
msgid "A melon for your melon."
msgstr "腦袋瓜上的瓜。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_pumpkin
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.watermelonhat_pumpkin"
msgid "A fashionable accessory for those forced to wander this world on Halloween Night."
msgstr "被迫在萬聖夜漫遊世界者的時髦配飾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_ancient"
msgid "Wigfrid always did have a soft spot for historical fashion."
msgstr "薇格弗德一直對歷史潮流情有獨鍾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_combatant"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the arena."
msgstr "薇格弗德就是為競技場而生的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_cook"
msgid "Wigfrid has many pot roasts in her future."
msgstr "薇格弗德以後有很多鍋烤美食。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops"
msgid "Deerfrid Costume"
msgstr "獨眼巨鹿造型裝"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_d"
msgid "Wigfrid chose to be one of her favorite foes to battle for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "薇格弗德選擇成為她最喜歡為萬聖夜而戰的對手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_deerclops_p"
msgid "Wigfrid chose to be one of her favorite foes to battle for Hallowed Nights."
msgstr "薇格弗德選擇成為她最喜歡為萬聖夜而戰的對手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formal"
msgid "She resembles a Visigothic princess."
msgstr "她很像西哥特王國的公主。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_formalp"
msgid "She resembles a Visigothic princess."
msgstr "她很像西哥特王國的公主。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_gladiator"
msgid "The question was never IF Wigfrid would master the ring, but when."
msgstr "薇格弗德主宰決鬥圈只是一個時間上的問題。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_ice"
msgid "This warrior is prepared to battle even the most brutal winters."
msgstr "這位勇士隨時可以與最嚴酷的寒冬作戰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_flower
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_flower"
msgid "These beautiful blooms have had to fight for survival in the unforgiving wilderness."
msgstr "這些嬌豔的花朵曾在嚴酷的荒野中為生存而戰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_lunar"
msgid "An enlightened mind makes for an inspiring leader."
msgstr "受啟迪的大腦會讓領導者充滿靈感。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_valkyrie"
msgid "A commander should always keep their head held high."
msgstr "統帥應始終昂首挺胸。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_western"
msgid "The appropriate hat for leading a ragtag band of misfits."
msgstr "統領烏合之眾的完美帽子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_wrestle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_improvedhat_wrestle"
msgid "A touch of gold adds weight to its commanding appearance."
msgstr "黃金為其霸氣的外觀增添了幾分厚重感。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_lunar"
msgid "Wigfrid is accustomed to the limelight - moonlight was the logical next step."
msgstr "薇格弗德已經習慣了聚光燈——月光是合乎邏輯的下一步。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_magma"
msgid "Wigfrid is ready for Ragnarok."
msgstr "薇格弗德準備好迎接終極毀滅了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_masquerade"
msgid "This roisterer is ready to ring in Ragnarok."
msgstr "這位喧鬧者要呼喚諸神黃昏了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_nature"
msgid "Wigfrid would fight to her last breath to protect the spirit of the forest."
msgstr "薇格弗德會為了保護森林精靈而拼盡最後一口氣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_none"
msgid "Wigfrid's favorite costume."
msgstr "薇格弗德最愛的裝束。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_pirate"
msgid "Wigfrid can command a ship almost as well as she commands the stage."
msgstr "薇格弗德在船上駕輕就熟，就像在舞臺上一樣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rose"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the part of Red Queen."
msgstr "薇格弗德天生適合紅皇后這個角色。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_rosep"
msgid "Wigfrid was born for the part of Red Queen."
msgstr "薇格弗德天生適合紅皇后這個角色。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_scarecrow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_scarecrow"
msgid "Wigfrid fears nothing with a head full of stuffing."
msgstr "薇格弗德頭頂草包，從此無所畏懼。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadow"
msgid "Go to the dark side and be on top of the world."
msgstr "到陰暗面去，然後成為世界之巔。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_shadowp"
msgid "Go to the dark side and be on top of the world."
msgstr "到陰暗面去，然後成為世界之巔。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivor"
msgid "A warrior cannot eat until she defeats some meat."
msgstr "戰士擊退肉丸子後才可以吃飯。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_survivorp"
msgid "A warrior cannot eat until she defeats some meat."
msgstr "戰士擊退肉丸子後才可以吃飯。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_valkyrie"
msgid "Nothing will stop Wigfrid from rising all the way to the top."
msgstr "沒有什麼能夠阻擋薇格弗德飛升巔峰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_victorian"
msgid "It seems Ms. Wigfrid can connect to the poetry of any tragedy."
msgstr "似乎任何一首悲劇詩歌都能引起薇格弗德女士的共鳴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_western"
msgid "Wigfrid never met a wild beefalo she couldn't tame."
msgstr "薇格弗德從未遇到過馴服不了的皮弗婁牛。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_wrestler"
msgid "Wigfrid's mic skills can't be beat!"
msgstr "薇格弗德的麥克風技巧不是蓋的！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithr_yule"
msgid "A true warrior adapts to the elements."
msgstr "真正的勇士善於隨機應變。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_flower
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_flower"
msgid "These beautiful blooms have had to fight for survival in the unforgiving wilderness."
msgstr "這些嬌豔的花朵曾在嚴酷的荒野中為生存而戰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_lunar"
msgid "A gleaming headdress for an enlightened mind."
msgstr "屬於開明的頭腦的閃亮頭飾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_valkyrie
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_valkyrie"
msgid "A battle helm for a warrior whose head is comfortable in the clouds."
msgstr "專為勇士準備的戰鬥頭盔，在雲端也十分舒適。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_western"
msgid "Shield your eyes from the blazing sun as mind your beefalo herd."
msgstr "替你遮擋烈日，從此放牧無憂。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_wrestle
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wathgrithrhat_wrestle"
msgid "A golden helm fit for a golden warrior."
msgstr "金色頭盔，適合黃金戰士。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_combatant"
msgid "Maxwell believes this look to be quite intimidating."
msgstr "麥斯威爾相信這個樣子會很嚇人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_cook"
msgid "Maxwell is ready to roll up his sleeves and get cooking."
msgstr "麥斯威爾已經卷起袖子，準備做飯了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formal"
msgid "Against all possible odds Maxwell has become even more dapper."
msgstr "克服所有困難後，麥斯威爾變得更加犀利了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_formalp"
msgid "Against all possible odds Maxwell has become even more dapper."
msgstr "克服所有困難後，麥斯威爾變得更加犀利了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_gladiator"
msgid "Maxwell is both dark AND brooding."
msgstr "麥斯威爾既黑暗又陰森。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_ice"
msgid "This venture capitalist's assets are completely frozen."
msgstr "這位風險投資人的資產已經被完全凍結。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus"
msgid "Krampwell Costume"
msgstr "坎普威爾裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_d"
msgid "Wortox is less than impressed with Maxwell's choice of costume."
msgstr "沃拓克斯對麥斯威爾的裝束選擇無感。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_krampus_p"
msgid "Wortox is less than impressed with Maxwell's choice of costume."
msgstr "沃拓克斯對麥斯威爾的裝束選擇無感。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_lunar"
msgid "Power really changes some people."
msgstr "權力確實改變了一些人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_magma"
msgid "Maxwell's rage has split him in two."
msgstr "麥斯威爾的狂怒將他一分為二。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_masquerade"
msgid "This melancholic mystery man keeps slinking off to find dark corners to brood in."
msgstr "這個憂鬱而神秘男子一直在尋找陰暗的角落沉思。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_nature"
msgid "Maxwell is capable of tapping into many magical energies, including those of the natural world."
msgstr "麥斯威爾能夠利用許多魔法能量，包括自然界的魔法能量。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_none"
msgid "The standard look of a distinguished gentleman."
msgstr "尊貴紳士的標準造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_pirate"
msgid "This shady buccaneer has a heart blacker than his beard."
msgstr "這個陰暗的海盜的心比他的鬍子還黑。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rose"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen, a round of applause for our lovely assistant."
msgstr "女士們先生們，請為我們可愛的助手熱烈鼓掌。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_rosep"
msgid "Ladies and gentlemen, a round of applause for our lovely assistant."
msgstr "女士們先生們，請為我們可愛的助手熱烈鼓掌。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_spring"
msgid "Maxwell has sacrificed much at the altar of his own aspiration."
msgstr "麥斯威爾在自我野心的祭壇前已經犧牲了太多。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivor"
msgid "This is Maxwell, the intrepid explorer."
msgstr "這是麥斯威爾，他是勇敢的探險家。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_survivorp"
msgid "This is Maxwell, the intrepid explorer."
msgstr "這是麥斯威爾，他是勇敢的探險家。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadow"
msgid "Before it all went so wrong..."
msgstr "在一切走向錯誤之前..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_unshadowp"
msgid "Before it all went so wrong..."
msgstr "在一切走向錯誤之前..."

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_vampire
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_vampire"
msgid "The garb of a blood-sucking monster seems to suit him quite well."
msgstr "這套吸血惡魔的裝扮似乎很適合他。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_victorian"
msgid "Money and affluence have gone straight to this gentleman's head."
msgstr "金錢和財富都直接進入了這位紳士的頭中。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_western"
msgid "Maxwell makes his own rules."
msgstr "麥斯威爾有自己的規矩。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_wizard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_wizard"
msgid "Years spent steeped in dark magic have left Maxwell looking rather... wizened."
msgstr "沉浸黑暗魔法後，麥斯威爾看起來相當……狡猾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.waxwell_yule"
msgid "Some hearts never thaw."
msgstr "有些心中的寒冰永遠不會融化。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat"
msgid "Webilisk Costume"
msgstr "韋伯蝙蝠裝"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_d"
msgid "Gosh, those wings look very... real."
msgstr "天啊，這些翅膀看起來很……逼真。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_bat_p"
msgid "Gosh, those wings look very... real."
msgstr "天啊，這些翅膀看起來很……逼真。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_bat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_bat"
msgid "This webbed beard's just batty!"
msgstr "這網狀的鬍鬚真是太瘋狂了!"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_boy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_boy"
msgid "Webber always wanted a beard just like his father's."
msgstr "韋伯一直想長出像爸爸一樣的鬍鬚。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_formal"
msgid "It's quite difficult to keep webs nice and tidy, but Webber does his best."
msgstr "要保持網的美觀和整潔是相當困難的，但韋伯會盡力去做。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_gladiator"
msgid "Bright coloring is nature's way of saying \"stay away!\""
msgstr "鮮豔的顏色是自然界的表達“請遠離”的方法！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_ice"
msgid "This spider silk is as white and fluffy as new-fallen snow."
msgstr "這蜘蛛絲如新落的雪一樣潔白蓬鬆。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_lunar"
msgid "The moonglass threads are fine enough to be spun into a silky soft beard."
msgstr "月鏡玻璃的可以拆成足夠細的線，然後紡成絲般柔軟的鬍鬚。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_magma"
msgid "It's a good thing this webbing doesn't seem to be flammable."
msgstr "好在這網帶似乎不易燃。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_masquerade"
msgid "Get into any grown-up gathering."
msgstr "打入任何成年人的聚會。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_nature"
msgid "Webber's beard is naturally stylish."
msgstr "韋伯的鬍鬚自然就是那麼時髦。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_pirate"
msgid "Any stray strands have been lashed securely in place."
msgstr "任何散落的線都已牢牢地固定到位。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_punk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_punk"
msgid "A look for only the most webellious spiders."
msgstr "最有泛的蜘蛛造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_rose"
msgid "It's so much easier to stop and smell the roses when they're stuck to your face."
msgstr "當玫瑰花貼在臉上的時候，停下來聞一聞玫瑰花的味道就不難了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_shadow"
msgid "Every time Webber tries to devilishly twirl his moustache, the webs stick to his fingers."
msgstr "每次韋伯試圖魔鬼般地撚動他的鬍鬚時，網就會粘在他的手指上。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_spring"
msgid "The flowers in this troublemaker's beard aren't fooling anyone."
msgstr "這小搗蛋鬼鬍子上的花，可騙不了誰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_survivor"
msgid "These scraggly web strands have seen better days."
msgstr "這些亂七八糟的網線曾經也輝煌過。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_victorian"
msgid "It takes time to cultivate a respectable web beard."
msgstr "培養一個受人尊敬的網狀鬍鬚是需要時間的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_wrestler"
msgid "Where does the silky fur end and the silky beard begin?"
msgstr "絲質的毛髮和絲質的鬍鬚從哪裡開始呢？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_beard_yule"
msgid "This delicious beard has a heavy sprinkling of holiday cheer."
msgstr "這款美味的鬍鬚撒滿了濃濃的節日歡樂。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_boy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_boy"
msgid "Webber's memories of his old appearance have gotten a little fuzzy over time."
msgstr "隨著時間的推移，韋伯對以前外表的記憶已經變得有些模糊了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_combatant"
msgid "Webber's used to fending for himself."
msgstr "韋伯早就習慣為自己而戰了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_cook"
msgid "Webber loves helping out in the kitchen."
msgstr "韋伯很喜歡在廚房裡幫忙。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formal"
msgid "Webber takes parties seriously."
msgstr "韋伯對聚會相當重視。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_formalp"
msgid "Webber takes parties seriously."
msgstr "韋伯對聚會相當重視。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_gladiator"
msgid "It's not wise to corner venomous spiders."
msgstr "把毒蜘蛛逼到角落裡可不明智。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_ice"
msgid "Webber never needs to buy a winter coat. He makes his own."
msgstr "韋伯從不需要買冬裝。他自己就會做。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_lunar"
msgid "The moon is getting better at mutating spiders. Well, a bit better."
msgstr "月亮在使蜘蛛變異方面提升了一點。嗯，只有一點。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_magma"
msgid "Add some much needed fire to your fur."
msgstr "給你的絨毛多加一些你非常需要的火。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_masquerade"
msgid "Partying until dawn is easy for a nocturnal spider."
msgstr "對夜行的蜘蛛來說，通宵派對輕而易舉。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_nature"
msgid "Webber has learned to embrace the natural instincts of his spider side."
msgstr "韋伯已經學會了擁抱蜘蛛身上的自然本能。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_none"
msgid "The natural look of a monster and a friend."
msgstr "一個怪獸朋友的自然造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_pirate"
msgid "This little scalliwag feels right at home up in the ship's rigging."
msgstr "這個小惡棍在船上的索具裡感覺很自在。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_punk
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_punk"
msgid "Don't let the man get you down, man."
msgstr "兄弟， 別因為現實而感到頹廢。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rose"
msgid "The rosebuds are tangled in there real good."
msgstr "那麼玫瑰花苞纏在那兒可真好看啊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_rosep"
msgid "The rosebuds are tangled in there real good."
msgstr "那麼玫瑰花苞纏在那兒可真好看啊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadow"
msgid "Dark spiders have poisonous fangs."
msgstr "黑蜘蛛的爪子有毒。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_shadowp"
msgid "Dark spiders have poisonous fangs."
msgstr "黑蜘蛛的爪子有毒。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_spring"
msgid "Best leave the village rascal to run amok in the meadows."
msgstr "還是讓村裡的小搗蛋去草甸上撒野吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivor"
msgid "Webber looks a little worse for the wear."
msgstr "韋伯的衣服已經磨損得有點糟糕了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_survivorp"
msgid "Webber looks a little worse for the wear."
msgstr "韋伯的衣服已經磨損得有點糟糕了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_victorian"
msgid "This lively young lad has a most healthy pallor."
msgstr "這個活潑的小夥子有一張非常健康的蒼白面孔。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_wrestler"
msgid "Watch out for those luchadorable tiger claws."
msgstr "小心這些可愛的虎爪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.webber_yule"
msgid "Webber is the sweetest little spider you've ever seen!"
msgstr "韋伯是你見過最甜美的小蜘蛛！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ancient"
msgid "Don't be fooled by the look, Wendy is no sweet summer child."
msgstr "別被外表迷惑，溫蒂可不是天真的夏日孩童。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_combatant"
msgid "If Wendy is to succumb to death, she'll do so on her own terms."
msgstr "如果要溫蒂在死神面前屈服，那也必須得按她的方式才行。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_cook"
msgid "Wendy's not had much kitchen experience, but she's willing to learn."
msgstr "溫蒂的下廚經驗很有限，但她願意學習。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_creepy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_creepy"
msgid "Wendy's supernatural powers makes her a supernatural hero. Or villain."
msgstr "溫蒂的超能力使她成為超能英雄，或者超能惡人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formal"
msgid "Wendy is not cheered by party games."
msgstr "溫蒂並不喜歡聚會遊戲。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_formalp"
msgid "Wendy is not cheered by party games."
msgstr "溫蒂並不喜歡聚會遊戲。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_gladiator"
msgid "Wendy's hidden ruthlessness needed only slight provocation to show itself."
msgstr "只需稍加鼓動，就能把溫蒂隱藏的殘酷無情一面充分展露出來。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_handmedown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_handmedown"
msgid "These clothes were left behind, like Wendy herself."
msgstr "這些衣服像溫蒂一樣被留了下來。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_ice"
msgid "Wendy feels cold and ephemeral as season's first fallen snowflake."
msgstr "溫蒂覺得自己就像這個季節飄落的第一片雪花那樣寒冷而短暫。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lunar"
msgid "The cold, dark void of space seems to suit Wendy alarmingly well."
msgstr "寒冷、黑暗的宇宙似乎非常適合溫蒂。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant"
msgid "Wendyflower Costume"
msgstr "溫蒂花裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_d"
msgid "Wendy quite fancies this hair color."
msgstr "溫蒂很喜歡這種發色。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_lureplant_p"
msgid "Wendy quite fancies this hair color."
msgstr "溫蒂很喜歡這種發色。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_magma"
msgid "Wendy, like Abigail, will rise from the ashes."
msgstr "溫蒂也像阿比蓋爾一樣來自灰燼。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_masquerade"
msgid "Wendy delights in a look perfect for either ball or funeral."
msgstr "溫蒂喜歡這種既適合舞會又適合葬禮的造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_nature"
msgid "Wendy used to love reading fairy tales with her sister."
msgstr "溫蒂以前喜歡和她的姐妹一起讀童話故事。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_none"
msgid "The favored look of a morose young woman."
msgstr "憂鬱少女的原生態造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_pirate"
msgid "The sea is calling. Will you answer?"
msgstr "大海在呼喚。你要回答嗎？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rose"
msgid "A dark crimson rose represents mourning."
msgstr "一朵暗紅色的玫瑰代表哀傷。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_rosep"
msgid "A dark crimson rose represents mourning."
msgstr "一朵暗紅色的玫瑰代表哀傷。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadow"
msgid "Wendy has always been comfortable with darkness."
msgstr "溫蒂一直習慣黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_shadowp"
msgid "Wendy has always been comfortable with darkness."
msgstr "溫蒂一直習慣黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivor"
msgid "Wendy is actually pretty good at surviving."
msgstr "溫蒂確實很善於生存下來。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_survivorp"
msgid "Wendy is actually pretty good at surviving."
msgstr "溫蒂確實很善於生存下來。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_victorian"
msgid "Wendy is the queen of socially mandated mourning practices."
msgstr "在嚴格執行哀悼禮節方面，溫蒂絕對能稱王稱後。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wendy_yule"
msgid "Despite her dour demeanor, Wendy has a soft spot for the holidays."
msgstr "儘管溫蒂性格沉悶，但她對節日卻情有獨鍾。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_clown
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_clown"
msgid "A hopelessly romantic clown."
msgstr "一個浪漫得無可救藥的小丑。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_combatant"
msgid "Wes is quiet, but not meek."
msgstr "韋斯很安靜，但並不懦弱。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_cook"
msgid "Wes knows a meal's good when the whole table eats in silence."
msgstr "韋斯知道，如果在座的人全部靜靜地吃，就說明這頓飯很好吃。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formal"
msgid "Formal Wes requires extra pomade."
msgstr "拘于禮節的韋斯需要更多的發膏。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_formalp"
msgid "Formal Wes requires extra pomade."
msgstr "拘于禮節的韋斯需要更多的發膏。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_gladiator"
msgid "Beware the battle mime."
msgstr "一塊溫暖的戰場。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_harlequin
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_harlequin"
msgid "Keeping the Survivors' spirits up is a fool's errand... so naturally, the job falls to Wes."
msgstr "讓冒險家們保持精神充沛是愚人才會做的事情……所以這份工作自然落到了韋斯頭上。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_ice"
msgid "This spritely fellow is ready to get up to some chilly hijinks."
msgstr "這傢伙精神抖擻，又準備玩點冬天的把戲了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_lunar"
msgid "Wes has been elevated from common fool to lunar liege."
msgstr "韋斯已經從普通小丑升格為月亮領主。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_magma"
msgid "By day, a refined French mime. By night, a formidable swordsmime."
msgstr "白天是一名精緻的法式默劇演員。夜晚是一位高超的劍客。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake"
msgid "Wesdrake Costume"
msgstr "韋斯德雷克裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_d"
msgid "What's the sound of one mandrake meeping?"
msgstr "曼德拉草會發出怎樣的聲音？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_mandrake_p"
msgid "What's the sound of one mandrake meeping?"
msgstr "曼德拉草會發出怎樣的聲音？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_masquerade"
msgid "This poor party guest seems too shy to join in any conversation."
msgstr "這個可憐的聚會客人似乎過於害羞，從不加入任何談話。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_nature"
msgid "Wes is an avid landscape painter in his downtime."
msgstr "韋斯在業餘時間非常熱衷於創作風景畫。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_none"
msgid "Quintessential mime attire."
msgstr "經典的小丑裝。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_pirate"
msgid "Wes is a natural at finding treasure chests... unfortunately, they all seem to be invisible."
msgstr "韋斯找起寶箱來十分自然……可惜這些寶箱似乎都是看不見的。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rose"
msgid "Wes always felt his rosy cheeks were his best feature."
msgstr "韋斯總覺得他那粉紅的臉頰是自己最棒的特點。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_rosep"
msgid "Wes always felt his rosy cheeks were his best feature."
msgstr "韋斯總覺得他那粉紅的臉頰是自己最棒的特點。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadow"
msgid "The sun is too bright. It blots out the darkness."
msgstr "太陽太耀眼。它消除了黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_shadowp"
msgid "The sun is too bright. It blots out the darkness."
msgstr "太陽太耀眼。它消除了黑暗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivor"
msgid "Even mimes can fight if confronted with a monster."
msgstr "遇到怪獸時，就連默劇演員也有作戰力。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_survivorp"
msgid "Even mimes can fight if confronted with a monster."
msgstr "遇到怪獸時，就連默劇演員也有作戰力。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_victorian"
msgid "This sweep's work is quite grueling. He'd prefer not to talk about it."
msgstr "這項打掃工作太煎熬了。他都不願意提起了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_western
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_western"
msgid "Here's to the quiet courage of one who leads a raging beefalo away from his friends."
msgstr "致敬那種默默為朋友們引開發狂皮弗婁牛的孤勇。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_wrestler
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_wrestler"
msgid "Wes is the ultimate babyface."
msgstr "韋斯長了一張好人臉。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wes_yule"
msgid "Wes is looking his best elf self."
msgstr "韋斯這套精靈裝扮十分英俊。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.whip_snapthorn
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.whip_snapthorn"
msgid "Harness the fury of the jungle."
msgstr "駕馭叢林的怒火。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_combatant"
msgid "Wickerbottom is not opposed to self defense, should the occasion call for it."
msgstr "該自我防衛的時候，薇克巴頓絕不手軟。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_cook"
msgid "Wickerbottom has several cookbooks for just such an occasion."
msgstr "薇克巴頓針對一種場合的食譜就有好幾本。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formal"
msgid "Since Wickerbottom doesn't sleep, she can dance all night."
msgstr "薇克巴頓睡不著。她可以一整夜都在跳舞。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_formalp"
msgid "Since Wickerbottom doesn't sleep, she can dance all night."
msgstr "薇克巴頓睡不著。她可以一整夜都在跳舞。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_gladiator"
msgid "Wickerbottom adapted to life in the arena with grace and ease."
msgstr "薇克巴頓以優雅平和的方式適應了競技場裡的日子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ice"
msgid "It would be wise not to get on the queen of winter's bad side."
msgstr "不跟冬季女王作對，才是明智之舉。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat"
msgid "Ms. Voltbottom Costume"
msgstr "伏特巴頓女士裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_d"
msgid "An elegant costume for an elegant woman."
msgstr "優雅女性的優雅裝束。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lightninggoat_p"
msgid "An elegant costume for an elegant woman."
msgstr "優雅女性的優雅裝束。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_lunar"
msgid "The moon has allowed Wickerbottom to see things from a new perspective."
msgstr "月亮讓薇克巴頓能夠從新的角度看待事物。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_magma"
msgid "Wickerbottom saves her wrath for those who besmirch the Dewey Decimal System."
msgstr "薇克巴頓把怒火留給那些褻瀆了杜威十進位圖書分類法的人們。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_masquerade"
msgid "With Ms. Wickerbottom, class is always in session."
msgstr "對於薇克巴頓女士來說，優雅時刻線上。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_nature"
msgid "If knowledge of medicinal herbs and natural remedies makes one a witch, Wickerbottom fits the bill."
msgstr "如果說懂藥草和自然療法的就是女巫，那麼薇克巴頓顯然符合這個條件。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_none"
msgid "A timeless look for an accomplished librarian."
msgstr "優秀圖書管理員的經典造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ornate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_ornate"
msgid "Wickerbottom might have penned a novella or two, back in her wilder days."
msgstr "薇克巴頓在狂野時期曾經寫過一兩部中篇小說。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_pirate"
msgid "Some of the fiercest women to terrorize the seas were scholars as well."
msgstr "最兇狠的女海盜中不乏學者的身影。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rose"
msgid "Now duel for the rose queen's amusement."
msgstr "現在，為了取悅玫瑰女王而決鬥吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_rosep"
msgid "Now duel for the rose queen's amusement."
msgstr "現在，為了取悅玫瑰女王而決鬥吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadow"
msgid "A librarian knows how to watch from the shadows."
msgstr "圖書管理員知道怎樣從暗影處觀察。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_shadowp"
msgid "A librarian knows how to watch from the shadows."
msgstr "圖書管理員知道怎樣從暗影處觀察。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_spiderwitch
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_spiderwitch"
msgid "Wickerbottom the Spider Witch is here to spin you a yarn... or maybe a web."
msgstr "蜘蛛女巫薇克巴頓會給你織卷毛線……或者一個蜘蛛網。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivor"
msgid "Those with knowledge are good at making do in difficult circumstances."
msgstr "這些有識之士善於在危難之際解決問題。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_survivorp"
msgid "Those with knowledge are good at making do in difficult circumstances."
msgstr "這些有識之士善於在危難之際解決問題。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_victorian"
msgid "How did Ms. Wickerbottom accrue her fortune? Perhaps you should mind your own business."
msgstr "薇克巴頓女士的財富是如何積累起來的呢？也許你應該少管閒事。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wickerbottom_yule"
msgid "You think organizing a Winter's Feast party is hard? Try working in a public library."
msgstr "你認為組織冬季盛宴派對很難嗎？那是你沒在公共圖書館工作過。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ancient"
msgid "Perhaps this outfit will spark an interest in history."
msgstr "也許這套服裝會激發觀眾對歷史的興趣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_combatant"
msgid "Willow was never one to be pushed around."
msgstr "永遠不要對薇洛吆五喝六。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_cook"
msgid "Chef Willow is a grease fire waiting to happen."
msgstr "薇洛大廚已經迫不及待想要生火了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dowdy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dowdy"
msgid "Willow can't be bothered to try to look nice."
msgstr "薇洛懶得假裝親切。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly"
msgid "Willowfly Costume"
msgstr "薇洛小蝶裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_d"
msgid "Willow would dress like this every day if she could."
msgstr "如果可以的話，薇洛每天都會穿成這樣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_dragonfly_p"
msgid "Willow would dress like this every day if she could."
msgstr "如果可以的話，薇洛每天都會穿成這樣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formal"
msgid "Willow prefers events that include bonfires or fireworks."
msgstr "薇洛偏愛有篝火或煙花這類的活動。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_formalp"
msgid "Willow prefers events that include bonfires or fireworks."
msgstr "薇洛偏愛有篝火或煙花這類的活動。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_gladiator"
msgid "Willow will reduce this ring to cinders."
msgstr "薇洛會把決鬥圈本身都燒成渣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_haunteddoll
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_haunteddoll"
msgid "This once-sweet doll was abandoned by her child and has since become a vessel of bitterness and resentment."
msgstr "這個曾經乖巧的玩偶自從被上一個孩子丟棄後，就黑化成了仇恨和痛苦的化身。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_ice"
msgid "Coldfire is Willow's favorite type of fire... After hot fire, warm fire, tepid fire, and vaguely lukewarm fire."
msgstr "冰火差不多是薇洛最喜歡的一種火...僅次於熱火、暖火、溫火和微溫火。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_lunar"
msgid "Flames burn brightest on the darkest of nights."
msgstr "火焰在最黑暗的夜晚燃燒得最旺盛。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_magma"
msgid "Willow has never been so at home."
msgstr "薇洛感到前所未有的自在。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_masquerade"
msgid "This masked party-goer has a dangerous spark in her eyes..."
msgstr "這個戴面具的派對參加者眼中閃爍著危險的火花……"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_nature"
msgid "Willow's idea of a harvest mostly revolves around gathering kindling."
msgstr "薇洛認為收穫主要就是收集柴火。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_none"
msgid "A typical look for someone with fire on the brain."
msgstr "火焰女孩的經典造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_pirate"
msgid "It would be wise to keep Willow far away from the ship's gunpowder stores."
msgstr "還是讓薇洛離船上的火藥艙遠一點比較安全。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rose"
msgid "Willow was always a bit prickly. Now she's just more so."
msgstr "薇洛本來就有點扎手，現在更紮了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_rosep"
msgid "Willow was always a bit prickly. Now she's just more so."
msgstr "薇洛本來就有點扎手，現在更紮了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadow"
msgid "Willow enjoys flickering flames of inky blackness."
msgstr "薇洛喜歡暗黑中出現的閃爍火焰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_shadowp"
msgid "Willow enjoys flickering flames of inky blackness."
msgstr "薇洛喜歡暗黑中出現的閃爍火焰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_spring"
msgid "Willow blends in with the villagers to remain beyond suspicion."
msgstr "薇洛混在村民中，只為掩人耳目。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivor"
msgid "Willow is taming the wilderness with fire."
msgstr "薇洛正用火馴服荒野。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_survivorp"
msgid "Willow is taming the wilderness with fire."
msgstr "薇洛正用火馴服荒野。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_victorian"
msgid "Willow doesn't just play with matches... she also peddles them."
msgstr "薇洛不只是會玩火柴...她還賣火柴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.willow_yule"
msgid "Willow is ready to roast some chestnuts... and anything else she can get her hands on, really."
msgstr "薇洛準備烤栗子了……大家是知道她的，但凡落到她手裡，她總想……"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_barber
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_barber"
msgid "Some might find this barber's methods a bit too experimental for their comfort."
msgstr "有人可能會發現這名理髮師的手法太偏實驗性，會讓顧客感到不舒服。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_barber
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_barber"
msgid "Somehow, even in the wilderness, Wilson manages to maintain a neatly trimmed beard and a waxed moustache."
msgstr "不知何故，即使在野外，威爾遜也能保持修剪整齊的鬍鬚和打過蠟的小鬍子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_formal"
msgid "It's important that Wilson keeps his beard honorable when things get hairy."
msgstr "情況不對的時候，威爾遜必須保持鬍鬚的莊嚴。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_gladiator"
msgid "Wilson's got the chops for fighting in the ring... the mutton chops, anyway."
msgstr "威爾遜有在拳擊場裡一戰的能力…… 他的秘密武器是羊排。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_ice"
msgid "It's hard for Wilson to arctic-ulate how much he loves his beard."
msgstr "威爾遜對於鬍子的熱愛一點都不冷冰冰。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_lunar"
msgid "The awe-inspiring wonders of space pale in comparison to Wilson's beard."
msgstr "即便是太空中令人敬畏的奇跡，對比了威爾遜的鬍鬚後，也顯得相形見絀。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_madscience
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_madscience"
msgid "The shock of white is the result of one of Wilson's more electrifying experiments."
msgstr "這種白色的衝擊是威爾遜的一個大型電力試驗的結果。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_magma"
msgid "A sizzling 'stache and beard to match!"
msgstr "火熱的上嘴唇鬍子和下嘴唇鬍子十分搭配！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_masquerade"
msgid "Who is the gentleman hiding behind that magnificent beard?"
msgstr "隱藏在華麗鬍鬚背後的紳士是誰？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_nature"
msgid "What is a beard if not a topiary for your face?"
msgstr "如果鬍子不能裝飾臉部，那還有什麼用？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_pigguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_pigguard"
msgid "Wilson takes great pride in the hairs on his chinny chin chin."
msgstr "威爾遜對自己下巴上的毛髮感到非常自豪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_pirate"
msgid "It is either a bold or foolish pirate who flaunts his gold so openly."
msgstr "如此公開炫耀自己的黃金的海盜要麼是大膽，要麼是愚蠢。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_rose"
msgid "Wilson picks flowery facial accessories when he's feeling pastoral."
msgstr "威爾遜想要歸隱田園時，就會挑選一些鮮花款的面部飾品。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_shadow"
msgid "Wilson's hair-raising experiments have led to a grey-streaked beard."
msgstr "威爾遜的生髮實驗導致他長出了花白鬍子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_spring"
msgid "A beard in bloom."
msgstr "開花的鬍鬚。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_survivor"
msgid "This beard is scientifically proven to smell horrible."
msgstr "科學證明這把鬍鬚很難聞。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_victorian"
msgid "Fashionable facial hair for gentleman scientist types."
msgstr "紳士科學家的時尚鬍子。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_beard_yule"
msgid "Wilson is berry proud of his holiday beard."
msgstr "威爾遜為他的節日鬍鬚感到自豪。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_combatant"
msgid "This wouldn't be the first time Wilson's had to fight off a goon or two."
msgstr "威爾遜也不是第一次幹翻一兩個雜兵了。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_cook"
msgid "Wilson's had a lot of experience cooking with found ingredients."
msgstr "威爾遜用找到的食材積累了豐富的下廚經驗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formal"
msgid "Formal Wilson is unhappy Wilson."
msgstr "拘於禮節的威爾遜是不開心的威爾遜。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_formalp"
msgid "Formal Wilson is unhappy Wilson."
msgstr "拘於禮節的威爾遜是不開心的威爾遜。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_gladiator"
msgid "Wilson is willing to take on any challenger."
msgstr "威爾遜願意面對任何挑戰者。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_hazard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_hazard"
msgid "Disclaimer: Provides no protection against toxic hazards or personalities."
msgstr "免責聲明：對有毒物品和有毒人品不提供任何保護。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_ice
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_ice"
msgid "The chill of the first frost of winter has beset poor Wilson."
msgstr "冬季第一場冰霜的寒冷困擾著可憐的威爾遜。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_lunar
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_lunar"
msgid "Wilson doesn't just moonlight as a scientist, he's determined to be a star in his field."
msgstr "威爾遜可不只是下班後的科學家，他立志要成為科學明星。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_madscience
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_madscience"
msgid "Watch out! He knows SCIENCE and he's not afraid to use it."
msgstr "小心！他懂科學，而且敢利用科學。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_magma
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_magma"
msgid "Ready for the b-assault."
msgstr "準備接受猛烈的襲擊吧。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_masquerade
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_masquerade"
msgid "This gentleman has carefully chosen each element of his outfit to get a strong reaction."
msgstr "這位紳士精心挑選了服裝的每一個元素，以獲得強烈的反應。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_nature
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_nature"
msgid "A scientist must be prepared to get their hands dirty from time to time."
msgstr "科學家必須隨時準備好弄髒雙手。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_none
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_none"
msgid "A look that says \"gentleman scientist\"."
msgstr "紳士科學家的造型。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard"
msgid "Piggsbury Costume"
msgstr "芒刺豬裝束"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_d"
msgid "Wilson usually forgets to put a costume together until the last moment. He's always busy experimenting."
msgstr "威爾遜通常到最後關頭才想起要配好裝束。他總是忙著做實驗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_p
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pigguard_p"
msgid "Wilson usually forgets to put a costume together until the last moment. He's always busy experimenting."
msgstr "威爾遜通常到最後關頭才想起要配好裝束。他總是忙著做實驗。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_pirate"
msgid "Some pirates are motivated by gold, others by curiosity."
msgstr "有些人成為海盜的動機是黃金，有些則是出於好奇心。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rose"
msgid "Who knew rose dye was so permanent?"
msgstr "誰知道玫瑰染料能這麼持久呢？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rosep
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_rosep"
msgid "Who knew rose dye was so permanent?"
msgstr "誰知道玫瑰染料能這麼持久呢？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadow"
msgid "Wilson has learned the science of shadows."
msgstr "威爾遜已經學會了暗影技術。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadowp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_shadowp"
msgid "Wilson has learned the science of shadows."
msgstr "威爾遜已經學會了暗影技術。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_spring
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_spring"
msgid "Wilson is the village's greatest (and only) scientist."
msgstr "威爾遜是村裡最偉大（也是唯一）的科學家。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivor"
msgid "As a scientist, Wilson is well equipped to investigate the natural world."
msgstr "作為科學家，威爾遜整齊裝備，準備探索大自然世界。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivorp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_survivorp"
msgid "As a scientist, Wilson is well equipped to investigate the natural world."
msgstr "作為科學家，威爾遜整齊裝備，準備探索大自然世界。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_victorian
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_victorian"
msgid "Wilson is a major advocate of the health benefits of leeches."
msgstr "威爾遜大力提倡螞蟥有益健康。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_yule
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.wilson_yule"
msgid "Wilson is all dressed up for the holly days."
msgstr "威爾遜為冬日慶典盛裝打扮。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winch_pirate
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winch_pirate"
msgid "Pilfer the sea for loot."
msgstr "掠奪海上的戰利品。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_20s
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_20s"
msgid "The most industrious person is often the one who dances the hardest when the music starts."
msgstr "音樂響起時最盡興的舞者往往是最勤勞的那個人。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_ancient
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_ancient"
msgid "Even forward-thinkers can find themselves dwelling on the past."
msgstr "即使是思想超前的人也難免沉湎於過去。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_fancy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_fancy"
msgid "The most stylish way to smash your foes to smithereens."
msgstr "將敵人粉碎成碎片的最時尚方式。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_item_fancy
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_item_fancy"
msgid "The most stylish way to smash your foes to smithereens."
msgstr "將敵人粉碎成碎片的最時尚方式。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_item_spike
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_item_spike"
msgid "Unleash mayhem with this menacing machine."
msgstr "用這台險惡的機器製造混亂。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_spike
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_catapult_spike"
msgid "Unleash mayhem with this menacing machine."
msgstr "用這台險惡的機器製造混亂。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_combatant"
msgid "Winona came ready for a fight!"
msgstr "薇諾娜準備好大打一場了！"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_cook
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_cook"
msgid "Cooking is basically just food assembly, right?"
msgstr "烹飪基本上就是把食物組裝起來，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_factory
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_factory"
msgid "When all signs pointed towards the Voxola Radio Company, Winona knew what she had to do."
msgstr "所有跡象都表明沃柯拉廣播公司有巨大的嫌疑，薇諾娜暗暗拿定了主意。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formal"
msgid "This isn't what Winona expected when she read \"Formal Assembly\" on the invitation."
msgstr "薇諾娜看到邀請函上的\"正式集會\"時，可沒想到會這樣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formalp
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_formalp"
msgid "This isn't what Winona expected when she read \"Formal Assembly\" on the invitation."
msgstr "薇諾娜看到邀請函上的\"正式集會\"時，可沒想到會這樣。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_frankenstein
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_frankenstein"
msgid "Winona likes to stick to the classics."
msgstr "薇諾娜喜歡經典款。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator
msgctxt "STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_gladiator"
msgid "Winona's tough as nails and ready to throw down."
msgstr "薇諾娜就像釘子一樣喜歡硬碰硬，隨時準備幹一架。"

#. STRINGS.SKIN_DESCRIPTIONS.winona_grassgecko
